{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Energy", "line": "I got people talkin’ down, man, like I give a fuck I bought this one a purse, I bought this one a truck I bought this one a house, I bought this one a mall I keep buyin’ shit, just make sure you keep track of it all", "vault_lines": ["I got people talkin' down, man, like I give a fuck", "I bought this one a purse, I bought this one a truck", "I bought this one a house, I bought this one a mall", "I keep buyin' shit, just make sure you keep track of it all", "I got enemies, got a lot of enemies"], "meaning": "Drake doesn’t care about the people who are talking bad on his name because he’s gotten so rich he can buy his friends anything they desire. This includes:\n\npurses\ntrucks\nhouses\nand even goddamn MALLS!\n\nDrake buys so much you really need to work your ass of to keep track of it all", "annotation_id": "36018878", "url": "https://genius.com/36018878", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Energy", "line": "[Post-Chorus: Michel’le & Drake] He was once a thug— He was, he— He was once a thug— He was, he— (Yeah) He was once a thug— He was, he— (Yeah) He was once—", "vault_lines": ["He was once a thug—"], "meaning": "This line was sampled from Eazy-E 1988 track “Eazy-Duz-It”:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wFLFIEB2Yrk", "annotation_id": "34455761", "url": "https://genius.com/34455761", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
