{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Energy", "line": "Ex-girl, she the female version of me I got strippers in my life, but they virgins to me", "vault_lines": ["Ex-girl, she the female version of me", "I got strippers in my life, but they virgins to me"], "meaning": "IMO “Ex-Girl” = Zoe Kravits\n“Female Version of me”\n* Light-Skinned\n* Pretty\n* Musically Talented\n* Both Credited Actors\n\nHis relationship w Zoe was also more recent than the one with Maliah Michel.", "annotation_id": "7657363", "url": "https://genius.com/7657363", "state": "verified", "votes": 30, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Energy", "line": "I’m tryna tell ya I got enemies, got a lot of enemies Every time I see ‘em, somethin’ wrong with their memory", "vault_lines": ["I'm tryna tell ya I got enemies, got a lot of enemies", "Every time I see 'em, somethin' wrong with their memory", "I got enemies, got a lot of enemies"], "meaning": "what drake is trying to say is that he has people taking about him and saying so many mean stuff but he has better life and money than his enemies.", "annotation_id": "7633571", "url": "https://genius.com/7633571", "state": "verified", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Energy", "line": "I got enemies, got a lot of enemies Got a lot of people tryna drain me of my energy They tryna take the wave from a nigga Fuckin’ with the kid and pray for your nigga", "vault_lines": ["Got a lot of people tryna drain me of this energy", "I'm tryna tell ya I got enemies, got a lot of enemies", "Tryna take the wave from a nigga", "I got enemies, got a lot of enemies", "Got a lot of people tryna drain me of my energy", "They tryna take the wave from a nigga", "Fuckin' with the kid and pray for your nigga"], "meaning": "Correcton for line 3 in the first Hook 1:\n\n“They tryna TAKE the wave from a nigga”\n\nIt originally says:\n“They tryna the wave from a nigga”\n\nMakes no sense", "annotation_id": "7618848", "url": "https://genius.com/7618848", "state": "verified", "votes": 57, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Energy", "line": "[Verse 1: Drake]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Drizzy begins the song in his trademark confessional manner, highlighting otherwise personal topics such as his homies stuck back home, manipulative girls, his finances, and dealing with unworthy competition.\n\nDrake spoke about his tendency to utilise his songs as answers to questions he wouldn’t usually talk about in interviews since he “doesn’t do those anymore.”", "annotation_id": "6714749", "url": "https://genius.com/6714749", "state": "accepted", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Energy", "line": "I hear everybody talkin’ ‘bout what they gon’ be I got high hopes for you niggas, we gon’ see", "vault_lines": ["I hear everybody talkin' 'bout what they gon' be", "I got high hopes for you niggas, we gon' see"], "meaning": "More broadly, Drake is speaking to his incredible success at a young age. Most people in their 20s talk about what they’re gonna be “when they’re older”. Young people change jobs more frequently and often get paid less. On the other hand, at only 28, no one is asking Drake “What are you gonna be when you’re older?”\n\nHe’s already made it.", "annotation_id": "5022193", "url": "https://genius.com/5022193", "state": "verified", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Energy", "line": "I got real shit poppin’ with my family too I got niggas that can never leave Canada too (6ix)", "vault_lines": ["I got real shit poppin' with my family too", "I got niggas that can never leave Canada too (6ix)"], "meaning": "One of Drake’s close Canadian friends P Reign is unable to cross the USA border due to past charges\nhttps://instagram.com/p/zBwG16uqW1/?modal=true", "annotation_id": "5016650", "url": "https://genius.com/5016650", "state": "verified", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
