{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "It’s my fault for once, don’t keep you grounded on your feet", "vault_lines": ["It's my fault, it's my fault, for once I take accountability", "It's my fault that you got superpowers on your knees", "It's my fault for once, don't keep you grounded on your feet", "It's my fault for once, it's one-sided loyalty", "It's my fault, it's my fault", "You don't play, you don't, you don't, you"], "meaning": "From extravagant trips to Ibiza and Dubai in air Drake. We see Drake take accountability for enabling her behavior. Instead of providing grounding words of wisdom he flys her to anywhere she wants to go. Which in the end back fired cause she took flight from his life.", "annotation_id": "41767262", "url": "https://genius.com/41767262", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "Know you got my confidence on sale Case you wanna feel better ’bout yourself", "vault_lines": ["Know you got my confidence on sale", "Case you wanna feel better 'bout yourself"], "meaning": "Got my confidence on sale\": “On sale” means something is cheapened or discounted. Drake is saying he has lowered his own defenses, pride, and ego—making his confidence easily accessible for her to take or strip away.\n “‘Case you wanna feel better 'bout yourself”: He suggests his partner suffers from low self-esteem or insecurity. To fix that, she tears him down or uses his vulnerability to elevate herself.", "annotation_id": "40992527", "url": "https://genius.com/40992527", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "Burnin’ cash like it’s lit on fire", "vault_lines": ["Burnin' cash like it's lit on fire"], "meaning": "“Burning cash” means to recklessly spend and waste lots of money without a care.", "annotation_id": "40912800", "url": "https://genius.com/40912800", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
