{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "I got the Wagon, G", "vault_lines": ["It's my fault for once, I got the Wagon, G"], "meaning": "A G-Wagon is short for the Mercedes-Benz G-Class, a boxy, powerful luxury SUV that’s often used in rap as a symbol of wealth and status.\n\nDrake is also publicly known to own Mercedes-Maybach vehicles, which are even more luxurious.", "annotation_id": "38258797", "url": "https://genius.com/38258797", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "I’m always gon’ keep it a buck", "vault_lines": ["I'm always gon' keep it a buck"], "meaning": "Drake is saying he will always be honest and real.\n\nThe slang idiom “to keep it a buck”, emphasizes that no matter what happens, he stays true to himself and speaks the truth. It’s about loyalty to his own values and authenticity.", "annotation_id": "38258771", "url": "https://genius.com/38258771", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "Your funeral is finna have like ten caskets on display One for you, the other nine for everything you’re takin’ to the grave", "vault_lines": ["The one you subtweet", "Your funeral is finna have like ten caskets on display", "One for you, the other nine for everything you're takin' to the grave"], "meaning": "The girl mentioned has so many secrets, lies, and hidden issues that when they die, it won’t just be them in the coffin—they’ll need to be nine extra caskets just to hold everything they’ve kept on the low or lied about. It remarks how heavy their hidden truth is.", "annotation_id": "37621432", "url": "https://genius.com/37621432", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "’Cause you know that you’re mine and it’s my fault", "vault_lines": ["'Cause you know that you're mine and it's my fault", "It's my fault, it's my fault"], "meaning": "Because this woman knows that Drake will finance her lifestyle, she has become spoiled, and it is Drake’s fault for being a provider.", "annotation_id": "36860702", "url": "https://genius.com/36860702", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
