{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "I like it, but I’m too geeked, tryna turn you up", "vault_lines": ["I like it, but I'm too geeked, tryna turn you up", "You're misreadin' me, I'm too geeked, tryna turn you up", "Sayin' I could die tryna turn you up", "But I turn you up"], "meaning": "Drake enjoys providing for women and bankrolling their life, at least to some degree. But he is too “geeked” in this effort to provide women with nice things (turn them up).", "annotation_id": "36860692", "url": "https://genius.com/36860692", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "Condo, third week", "vault_lines": ["I gotta stop goin' Van Cleef, condo, third week"], "meaning": "Drake is quick to provide women with nice things, like putting them up in condos within 3 weeks of meeting them. He knows he has to chill.", "annotation_id": "36860675", "url": "https://genius.com/36860675", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
