{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "Her stomach is flat as fuck She still fit that shit in her gut somehow The fat musta went in her butt somehow I don’t even ask her what’s up", "vault_lines": ["Hеr stomach is flat as fuck", "She still fit that shit in her gut somehow", "The fat musta went in her butt somehow", "I don't even ask her what's up", "She sayin' that shit is natural", "I think, think that I"], "meaning": "This woman has a flat stomach because of her BBL surgery, where fat pads were moved from her stomach to her ass. Drake doesn’t care, and doesn’t bother to mention this to her.", "annotation_id": "36860662", "url": "https://genius.com/36860662", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "My album was payin’ her bills I don’t even need a deluxe", "vault_lines": ["Her photos don't need a retouch", "My album was payin' her bills", "I don't еven need a deluxe"], "meaning": "The proceeds from Drake’s recent release are enough to finance this woman’s lifestyle. Other artists may have to be a bit more creative with roll outs to increase their discretionary budgets, but not Drake.", "annotation_id": "36860655", "url": "https://genius.com/36860655", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
