{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "Leave your phone, come to mine You’ll catch a hint in due time", "vault_lines": ["Leave your phone, come to mine", "You'll catch a hint in due time"], "meaning": "This girl that Drake wants to come over already has a boyfriend, likely with her location shared. Drake is saying she should leave her phone at home before coming so that he cannot track her.\n\nThe correct lyric is *he’ll catch a hint in due time, implying that because she is not responding (her phone is at home while she’s out with Drake), he will get the memo that she is out with another man (in this case, Drake)", "annotation_id": "36860509", "url": "https://genius.com/36860509", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "She sayin’ that shit is natural Don’t care if she makin’ it up", "vault_lines": ["She sayin' that shit is natural", "Don't care if she makin' it up"], "meaning": "Said woman claims her body is natural (not a result of surgery) Drake says she looks so good he doesn’t even care that she’s lying. Drake has claimed to prefer the natural look before:\nIn Jimmy Cooks he said “Love the way they hang, babe, fuck the silicone”\nBut his dating history tells a different story", "annotation_id": "36313678", "url": "https://genius.com/36313678", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "Tryna be the one for you, but my nickname true", "vault_lines": ["Tryna be the one for you, but my nickname true", "The one you subtweet"], "meaning": "Savage claims that he loves this girl and genuinely values her more than any other woman who may just want him for his success. However, growing up in the environment he did savage did not learn to commit to woman and still struggles with loyalty to this day, hence the name, savage", "annotation_id": "35591335", "url": "https://genius.com/35591335", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hours In Silence", "line": "My fault for once, I’m payin’ lawyer fees", "vault_lines": ["My fault for once, I'm payin' lawyer fees", "It's my fault, it's my fault"], "meaning": "Drake reportedly paid Mirna Habib’s lawyer fees and the restitution she was ordered to pay (the latter amounting to $683,243.23) after she pled guilty to one count of aggravated identity theft.", "annotation_id": "35322320", "url": "https://genius.com/35322320", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
