{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Special", "line": "Now they got the new boy, I’m trying to move forward", "vault_lines": ["Now they got the new boy, I'm trying to move forward", "I'm fire on the move"], "meaning": "What Drake is meaning by saying\n\n“Now they got the new boy, I’m trying to move forward\nAnd pass me, classy, something like Drew Lord”\n\nIs that he is sad to see his old girls with new boyfreinds, and he trys to forget about them, and gets a littel help trying to hide away his sadnes by drinking alcohol.", "annotation_id": "31607736", "url": "https://genius.com/31607736", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
