{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Special", "line": "I’m hopin that ain’t nobody else as special as you When I say I’ve been disappointed I’m addressing a few", "vault_lines": ["When I say I've been disappointed I'm addressing a few", "I'm hopin that ain't nobody else as special as you"], "meaning": "This is Drake saying, that he hopes his new girl is the one, becuase he has been with a lot of girls but they just weren’t it.", "annotation_id": "31607497", "url": "https://genius.com/31607497", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Special", "line": "Uh look, I’m bold from the get go, go by the title of Drake And treating me like the rest is a vital mistake", "vault_lines": ["Uh look, I'm bold from the get go, go by the title of Drake", "And treating me like the rest is a vital mistake"], "meaning": "This is Drake saying, he is always ready for whatever and you shouldn’t F##k with him, he is also kinda presenting himself.", "annotation_id": "31607375", "url": "https://genius.com/31607375", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
