{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Calling For You", "line": "Shawty still young, so she don’t know the classics", "vault_lines": ["Shawty still young, so she don't know the classics"], "meaning": "Because Milly Bobby Brown was 13 when they started hanging out meaning she was too young to know music from drakes generation", "annotation_id": "38035842", "url": "https://genius.com/38035842", "state": "pending", "votes": -11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Calling For You", "line": "Put a college bitch in a Benz (21) Put her in the Benz, no note (21)", "vault_lines": ["Put a college bitch in a Benz (21)", "Put her in the Benz, no note (21)"], "meaning": "A “car note” is the monthly payment on a car loan. 21 is flexing that he will buy the woman a Mercedes Benz (an expensive luxury vehicle), and is so wealthy he will buy the car outright, without a car loan that has a monthly “note”.", "annotation_id": "37526021", "url": "https://genius.com/37526021", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Calling For You", "line": "All of my kids get left in her mouth, she say she don’t believe in abortions (21)", "vault_lines": ["All of my kids get left in her mouth, she say she don't believe in abortions (21)"], "meaning": "The woman 21 is with has a moral objection to the termination of a pregnancy. So instead of finishing inside the woman which can cause pregnancies, 21 instead finishes in her mouth from oral sex, leaving his kids (semen) in her mouth so the woman is not required to deal with the effects of a possible pregnancy.", "annotation_id": "37526006", "url": "https://genius.com/37526006", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Calling For You", "line": "The bitches that come around suck dick and don’t pull they phone out, dem ones pros", "vault_lines": ["The bitches that come around suck dick and don't pull they phone out, dem ones pros (On God)"], "meaning": "21 is saying that too many women that he wants to have relations with are constantly obsessed with broadcasting everything on social media.\n\nHowever, he is giving a nod to the girls that do not do this.", "annotation_id": "36860444", "url": "https://genius.com/36860444", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
