{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Calling For You", "line": "And I got a chance with the bitch Loverboy, romance with the bitch Couldn’t even put my mans on a bitch Like, damn", "vault_lines": ["And I got a chance with the bitch", "Loverboy, romance with the bitch", "Couldn't even put my mans on a bitch"], "meaning": "Drake refers to himself as “loverboy”, a reference to his sixth studio album “Certified Lover Boy”. Because he is interested in this girl, he wants to take the time to be romantic (“romance” her), rather than pass her off to one of his friends and let him have her (“put my mans on”).\nHe instead plans to pursue her himself because he views her so highly, surprising even himself, (“like damn”).", "annotation_id": "36388167", "url": "https://genius.com/36388167", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
