{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Calling For You", "line": "Out in Miami, you still a one-of-one (Tss)", "vault_lines": ["Out in Miami, you still a one-of-one (Tss)"], "meaning": "Baby M lived in Miami before she moved back to Toronto, and Drake is saying that even in Miami where it’s filled with beautiful women, she still stands out from the others and no one else compares.", "annotation_id": "30028743", "url": "https://genius.com/30028743", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
