{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Trump Tower", "line": "Keep asking for a day from them but who knows", "vault_lines": ["Keep asking for a day from them but who knows"], "meaning": "Mirna Habib (Baby M), was incarcerated at the time of this songs’ leak. Drake has asked about a release date but who knows if they’ll get back to him.", "annotation_id": "37249434", "url": "https://genius.com/37249434", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
