{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Lord Knows", "line": "I changed rap forever, the game back together, yeah", "vault_lines": ["I changed rap forever, the game back together, yeah"], "meaning": "Drake boosted the popularity of the subgenre of pop-rap to the billions. Though a lot of argument states that his variation of pop-rap is the worst thing to happen to the industry, its influence is out there for sure.", "annotation_id": "35552228", "url": "https://genius.com/35552228", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Lord Knows", "line": "I run the game, but the ladies think I’m runnin’ game", "vault_lines": ["I run the game, but the ladies think I'm runnin' game"], "meaning": "To be running the game is to dominate the rap leaderboards, but to be running game from the female perspective is most probably to accept sexual favors.", "annotation_id": "35552203", "url": "https://genius.com/35552203", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
