{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Fancy", "line": "In the bathroom flat irons and nail files Spendin’ hours in salons on your hairstyle", "vault_lines": ["In the bathroom flat irons and nail files", "Spendin' hours in salons on your hairstyle"], "meaning": "way to show the girls' commitment to beauty and the amount of work it takes to achieve a polished look.", "annotation_id": "37775181", "url": "https://genius.com/37775181", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Fancy", "line": "Uh, you gettin’ ready so I know we gon’ be here awhile", "vault_lines": ["Uh, you gettin' ready so I know we gon' be here awhile"], "meaning": "bc girls take a long time to get ready!\n\nDrizzy is a lyrical genius", "annotation_id": "37775168", "url": "https://genius.com/37775168", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Fancy", "line": "(Come on) And my TO girls (Right), let me see your hands", "vault_lines": ["Atlanta girls (Woo), let me see your hands (Yeah)", "And my NY girls (Woo), let me see your hands", "And my LA girls (Oh), let me see your hands (Bounce)", "(Come on) And my TO girls (Right), let me see your hands"], "meaning": "Drake is from Toronto- shouting out the women from his own city in this line.", "annotation_id": "36914338", "url": "https://genius.com/36914338", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Fancy", "line": "Naked ring finger, M3 Bimmer", "vault_lines": ["Naked ring finger, M3 Bimmer"], "meaning": "TI is impressed and notices that this girl is not married and has an M3 Bimmer to herself and herself only, without the help of a man.\nTo put it short, he finds her independence very appealing.", "annotation_id": "35043853", "url": "https://genius.com/35043853", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
