{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Scorpio’s Mind", "line": "The Scorpio’s Mind is not a game to play wit all day", "vault_lines": ["The Scorpio's Mind is not a game to play wit all day"], "meaning": "Scorpios are known for being passionate and full of love, but also manipulative and jealous; not something you wanna be fucking with.", "annotation_id": "3138158", "url": "https://genius.com/3138158", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Scorpio’s Mind", "line": "Matter fact the flow Supreme like Diana Ross", "vault_lines": ["Matter fact the flow Supreme like Diana Ross"], "meaning": "Diana Ross was the leading women of the musical group, The Supremes.", "annotation_id": "2224736", "url": "https://genius.com/2224736", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Scorpio’s Mind", "line": "I guess I’m a pessimist Which means if shit goes bad I say, “I expected this”", "vault_lines": ["Which means if shit goes bad I say, \"I expected this\""], "meaning": "Opposite of optimistic, pessimism is a state of mind in which one anticipates undesirable outcomes, or believes that the evil or hardships in life outweigh the good, or luxuries.\n\nDrake knows that despite his best wishes for the future, if something turns out badly, he almost expects it.\n\n\n\nWhy so glum, chum?", "annotation_id": "1969643", "url": "https://genius.com/1969643", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Scorpio’s Mind", "line": "Shock em like Blanka from Street Fighter, heat got a Hurricane kick, murder everything quick", "vault_lines": ["Shock em like Blanka from Street Fighter, heat got a", "Hurricane kick, murder everything quick"], "meaning": "Blanka was a character in street fighter that used shocks as an attack. Hurricane kick is also a move in street fighter. It hit multiple times, which is how his guns hit you", "annotation_id": "264258", "url": "https://genius.com/264258", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Scorpio’s Mind", "line": "You got blind heaters, in my sweats is a mind reader", "vault_lines": ["You got blind heaters, in my sweats is a mind reader"], "meaning": "“Heaters” is a synonym for a gun.  Drake is saying that this guy’s gun sucks and he doesn’t know how to use it, as if it were blind.  The “mind reader” in Drake’s sweats is his gun, which is so good and he’s so accurate with it that it’s bullets are always in your head.", "annotation_id": "228632", "url": "https://genius.com/228632", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Scorpio’s Mind", "line": "You ain’t Morris Chestnut, you lighter and less cut", "vault_lines": ["You ain't Morris Chestnut, you lighter and less cut"], "meaning": "Morris Chestnut is a an American actor known for his built figure. FOr example, for Best Man Holiday, he worked out and couldn’t even eat right in order to keep an 8-pack.\n\n\n\nDrake’s weak opposition is nothing compared to the strong, cut Chestnut.", "annotation_id": "218655", "url": "https://genius.com/218655", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Scorpio’s Mind", "line": "My verbal campus is Villanova,", "vault_lines": ["My verbal camp is vivid, I told you I'm spitting image", "My verbal campus is Villanova,"], "meaning": "His verbal range and vocabulary is impressive like the campus of Villanova university.\n\n\n\nVillanova is not that large of a university, though the student body is fairly well-ranked in terms of academic accomplishment, so for Drake to say his verbal campus is like Villanova’s is a way of saying how smart he is. Drake performed at Hoops Mania at Villanova University on October 22, 2011, telling the student body how impressed he was with the school and promising to come back sometime.", "annotation_id": "204347", "url": "https://genius.com/204347", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
