{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Ride", "line": "And your suit is oxblood", "vault_lines": ["And tell the world around you that your paperwork is finished", "And your suit is oxblood"], "meaning": "Oxblood is a deep, rich red color with brown undertones, resembling shades like burgundy and maroon. The name comes from the color of ox blood, which has historically been used as a dye for fabrics and leather.", "annotation_id": "39474062", "url": "https://genius.com/39474062", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
