{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Trance (Demo)", "line": "Like if you got the steel, they give it up (Steel)", "vault_lines": ["Like they know that you real, they give it up (Real)", "Like if you got the steel, they give it up (Steel)"], "meaning": "“Steel” refers to a gun, as the vast majority of guns are primarily composed of various types of carbon steel. Travis is saying when someone threatens you with a gun, you’re likely to give up your possessions due to the fear of death.", "annotation_id": "31098820", "url": "https://genius.com/31098820", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
