{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Scriptures", "line": "Look, here we go The first time around", "vault_lines": ["Look, here we go", "The first time around"], "meaning": "This is one of a few songs that were recorded and released after Drake’s breakthrough mixtape So Far Gone. He was gearing up for the release of his debut studio album, therefore it was all new to him.", "annotation_id": "4131472", "url": "https://genius.com/4131472", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
