{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Resistance", "line": "There’s no way to fight it You can stay but, shawty, here I go", "vault_lines": ["There's no way to fight it", "You can stay but, shawty, here I go"], "meaning": "I’m about to blow up…\n\nThings are really starting to take off for me…\n\nI don’t want to leave you but if you aren’t going with me, I’m already gone.", "annotation_id": "38791265", "url": "https://genius.com/38791265", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Resistance", "line": "Uh-uh, I, I know you all too well", "vault_lines": ["Uh-uh, I, I know you all too well"], "meaning": "This is kind of like a manipulating tactic to flaunt a good time in her face. He’s basically saying “I don’t know why you didn’t come by, I know we would have had a good time… because I know you and you like to have a good time”", "annotation_id": "38791253", "url": "https://genius.com/38791253", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Resistance", "line": "Which made me question when I went missin’ And when I start treatin’ my friends different", "vault_lines": ["Which made me question when I went missin'", "And when I start treatin' my friends different"], "meaning": "This is a direct contradiction to the part earlier in the song where he says “My memory’s never faded” and “I’m still here with who I started with”…\n\nBecause how can you still be with who you started with if you “went missing” and started “treatin' your friends different”???", "annotation_id": "38791222", "url": "https://genius.com/38791222", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Resistance", "line": "Man, I couldn’t tell you where the fuck my head is I’m holdin’ on by a thread", "vault_lines": ["Man, I couldn't tell you where the fuck my head is", "I'm holdin' on by a thread"], "meaning": "There is a lot going on in my life right now. It’s so much going on and it’s a lot to process. It’s pretty surreal because I’m at a point where I’m so successful but I’m also feeling like I’m about to lose it all and it makes me nervous.", "annotation_id": "38791185", "url": "https://genius.com/38791185", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Resistance", "line": "I can’t relate to these haters—my enemies never made it", "vault_lines": ["I can't relate to these haters—my enemies never made it"], "meaning": "Based on his work ethic and what has brought him success, he can’t hate on anybody else. He is too focused on himself. While he may have had enemies in the past, they didn’t make it to where he is so they don’t matter anymore.", "annotation_id": "38791144", "url": "https://genius.com/38791144", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Resistance", "line": "I am still here wit’ who I started wit’", "vault_lines": ["I am still here wit' who I started wit'"], "meaning": "From another angle, he could be saying how he “metaphorically” carries the people who were with him when he started, even though they may no longer be physically with him.\n\nAs much as he’s changed, he remains loyal to the people who were with him from the beginning.", "annotation_id": "38791096", "url": "https://genius.com/38791096", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Resistance", "line": "I’m ‘bout to roll me up a blunt wit’ my list of regrets Burn it all, burn it all, I’m startin’ it fresh ’Cause half the time I got it right I probably guessed", "vault_lines": ["I'm 'bout to roll me up a blunt wit' my list of regrets", "Burn it all, burn it all, I'm startin' it fresh", "'Cause half the time I got it right I probably guessed"], "meaning": "Drake suggests his regrets never came from real intention—they were mostly chance. Since what went right or wrong was basically luck, he wants to clear it all out and start over instead of carrying that weight.", "annotation_id": "37656496", "url": "https://genius.com/37656496", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Resistance", "line": "The game needed life, I put my heart in it", "vault_lines": ["The game needed life, I put my heart in it"], "meaning": "i found this quote funny because he says the game needed LIFE i put my HEART in it.\n\nyou can’t LIVE w/o a heart so your heart is basically your life", "annotation_id": "36086127", "url": "https://genius.com/36086127", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
