{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Congratulations", "line": "I got your dream girl ridin’ in your dream car", "vault_lines": ["I got your dream girl ridin' in your dream car"], "meaning": "Other than enchanting piano keys as he exists, Drake ends this mixtape with a more impressive note by alluding to already having stampeded his mark by dating the “who’s who’s” of the industry such as Rihanna.", "annotation_id": "29439753", "url": "https://genius.com/29439753", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
