{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "I gotta keep watchin’ for oppers ’Cause anything’s possible, yeah", "vault_lines": ["I gotta keep watchin' for oppers", "'Cause anything's possible, yeah"], "meaning": "Oppers = Choppers aka guns.\n\nDrake has to look out for weapons, anyone can be after him.\n\nWorks into next line about people taking shots at him.", "annotation_id": "6313539", "url": "https://genius.com/6313539", "state": "verified", "votes": -7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "What’s the word these days? Bunch of niggas chasing after all these women they don’t even know (Wooo!) Buncha’ out of season women fuckin’ off-season niggas To get last season wardrobe (Woo!)", "vault_lines": ["What's the word these days?", "Bunch of niggas chasing after all these women they don't even know (Wooo!)", "Buncha' out of season women fuckin' off-season niggas", "To get last season wardrobe (Woo!)"], "meaning": "You can also read it as female reality stars who try to stay relevant by sleeping with former or inactive athletes/celebrities to maintain their fame or status.", "annotation_id": "5402641", "url": "https://genius.com/5402641", "state": "verified", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "What’s the word these days? Bunch of niggas chasing after all these women they don’t even know (Wooo!) Buncha’ out of season women fuckin’ off-season niggas To get last season wardrobe (Woo!)", "vault_lines": ["What's the word these days?", "Bunch of niggas chasing after all these women they don't even know (Wooo!)", "Buncha' out of season women fuckin' off-season niggas", "To get last season wardrobe (Woo!)"], "meaning": "this line should be ‘women’ the plural of woman.\n- ‘all these’ is referring to more than one\n- ‘buncha’ = bunch of = plural too", "annotation_id": "5185106", "url": "https://genius.com/5185106", "state": "verified", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "All the rappers that you vouch for Need to get out of the house more, they washed up And even if the team was religious with it I can’t really see another squad tryna’ cross us, nah (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["All the rappers that you vouch for", "Need to get out of the house more, they washed up", "And even if the team was religious with it", "I can't really see another squad tryna' cross us, nah (Woo)"], "meaning": "its not just a religious reference, with regard to ‘if the team was religious with it’ it is a double entendre\n– in one way to work hard on something e.g. to work religiously\n– and then also the religious reference of the ‘cross us’ in the next line", "annotation_id": "5185019", "url": "https://genius.com/5185019", "state": "verified", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "It’s our year (Aww, yeah) Aww, yeah I mean, besides Ricky Ross, Aubrey the biggest boss here (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["It's our year (Aww, yeah)", "I mean, besides Ricky Ross, Aubrey the biggest boss here (Huh)"], "meaning": "‘its our year’ and ‘aw yeah’\ncould be intentionally said in a way to make it also sound like:\n‘its all here’ and ‘all year’\nwith reference to the previous line of having money.", "annotation_id": "5183755", "url": "https://genius.com/5183755", "state": "verified", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "Thinkin’ they lions and tigers and bears I go huntin’, put heads on my fireplace, oh my", "vault_lines": ["Thinkin' they lions and tigers and bears", "I go huntin', put heads on my fireplace, oh my"], "meaning": "Kendrick Lamar – “I live in the back of the jungle, lions, tigers, bears, oh my”\n\nDiss?", "annotation_id": "5128145", "url": "https://genius.com/5128145", "state": "verified", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "Got the club goin’ up on a Tuesday", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "ILoveMakonnen was also performing with Diddy (who Drizzy has had previous altercations with over the beat for 0-100) the night Drake dropped this tape.", "annotation_id": "5124680", "url": "https://genius.com/5124680", "state": "verified", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "Got the club goin’ up on a Tuesday", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "He is taking a shot at Jay-Z saying he’ll only drink D'usse if there is no Henny left (Jay-Z is an owner of D'usse). Jay-Z took a shot at cash money on Watch the Throne “I’m like really half a bili, really you got Baby money, keep it real with niggas, niggas ain’t got my lady’s money”  Lil Wayne and Drake shot back on It’s Good on the Carter IV.  This is Drake saying Jay is two faced.", "annotation_id": "5103132", "url": "https://genius.com/5103132", "state": "verified", "votes": -9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "I gotta keep watchin’ for oppers ’Cause anything’s possible, yeah", "vault_lines": ["I gotta keep watchin' for oppers", "'Cause anything's possible, yeah"], "meaning": "I believe that the word isn’t even “oppers”, if you listen to his dialect and add a lil imagination, you can see he cleary says “appas”.\nAn Appa is a flying bison who taught the airbenders how to bend the air around them. The segment, “anything is possible” is that in reality (sorry to break the news), but Appas aren’t real, thus he needs to watch for them since anything is possible.", "annotation_id": "5080248", "url": "https://genius.com/5080248", "state": "verified", "votes": 41, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "[Verse 3: Drake]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Similar to the structure of 0 to 100 where the second half is a more emotional release after going in", "annotation_id": "5039532", "url": "https://genius.com/5039532", "state": "verified", "votes": 42, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "There’s no code of ethics out here Anyone will take shots at you, yeah", "vault_lines": ["There's no code of ethics out here", "Anyone will take shots at you, yeah"], "meaning": "He might mean that since he grew up in a Jewish community (this is a crazy life/ but you and the six raised me right) with humble ethics, his new life in the U.S. full of competition has him being shot at by people he least expect better yet respect.", "annotation_id": "5035613", "url": "https://genius.com/5035613", "state": "verified", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Tellin’", "line": "All the rappers that you vouch for Need to get out of the house more, they washed up And even if the team was religious with it I can’t really see another squad tryna’ cross us, nah (Woo)", "vault_lines": ["All the rappers that you vouch for", "Need to get out of the house more, they washed up", "And even if the team was religious with it", "I can't really see another squad tryna' cross us, nah (Woo)"], "meaning": "This taunting of rappers for not getting out of the house more must have been written at a different time than when Drake talks about not having “left the condo in a week” in 10 Bands https://genius.com/4888483/Drake-10-bands/Havent-left-the-condo-for-a-week-now", "annotation_id": "5028154", "url": "https://genius.com/5028154", "state": "verified", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
