{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Teach You A Lesson", "line": "And take you back home to St. Lucia baby", "vault_lines": ["And take you back home to St. Lucia baby"], "meaning": "Saint Lucia is a country located in the Caribbean. It is famous for the world’s only drive-in volcano, the Sulphur Springs and for its Pitons.\n\n\n\nDrake recalled his visit there in 2024’s “U My Everything”:\n\nMaybe we go to Saint Lucia, I been there, so I’ll introduce you", "annotation_id": "35141387", "url": "https://genius.com/35141387", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
