{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Fallen (Remix)", "line": "Callin’ them out is red rover to me", "vault_lines": ["Callin' them out is red rover to me"], "meaning": "“Red Rover” is a child’s game. Two teams line up opposite each other, no more than 30 feet apart. The first team agrees to call one player from the opposite team, and chants, “Red Rover, Red Rover, send (player’s name) on over!” The person called runs to the other line and attempts to break the chain (formed by the linking of hands).", "annotation_id": "13995067", "url": "https://genius.com/13995067", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Fallen (Remix)", "line": "Keep it a hundred, what they sayin’ I’m a liar for? Airing laundry, that’s what I got a dryer for What are they even searching through attire for? Tellin’ you these stories bout lonely women that I ignore", "vault_lines": ["Keep it a hundred, what they sayin' I'm a liar for?", "Airing laundry, that's what I got a dryer for", "What are they even searching through attire for?", "Tellin' you these stories bout lonely women that I ignore"], "meaning": "This was in reference to local Toronto rapper J Diggz, with whom Drake had a rivalry with over Chante. Chante put J Diggz as the love interest to 2 Music Videos directed by Director X. J Diggz rapped on a mistake that Drake was not honest with Chante.", "annotation_id": "13995058", "url": "https://genius.com/13995058", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
