{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "When To Say When", "line": "Facts, you know what I’m sayin’?", "vault_lines": ["Facts, you know what I'm sayin'?"], "meaning": "The lyric “You know what I’m sayin’?” is also used in Drake’s song “Talk Up” featuring JAY-Z. This may be a subtle reference, as this track uses the same sample as JAY-Z’s “Song Cry”.", "annotation_id": "40220039", "url": "https://genius.com/40220039", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
