{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Way 2 Sexy", "line": "I’m too sexy (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I'm too sexy for my shirt", "Too sexy for that jack, yeah, yeah", "I'm too sexy for this chain", "Too sexy for this fame, yeah, yeah", "I'm too sexy for the trap", "I'm feelin' too sexy to accept requests (Way too sexy)", "And I'm way too sexy to go unprotected (Way too sexy)", "Too sexy for these pills, I'm too sexy for this", "I'm too sexy for Milan", "I'm too sexy (Yeah)", "I'm too sexy for this syrup"], "meaning": "Referencing the name of the song.", "annotation_id": "40664559", "url": "https://genius.com/40664559", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Way 2 Sexy", "line": "I been kickin’ shit (Woah, woah), might need a prosthetic (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I been kickin' shit (Woah, woah), might need a prosthetic (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Young Thug has been playing footsie with faeces.\n\nHis obsession with punting poo seems to have led to some sort of infection, requiring amputation and now a prosthetic replacement.", "annotation_id": "37172196", "url": "https://genius.com/37172196", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
