{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Broke Boys", "line": "Hop in that bitch and I start the V", "vault_lines": ["Hop in that bitch and I start the V"], "meaning": "Drake has plenty of V’s… V8s Mercedes, V12 Rolls Royces, and a couple V12 Maybachs.\n\nClick one the thread below to see his crazy collection:\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ifiwasperfect/status/911372043899285504", "annotation_id": "27053260", "url": "https://genius.com/27053260", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Broke Boys", "line": "We ain’t got a choice, we orderin’ these", "vault_lines": ["We ain't got a choice, we orderin' these"], "meaning": "The new Ferrari Truck is called the “Purosangue” and is actually already sold out. We’ll see if Drake is on the list or if he buys one 2nd hand. Check out this thread for all the information:\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ifiwasperfect/status/1569745535296323586?s=46&t=unKHEJPbxdBuGg471t0H_A", "annotation_id": "27052907", "url": "https://genius.com/27052907", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Broke Boys", "line": "Know I’m SN1, ‘til I’m done fuckin’ London up", "vault_lines": ["Know I'm SN1, 'til I'm done fuckin' London up"], "meaning": "SN1, also known as Spare No 1, is a UK record label and rap collective led by Giggs, who has collaborated with Drake on  “No Long Talk” and “KMT” (“Kissin' My Teeth”), two tracks from Drizzy’s March 2017 project, More Life. Towards the end of “No Long Talk,” Giggs proclaims:\n\nOVO and SN1 to the world, brap\n\n\n\nDrake and Giggs on the stage of Reading Festival 2017", "annotation_id": "27052570", "url": "https://genius.com/27052570", "state": "accepted", "votes": 51, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Broke Boys", "line": "G Block Babies will spank you for free", "vault_lines": ["G Block Babies will spank you for free"], "meaning": "This is a reference to “Galloway Road,” also known as G-Block, a hood in Tornoto with some of the country’s highest public housing density.", "annotation_id": "27052518", "url": "https://genius.com/27052518", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
