{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Broke Boys", "line": "Woah, I got more stripes than Adidas (Yeah, I got the stripes, but fuck Adidas, nigga)", "vault_lines": ["Woah, I got more stripes than Adidas"], "meaning": "The Adidas logo has 3 stripes. “Fuck Adidas” is likely due to Drake’s longstanding deal with Nike.\n\nThis likely also references Drake’s 2018 deal with Adidas, for the album Scorpion, which fell through after Drake’s beef with Pusha T.", "annotation_id": "27052399", "url": "https://genius.com/27052399", "state": "accepted", "votes": 137, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Broke Boys", "line": "Shout out Noel for recordin’ the V’s", "vault_lines": ["Shout out Noel for recordin' the V's"], "meaning": "Drake shouts out his sound engineer Noel Cadastre. With V’s potentially being a double entendre referring to the verses as well as the vinyl’s recorded by Noel for the track/album.", "annotation_id": "27052236", "url": "https://genius.com/27052236", "state": "pending", "votes": 26, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
