{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Guess It’s Fuck Me", "line": "Shout out to the people workin’ nine to five I be workin’ nine to nine", "vault_lines": ["Shout out to the people workin' nine to five", "I be workin' nine to nine"], "meaning": "Drake, here shouts out people who work ‘'nine to five’s’‘, which are jobs when people work from 9 AM to 5 AM. Drake, however, is putting in even more hours to recording his music, working from 9 AM to 9 PM. This explains his crazy output of music in recent years. In 2020, he dropped Dark Lane Demo Tapes (14 tracks), 2021 he dropped CLB (21 tracks), 2022 he dropped Honestly, Nevermind and Her Loss (14 tracks and 16 tracks respectively) and For All the Dogs (23 tracks, 29 including Scary Hours 3).", "annotation_id": "37809323", "url": "https://genius.com/37809323", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Guess It’s Fuck Me", "line": "Have me workin’ ’til it’s 2049", "vault_lines": ["Have me workin' 'til it's 2049"], "meaning": "Drake couldn’t bear seeing his mother in pain and suffering. He decided he would work as hard as possible and even work for as long as possible (in 2049, Drake will be 63 years old) just to make sure that she’s well.", "annotation_id": "37809315", "url": "https://genius.com/37809315", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Guess It’s Fuck Me", "line": "Shit could make a thug cry, play it like a tough guy", "vault_lines": ["Shit could make a thug cry, play it like a tough guy", "Never seen a thug cry"], "meaning": "The hurt and confusion that is coming because of his partners departure and his ability to understand why it happened is as Drake says is enough to make a thug cry.", "annotation_id": "30365449", "url": "https://genius.com/30365449", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Guess It’s Fuck Me", "line": "Love, it’s been a long time Bet you never seen a thug cry Hit me on my hotline And no, ma, I’m not fine at all", "vault_lines": ["Never seen a thug cry", "Love, it's been a long time", "Bet you never seen a thug cry", "Hit me on my hotline", "And no, ma, I'm not fine at all"], "meaning": "Drake ends off the song by simply asking for closure and for them to come just one more time so he can have that closure before he has to move on.", "annotation_id": "30365439", "url": "https://genius.com/30365439", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Guess It’s Fuck Me", "line": "I’m the first ever antisocial socialite", "vault_lines": ["I'm the first evеr antisocial socialite"], "meaning": "The reason Drake says that he’s the first ever “antisocial socialite” is due to his strenuous efforts to make the relationship work.", "annotation_id": "30365422", "url": "https://genius.com/30365422", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Guess It’s Fuck Me", "line": "And they leave ‘cause of pride, but they comin’ back every time", "vault_lines": ["And they leave 'cause of pride, but they comin' back every time"], "meaning": "Drake isn’t fazed by words that come with pride.\n\nBecause he knows that no matter what happens they’ll always end up coming back.", "annotation_id": "30365400", "url": "https://genius.com/30365400", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Guess It’s Fuck Me", "line": "But you’re not one of mine You belong to everybody else when you’re bored in your free time", "vault_lines": ["like you're one of mine", "But you're not one of mine", "You belong to everybody else when you're bored in your free time"], "meaning": "No matter what Drake can provide it isn’t enough for the girl hence the no loyalty being shown to Drake.\n\nBecause when he’s not there it’s as if she was single all along.", "annotation_id": "30365372", "url": "https://genius.com/30365372", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Guess It’s Fuck Me", "line": "And get hate when I tell you, “Oh, some other time” Like I really got some other time You just tell me, “Never mind”", "vault_lines": ["And get hate when I tell you, \"Oh, some other time\"", "Like I really got some other time", "You just tell me, \"Never mind\"", "Make me tell you one time"], "meaning": "Drake’s availability is questionable which leads to frustration from the girl he’s talking too.\n\nThis also could show signs to where the relationship is going following the expression of the failed romance theme throughout the song.", "annotation_id": "30355919", "url": "https://genius.com/30355919", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Guess It’s Fuck Me", "line": "Sleepin’ in the whip sometimes, girl, I was sleepin’ upright", "vault_lines": ["Sleepin' in the whip sometimes, girl, I was sleepin' upright"], "meaning": "Throughout this track Drake reminisces on his past and what he had to go through to make it to where he is now.\n\nSleeping in the whip is just another example of what he had to go through some nights", "annotation_id": "30346798", "url": "https://genius.com/30346798", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Guess It’s Fuck Me", "line": "Still steppin’ like Omega Psi Phi for mine", "vault_lines": ["Still steppin' like Omega Psi Phi for mine"], "meaning": "Drake shouts out the fraternity Omega Psi Phi a predominantly black fraternity\n\nDrake is saying he’s still moving forward with pride for the people in his life who have his interests", "annotation_id": "30346770", "url": "https://genius.com/30346770", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
