{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "N 2 Deep", "line": "We goin’ to Houston, Atlanta, Vegas", "vault_lines": ["We goin' to Houston, Atlanta, Vegas", "Y'all are going to Vegas? Now we in Houston"], "meaning": "Referring to the song “Houstatlantavegas” from his 2009 mixtape So Far Gone.\n\nEven a decade later, he’s still running through the same strip clubs.", "annotation_id": "40670592", "url": "https://genius.com/40670592", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
