{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "N 2 Deep", "line": "Got a little candy in her pocket She gon’ take off like a—", "vault_lines": ["Got a little candy in her pocket", "She gon' take off like a—"], "meaning": "“Rocket”. The girl Drake sings about has some ecstasy (a popular both stimulant and hallucinogenic that comes in pill form), which will get her high, or in other words make her “take off like a rocket”. Yet another reference to H-Town, as the Rockets have been based in Space City since 1971.", "annotation_id": "24010445", "url": "https://genius.com/24010445", "state": "pending", "votes": 29, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "N 2 Deep", "line": "You a little Post Oak baby", "vault_lines": ["You a little Post Oak baby", "You a little forty-eight baby"], "meaning": "The Post Oak Hotel is a hotel in Uptown Houston, which bills itself as Texas' only five-star hotel and spa. Rooms vary in price from $666-$1,170 per night.\n\nThis line probably links to the Texas references in the song’s first verse:\n\nKept the Galleria open ‘til ten\nFor you and your friends\nYou know how I spend in H-O-U-S-T-O-N\n\n\n\nIn the Apple Music description for Certified Lover Boy, which he also posted in an Instagram story, Drake writes:\n\nDedicated to Nadia Ntuli and Mercedes Morr. RIP 💖 —Drake\n\nMercedes Morr was a Houston model who was found dead inside of her Texas apartment in August 2021. Drake and Morr were seemingly friends, so “N 2 Deep” could be a tribute to her.", "annotation_id": "24010278", "url": "https://genius.com/24010278", "state": "accepted", "votes": 34, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "N 2 Deep", "line": "Got some bad bitches that’s gon’ fuck me for that AP Fuck me for that AP, fuck me for that AP", "vault_lines": ["Got some bad bitches", "That's gon' fuck me for that AP", "Fuck me for that AP, fuck me for that AP"], "meaning": "Future refers to the well known video of him and Young Thug in the car, where Future says “You identify my bitches with AP’s. If she ain’t got a AP, she is not mine. She belongs to the streets”.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NvhKepTnZ-M", "annotation_id": "23894083", "url": "https://genius.com/23894083", "state": "pending", "votes": 46, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "N 2 Deep", "line": "If I wasn’t rappin’, baby, I would still be trappin’, baby Comin’ down, I’m sippin’ Texas, boppers on me hella crazy", "vault_lines": ["If I wasn't rappin', baby, I would still be trappin', baby", "Comin' down on sippin' techs, boppers on me, hella crazy"], "meaning": "Future interpolates Pimp C’s flow from the Jay Z track “Big Pimpin'” where he says\n\n“If I wasn’t rappin', baby\nI would still be ridin' Mercedes\nComin' down and sippin' daily\nNo record ‘til whitey pay me”", "annotation_id": "23885560", "url": "https://genius.com/23885560", "state": "pending", "votes": 42, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "N 2 Deep", "line": "Kept the Galleria open ’til 10 for you and your friends You know how I spend in H-O-U-S-T-O-N", "vault_lines": ["You already know (Know, know, know, know)", "Kept the Galleria open 'til ten for you and your friends", "You know how I spend in H-O-U-S-T-O-N"], "meaning": "The Galleria is the largest mall in Houston, Texas. Located uptown on Westheimer Road. It’s the fourth largest mall in the U.S. The mall itself opened on November 16, 1970 developed by Gerald D. Hines.\n\n\n\nUsually the Galleria closes at 9PM but given the kind of person Drake has become in the past decade, he has the power to keep it open till 10PM for this girl.\n\nThis is also a reference to 2013’s song from ”Nothing Was The Same”, ”From Time” featuring Jhené Aiko.\n\nNow it’s therapeutic blowing money in the Galleria", "annotation_id": "23874573", "url": "https://genius.com/23874573", "state": "pending", "votes": 62, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
