{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Star67", "line": "Shut the fuck up Text from a centerfold, I ain’t reply, let her know I read it though Voicemail say she ready though (Yeah) Niggas know I’m credible, ain’t no pussy on a pedestal", "vault_lines": ["shut the fuck up", "Text from a centerfold, I ain't reply, let her know I read it though", "Voicemail say she ready though (Yeah)", "Niggas know I'm credible, ain't no pussy on a pedestal"], "meaning": "i think he actually says “Let her know I Reddit, though” like he didn’t really reply to what she said, he just let her know he uses Reddit so she knows hes cool/smart.\n\nEDIT: 11yrs later he mentions Reddit on “Plot Twist” first verse. I TOLD YOU. “I be with them guys from the 6ix that you stay talkin' on Reddit about”", "annotation_id": "6887832", "url": "https://genius.com/6887832", "state": "verified", "votes": -115, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Star67", "line": "I do better with the rider in my system", "vault_lines": ["I do better with the rider in my system"], "meaning": "“Rider” would make sense in this line.  Refer back to the line in “Made Men” when he says “Smoke that bull rider shit, movin' slow as a ballad.”  He says “I do better with the rider in my system” in a slow, ballad-style way.", "annotation_id": "5103381", "url": "https://genius.com/5103381", "state": "verified", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Star67", "line": "I do better with the rider in my system", "vault_lines": ["I do better with the rider in my system"], "meaning": "Drake could also be saying “right herb in my system”\nCould in a way be a double entendre.\nEither way Drake (like most artist) needs something in his system to express himself", "annotation_id": "5067961", "url": "https://genius.com/5067961", "state": "verified", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Star67", "line": "Shut the fuck up Text from a centerfold, I ain’t reply, let her know I read it though Voicemail say she ready though (Yeah) Niggas know I’m credible, ain’t no pussy on a pedestal", "vault_lines": ["shut the fuck up", "Text from a centerfold, I ain't reply, let her know I read it though", "Voicemail say she ready though (Yeah)", "Niggas know I'm credible, ain't no pussy on a pedestal"], "meaning": "It’s not that he’s not interested, he’s just showing her that she’s not his center of attention. He’s make her sweat it, making her doubt herself, which in turn makes her want Drake more.", "annotation_id": "5002655", "url": "https://genius.com/5002655", "state": "verified", "votes": 115, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
