{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Lucky Lefty", "line": "And I’m all about my brothers like the niggas I’m samplin’", "vault_lines": ["And I'm all about my brothers like the niggas I'm samplin'"], "meaning": "A play on words; Drake is all about his brothers like the sample, because this song samples  The Isley Brothers song, How Lucky I Am.", "annotation_id": "38119586", "url": "https://genius.com/38119586", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
