{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "Bend that ass over (Baow), let that coochie breathe (Yeah) Shake that ass, bitch, hands on your knees (Ho) Hands on your knees (Ho), hands on your knees (Now) Shake that ass for Drake (Yup), now shake that ass for me", "vault_lines": ["Bend that ass over (Baow), let that coochie breathe (Yeah)", "Shake that ass for Drake (Yup), now shake that ass for me"], "meaning": "With this catchy chorus, ol' Sexyy models healthy relationship behavior for her loyal listeners. She is direct and concise about her sexual desires, giving the listener clear directions on how to position their body to please her and Drake.\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNtrb4ebAAAx01f?format=webp&name=large\n\nShe knows that communication is key in any relationship: being clear about your sexual needs is a surefire way to minimize confusion between partners and, consequently, maximize the time you can get your sexy on. Sexyy Red models this effective communication in the chorus, making this song educational AND outrageously arousing.", "annotation_id": "41621323", "url": "https://genius.com/41621323", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "[Chorus: Sexyy Red]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Drake would later go on to interpolate part of Red’s chorus in his 2024 diss track “Family Matters”:\n\nAyy, let that shorty breathe\nShake that ass, bitch, hands on your knees\nHands on your knees, hands on your knees\nShake that ass for Drake, now shake that ass for free\nYeah, yeah", "annotation_id": "37236256", "url": "https://genius.com/37236256", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "No need to lie to me, I know you got a guy He’s not a guy to me Just say goodbye to him, then take the ride to me, ride to me", "vault_lines": ["No need to lie to me, I know you got a guy", "He's not a guy to me", "Just say goodbye to him, then take the ride to mе, ride to me"], "meaning": "Drake doesn’t want this girl to stay with her man, and basically says he doesn’t compare to him.\n\n“Guy” is often used in Canadian slang to refer to someone who’s at a high-status or you use it when you give props to someone and call him, “a guy”.\nIn this case, Drake dismisses the other man, implying that he isn’t like that", "annotation_id": "36062579", "url": "https://genius.com/36062579", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "[Verse 2: SZA]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Although known for her melodies and great features, some fans wondered and made fun of SZA for sounding “nasal” on this verse. On one of the Instagram posts making fun of her, SZA replied and explained she had a fever and infection while recording the verse. She also typed out the lyrics for anybody wondering what she was saying.", "annotation_id": "30494615", "url": "https://genius.com/30494615", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
