{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "[Intro: Jessica Domingo] Is it all I could be enough Is it all I could be enough Is it", "vault_lines": ["I could be enough"], "meaning": "The intro is sampled from Jessica Domingo’s sample pack, Sounds of JDOM Vol.1.\n\nDomingo shared an Instagram Reel of her reaction for Drake sampling her song and wrote:\n\nmind blown. @champagnepapi", "annotation_id": "30041683", "url": "https://genius.com/30041683", "state": "accepted", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "Rollie gang, patty gang, rich baby daddy gang", "vault_lines": ["Rollie gang, patty gang, rich baby daddy gang"], "meaning": "Drake is flexing the fact that he owns Rolex and Patek Phillipe wrist-watches, also acknowledging the fact that he himself is a rich baby daddy.\n\nIt is well-known that Drake was gifted a 1-of-2 Patek Phillipe from Virgil Abloh in 2021. The watch is estimated to be worth at least seven figures. He even mentioned it on “Life Is Good”:\n\nVirgil got a Patek on my wrist going nuts", "annotation_id": "29741658", "url": "https://genius.com/29741658", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "I swear, poppin’ my shit come with consequences Post nut clarity, I came to my senses", "vault_lines": ["I swear, poppin' my shit come with consequences", "Post nut clarity, I came to my senses"], "meaning": "Drake in this line is reminiscing about his blowup in the rap game and how the beefs and loss of friendships were included in the consequences brought along with his fame and fortune.\n\nPoppin' his shit can also be interpreted as ejaculation (yet again) as the next line is about post-nut clarity.\nWhich is a feeling that happens to males after ejaculation that downs their mood.\n\nDrake may also be referencing his song with Lil Wayne – “Love Me”:\n\nYeah, all my bitches love me, and I love all my bitches\nBut it’s like as soon as I cum, I come to my senses", "annotation_id": "29738036", "url": "https://genius.com/29738036", "state": "pending", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "Thirty inches to my butt", "vault_lines": ["Thirty inches to my butt"], "meaning": "This probably means that her wig and/or weave is 30 inches long, which makes her hair touch her butt. This hairstyle is also called a “buss down.”\n\n\n\nSexyy Red rocking a buss down at the 2023 VMA’s", "annotation_id": "29727425", "url": "https://genius.com/29727425", "state": "accepted", "votes": 29, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "Until the dog days are over The dog days are done And you know I’m the one, I’m the one The dog days are over, dog days are done", "vault_lines": ["Until the dog days are over", "The dog days are done", "And you know I'm the one, I'm the one", "The dog days are over, dog days are done", "And you know I'm—"], "meaning": "Drake interpolates the lyrics and melodies from Florence + The Machine song “Dog Days Are Over”:\n\nThe dog days are over\nThe dog days are done", "annotation_id": "29731151", "url": "https://genius.com/29731151", "state": "accepted", "votes": 34, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "I see the future and I can see you in it", "vault_lines": ["I see the future and I can see you in it"], "meaning": "Could be talking about SZA relating back to TELEKENESIS from UTOPIA by Travis Scott, “I can see the future”", "annotation_id": "29730126", "url": "https://genius.com/29730126", "state": "pending", "votes": 24, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "Red weave, it match my thong He heard about me, know my song", "vault_lines": ["Red weave, it match my thong", "He heard about me, know my song"], "meaning": "Sexyy Red is notorious for her prominent red weave hair as well as her red clothing—particularly her lingerie. In fact, this can be seen almost everywhere throughout her social media, including her Genius profile.\n\n\n\n Pictured: Sexyy Red’s Genius profile picture as of October 2023 \n\n\nShe first gained recognition following her June 2023’s Hood Hottest Princess album track “SkeeYee,” which peaked at #1 on TikTok’s Billboard Top 50 Chart.", "annotation_id": "29728287", "url": "https://genius.com/29728287", "state": "accepted", "votes": 33, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Rich Baby Daddy", "line": "You ain’t even heard of Grace Bay ’til I bought the flight", "vault_lines": ["You ain't even heard of Grace Bay 'til I bought the flight"], "meaning": "Drake refers to Grace Bay Club, an all-suite resort in Caribbean island, Turks & Caicos. He is also acknowledging that this woman wouldn’t have ever even heard of this place if it weren’t for Drake paying her way. Although, it is world-renowned as one of the best beaches in the entire world.\n\nDrake has mentioned the Caribbean island resort before on “Gold Roses”:\n\nPostcard from Grace Bay, sendin' my distant regards", "annotation_id": "29726105", "url": "https://genius.com/29726105", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
