{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Girls Want Girls", "line": "Can’t imagine no bitch curvin’ me", "vault_lines": ["Can't imagine no bitch curvin' me"], "meaning": "Baby states that he is irresistible to women, proclaiming that they never break off their connections with him. The Atlanta rapper echoed a similar sentiment on his 2020 album My Turn, when he rapped the following line on the track “Same Thing”:\n\nAnd a bitch told a lie if she told you she was curvin' me", "annotation_id": "30140632", "url": "https://genius.com/30140632", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Girls Want Girls", "line": "So you shotting ’42 ’cause you", "vault_lines": ["So you shotting '42 'cause you"], "meaning": "Drake is referring to Don Julio 1942 Tequila, one of his favorite alcoholic beverages – and a high end tequila on the market.", "annotation_id": "24367476", "url": "https://genius.com/24367476", "state": "pending", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Girls Want Girls", "line": "Yeah, say that you a lesbian, girl, me too", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, say that you a lesbian, girl, me too"], "meaning": "After Certified Lover Boy’s release, this lyric and song received criticism for fetishizing lesbians and WLW relationships, as well as simply not making sense coming from a man. Lil Baby used a similar, more obvious, line to complement this one in his verse:\n\nShe like eating pussy, I’m like, ‘Me too’\n\nListeners made so many memes and confused tweets about this lyric that outlets like Hot New Hip-Hop made entire articles compiling fan reactions.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/lowryxbam/status/1433659730745077771", "annotation_id": "23877249", "url": "https://genius.com/23877249", "state": "accepted", "votes": 376, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
