{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Spin Bout U", "line": "They gon’ tell you it’s a chill night, tell you how they’d rather stay home, yeah", "vault_lines": ["They gon' tell you it's a chill night, tell you how they'd rather stay home, yeah"], "meaning": "Because they were unable to get a reservation at Carbone, instead of standing on business and accepting the L, they are gonna act like they “didn’t wanna go to Carbone anyways” and likely say things like “Carbone ain’t shit,” when in reality, they got dubbed.", "annotation_id": "36860632", "url": "https://genius.com/36860632", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Spin Bout U", "line": "Don’t worry ’bout your friend’s story when I had her alone She gon’ try and put some extras on it, take you out of your zone", "vault_lines": ["Don't worry 'bout your friend's story when I had her alone", "She gon' try and put some extras on it, take you out of your zone"], "meaning": "A friend of this woman was hanging out with Drake and he made it onto her story. Drake is saying nothing occurred between them, and that this friend may try to embellish what occurred to make her jealous.", "annotation_id": "36860629", "url": "https://genius.com/36860629", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Spin Bout U", "line": "The videos we got ever leak, we goin’ viral or goin’ platinum", "vault_lines": ["The videos we got ever leak, we goin' viral or goin' platinum"], "meaning": "If the sex tapes with this woman ever come out, Drake thinks everyone will be watching them.\n\nMe personally, I don’t wanna see that shit but you do you.", "annotation_id": "36860615", "url": "https://genius.com/36860615", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Spin Bout U", "line": "Somethin’ gettin’ dropped for you, baby girl", "vault_lines": ["Somethin' gettin' dropped for you, baby girl"], "meaning": "Something in Drake’s schedule is getting shifted around so that he can go see this woman and spend time with her.\n\nThis line is also a soft double entendre; it can be interpreted as Drake dropping another girl on his roster to make room for this new woman.", "annotation_id": "36860606", "url": "https://genius.com/36860606", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Spin Bout U", "line": "You started dancin’ to pay your tuition, girl, I wanna know what you been through You want a boutique or you wanna sell hair, just let me know what you into", "vault_lines": ["You started dancin' to pay your tuition, girl, I wanna know what you been through", "You want a boutiquе or you wanna sell hair, just let me know what you into", "Want ya, I want-want ya"], "meaning": "This woman became a stripper to finance her eduction. 21 is saying she doesn’t have to do that anymore now that she’s met him. He is implying he will finance her “passion” business idea, something like a clothing store or weave business.", "annotation_id": "36860593", "url": "https://genius.com/36860593", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Spin Bout U", "line": "He had to pop your cherry But I got it wet like a pool", "vault_lines": ["He had to pop your cherry", "But I got it wet like a pool"], "meaning": "This girl’s virginity was taken by another man, but now 21 is the one having relations with her.", "annotation_id": "36860585", "url": "https://genius.com/36860585", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
