{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "You Know, You Know", "line": "And I’m still spendin’ money from my actin’ days", "vault_lines": ["And I'm still spendin' money from my actin' days"], "meaning": "Drake referring to his acting days on the Canadian TV show, Degrassi: The Next Generation. On the show, he made a lot of money before even becoming a rapper. Interesting fact, he actually rapped on the show to his girlfriend’s song.", "annotation_id": "30031", "url": "https://genius.com/30031", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
