{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ATF Radio Freestyle", "line": "And you are not Big Meech And you are not Rayful And this is not DC", "vault_lines": ["And you are not Big Meech", "And you are not Rayful", "And this is not DC"], "meaning": "Demetrius “Big Meech” Felony and Rayful Edmond are infamous drug traffickers. It could be worth noting that the latter is from Washington D.C.", "annotation_id": "22533333", "url": "https://genius.com/22533333", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
