{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ATF Radio Freestyle", "line": "I am Rickey Henderson to Oakland", "vault_lines": ["I'm underrated, I am Rickey Henderson to Oakland"], "meaning": "Rickey Henderson was an outfielder for the Oakland Athletics. He is widely regarded as the greatest baserunner in Major League Baseball’s history. He has 1,406 career stolen bases, over 500 more than the second-place holder, Lou Brock.\n\nHere, Drizzy is comparing himself as the star of his team.", "annotation_id": "2706147", "url": "https://genius.com/2706147", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
