{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "Stop asking how the fucking needle feel Tat my fuckin’ name on you, let these niggas know it’s real", "vault_lines": ["Tat my name on you, girl, so I know it's real", "Tat my fuckin' name on you so I know it's real", "Tat my name on you so I know it's real", "Tat my fuckin' name on you, let 'em know you love the boy", "Stop asking how the fucking needle feel", "Tat my fuckin' name on you, let these niggas know it's real"], "meaning": "Drake is making her a part of his set, and he tells her dont worry how it feels, the city is her prize or sum shi.", "annotation_id": "40571723", "url": "https://genius.com/40571723", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "This is my town, if you need something, just ask for it, it’s yours Yeah, ask for it, it’s yours, if you ask for it, it’s done", "vault_lines": ["This is my town, if you need something, just ask for it, it's yours", "Yeah, ask for it, it's yours, if you ask for it, it's done"], "meaning": "Drake runs Toronto, if she needs anything, she can go to him.", "annotation_id": "40571716", "url": "https://genius.com/40571716", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
