{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "Yeah, money in my safe but I’m living dangerous They told me shit would change but I don’t really see no change", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, money in my safe but I'm living dangerous", "They told me shit would change but I don't really see no change"], "meaning": "His money is “safe” in the safe, but his life is nothing but safe, almost dangerous. He also doesn’t see no change because he pays in full with his card.", "annotation_id": "40571631", "url": "https://genius.com/40571631", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "I miss this and I want it back so I’m all in with these new flows New flows, got new flows, rap is stress but it pays great", "vault_lines": ["I miss this and I want it back so I'm all in with these new flows", "New flows, got new flows, rap is stress but it pays great"], "meaning": "Drake touches again about the reflection and transformation from “Drizzy Drake” to “Voodoo Child”. He wants to emerge new again and he has new flows.", "annotation_id": "40571619", "url": "https://genius.com/40571619", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "Tell a bad bitch “Girl, let’s go hang” You know me, Rolex, gold chain", "vault_lines": ["Tell a bad bitch \"Girl, let's go hang\"", "You know me, Rolex, gold chain"], "meaning": "Drake wants to hang out with a bad bih. THey “hang” like his gold chain on his neck.", "annotation_id": "40571610", "url": "https://genius.com/40571610", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Free Spirit", "line": "Yeah, I told you that it’s our world and you’re foolish thinking I’m wrong, ooh", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I told you that it's our world and you're foolish thinking I'm wrong, ooh"], "meaning": "References Drake’s song “Look What You’ve Done” on Take Care", "annotation_id": "32281861", "url": "https://genius.com/32281861", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
