{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Members Only", "line": "I’ll take you farther than Mexico (Yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I'll take you farther than Mexico (Yeah, yeah)", "I'll take you farther than Biscayne, my girl"], "meaning": "Party flexes that he is able to not only take the woman on a vacation, but take her to more exotic locations than merely Mexico, which is a common and easily accessible destination for many holiday goers, especially those in North America.", "annotation_id": "37530824", "url": "https://genius.com/37530824", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
