{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Members Only", "line": "I know you, shorty a ten, but not the Messi ho (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I know the answer", "I know you, shorty a ten, but not the Messi ho (Yeah)"], "meaning": "PND makes a double entendre: He says that the girl has the highest level of attractiveness (since she got the score of 10 out of 10) and that she isn’t messy, while refering to one of the best football / soccer players in history, who wears the #10 jersey in his team (Inter Miami) and national team (Argentina) – Lionel Messi.", "annotation_id": "29851004", "url": "https://genius.com/29851004", "state": "accepted", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Members Only", "line": "You’re too down with the gangy, you’re one of my members", "vault_lines": ["You're too down with the gangy, you'rе one of my members", "You're too down with the", "You're too down with the gangy, with the gangy", "With the, what, with the gangy", "You're too down with the members", "You're too down with the gangy, you're one of my members"], "meaning": "Drake has a gang of women in his “rotation” and is suggesting this new one, like the others, is in too deep. Essentially making her new member of the gang.", "annotation_id": "29834939", "url": "https://genius.com/29834939", "state": "pending", "votes": -18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
