{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Language", "line": "Fuck any nigga that’s talking that shit just to get a reaction", "vault_lines": ["Someone just talking that bullshit", "Fuck any nigga that's talking that shit just to get a reaction"], "meaning": "Drake is potentially alluding to Kendrick Lamar and his verse on the 2013 song Control, where he name dropped Drake, as well as many other rappers.", "annotation_id": "40011791", "url": "https://genius.com/40011791", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Language", "line": "Can’t even drive with the top off Been workin’ so hard on the album, I missed the whole summer", "vault_lines": ["Can't even drive with the top off", "Been workin' so hard on the album, I missed the whole summer"], "meaning": "While the obvious connotation is that he cannot ‘drive with the top off’ (of his convertible) as it is not sunny weather anymore.\nDrake could also be suggesting he can’t have his own top off due to him either not going to the gym as he has been too focused on the album, or simply because the summer has passed – Toronto fall is too cold to be shirtless!", "annotation_id": "40011718", "url": "https://genius.com/40011718", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Language", "line": "I am the kid with the motor mouth", "vault_lines": ["I am the kid with the motor mouth"], "meaning": "“Motor-mouth” is a person who a person who talks excessively, or rather in simpler terms:\n\nSomeone who talks way too much.\n\nNow, how this is related to Drake’s career or image isn’t clear, however it is worth noting.", "annotation_id": "39519287", "url": "https://genius.com/39519287", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
