{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "New Shit", "line": "No tellin’ like a dice throw", "vault_lines": ["What is about to unfold, no tellin' like a dice throw"], "meaning": "Comparing life to a dice game is an established hip-hop trope, as both life and craps depend heavily on luck and circumstance.", "annotation_id": "3467573", "url": "https://genius.com/3467573", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
