{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "New Shit", "line": "This bruh talk a good game But a fella couldn’t Roc, I wanna Dash to my Dame", "vault_lines": ["Your pictures, this bruh talk a good game", "But a fella couldn't Roc, I wanna Dash to my Dame"], "meaning": "This plays on the name of Roc-a-fela cofounder and former CEO Dame Dash. Because this dude Von was hanging with wasn’t as cool as Von thought he would be, he decided to just run home and chill with his lady.", "annotation_id": "243298", "url": "https://genius.com/243298", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "New Shit", "line": "Shorty jumped out of the closet, even though I made literal Her girl made it figurative, or maybe that’s what liquor do", "vault_lines": ["Shorty jumped out of the closet, even though I made literal", "Her girl made it figurative, or maybe that's what liquor do"], "meaning": "“shorty jumped out of the closet, EVENTHOUGH I MEAN literal, her girl made it figurative, or maybe thats what liquor do”\n\nwhile he was in his hotel on tour, a groupie surprised him by literally jumping out of his closet. she also had a friend with her who she was sexual with while drunk so she both literally and figuratively “came out of the closet”", "annotation_id": "243292", "url": "https://genius.com/243292", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "New Shit", "line": "But I’d rather go deaf than lose touch", "vault_lines": ["But I'd rather go deaf than lose touch, holla at me", "But I'd rather go deaf than lose touch, holla at me, baby! (Look...)"], "meaning": "Drake plays on the 5 senses every human has – sight, smell, touch, taste, and hearing. Drake says that he would rather lose his hearing than become “out of touch” with this girl.", "annotation_id": "232194", "url": "https://genius.com/232194", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
