{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Pop Rosé", "line": "Rosé Spade to the ’96 Don P", "vault_lines": ["Rosé Spade to the '96 Don P"], "meaning": "Armand de Brignac, better known as Ace of Spades, can cost $600 for a bottle of Rosé. A bottle of 1996 Dom Perignon Rosé can cost $400 or more, at times costing over $1,000.", "annotation_id": "11779596", "url": "https://genius.com/11779596", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
