{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Since Way Back", "line": "R. Kelly", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Nods to R. Kelly are given throughout the song. PND is no stranger to his 90’s references, for example paying homage to Jodeci rather frequently. This song also samples R. Kelly’s 2012 song Clipped Wings.", "annotation_id": "39083828", "url": "https://genius.com/39083828", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Since Way Back", "line": "We gon’ have to listen to some old Kelly", "vault_lines": ["We gotta listen to the old Kelly", "We gon' have to listen to some old Kelly"], "meaning": "Nods to R. Kelly are given throughout the song. PND is no stranger to his 90’s references, for example paying homage to Jodeci rather frequently. This song also samples R. Kelly’s 2012 song Clipped Wings.", "annotation_id": "39083824", "url": "https://genius.com/39083824", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Since Way Back", "line": "We gotta listen to the old Kelly", "vault_lines": ["We gotta listen to the old Kelly", "We gon' have to listen to some old Kelly"], "meaning": "Nods to R. Kelly are given throughout the song. PND is no stranger to his 90’s references, for example paying homage to Jodeci rather frequently. This song also samples R. Kelly’s 2012 song Clipped Wings.", "annotation_id": "38814419", "url": "https://genius.com/38814419", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Since Way Back", "line": "These streets got so familiar Malibu coast where I meditate", "vault_lines": ["These streets got so familiar", "Malibu coast where I meditate"], "meaning": "These lines reinforce Drake’s opening line. He hasn’t been back “home” to Toronto (the 6ix) for some time because he now lives in Los Angeles.\n\nLos Angles, has become home to Drake. Whether it’s the pool parties in at his Calabasas mansion or meditating on the beach in Malibu, Drake has gotten accustom to the west coast lifestyle.", "annotation_id": "12887702", "url": "https://genius.com/12887702", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Since Way Back", "line": "My mama said you was bad news Like, “Dun-dun-dun-dun”", "vault_lines": ["My mama said you was bad news"], "meaning": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bW7Op86ox9g\nDun-dun-dun-dun is a common effect that plays in movies when something bad is about to happen. Like this effect, PARTY’s mom warned him about this girl, before he found out that she was bad news for himself.", "annotation_id": "11656604", "url": "https://genius.com/11656604", "state": "accepted", "votes": 40, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Since Way Back", "line": "Oh, yes it’s difficult Thank God I’m Christian", "vault_lines": ["Oh, yes it's difficult", "Thank God I'm Christian"], "meaning": "Christians are taught to:\n\nBe kind and compassionate to one another, forgiving each other, just as in Christ God forgave you. – Ephesians 4:32\n\n\n\nTreat others the same way you would want them to treat you. – Luke 6:31\n\nPARTYNEXTDOOR thanks God that he is a Christian as the teachings of Bible make it easier for him to treat his woman right even though she is a thorn in his eye.", "annotation_id": "11553734", "url": "https://genius.com/11553734", "state": "accepted", "votes": 52, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Since Way Back", "line": "Six months since I’ve been back in the Six And I can’t help but wonder how you’ve been, babe", "vault_lines": ["Six months since I've been back in the Six", "And I can't help but wonder how you've been, babe", "Wonder how you've been", "Wonder how you've been, babe"], "meaning": "The “Six” represents the city of Toronto, Canada. The birthplace of Drake. It is made up of 6 former cities of Toronto – Toronto, North York, Scarborough, York and Etobicoke, and East York.", "annotation_id": "11553065", "url": "https://genius.com/11553065", "state": "accepted", "votes": 51, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Since Way Back", "line": "(Crowd Talking)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "This generic sound bite has appeared many places including:\n\n\n\nTalkin' Dirty After Dark (1991)\nThomas Bangalter (of Daft Punk),  On Da Rocks (1995)\nRed Peters, The Closing Song (1999)\nMartin Horntvedt, Hasta Luego Manchego Remix (2004)", "annotation_id": "11537289", "url": "https://genius.com/11537289", "state": "pending", "votes": 56, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Since Way Back", "line": "I’ve been out in Bel-Air like Will was", "vault_lines": ["I've been out in Bel-Air like Will was"], "meaning": "Will Smith, a popular American actor, first starred in the TV show The Fresh Prince of Bel-Air in July 1990, as a fictionalized version of himself. 148 episodes of the show aired between 1990 and 1996. The show garnered as many as 14.6 million viewers in one season.", "annotation_id": "11531871", "url": "https://genius.com/11531871", "state": "accepted", "votes": 53, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
