{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "2 Hard 4 The Radio", "line": "If you my new girl, girl, you gotta look the part", "vault_lines": ["If you my new girl, girl, you gotta look the part"], "meaning": "Here our glorious and majestic OVO 6 God Drake is basically saying that all his girls need to fit in to his rich aesthetic and clothing that he wears and the aura around him\n6", "annotation_id": "40978617", "url": "https://genius.com/40978617", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
