{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "That’s Just How I Feel", "line": "Like that money just grew off a tree Like the money just came in illegal Yeah, what? [Refrain] That’s just how I feel, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Like that money just grew off a tree", "Like the money just came in illegal", "That's just how I feel, yeah", "That's just how I—", "Guess that's how y'all feel, yeah", "That's just how I feel, yeah, yeah", "That's just how I feel"], "meaning": "This whole section seems to be referencing Money Trees by Kendrick Lamar.", "annotation_id": "40101421", "url": "https://genius.com/40101421", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
