{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Vital", "line": "Past eight years feel like I had my eyes closed, blindfolded Smoke before I make my decisions That’s how I take the high road Say I never get alone time, that’s a lie though I’m still alone with everybody as far as I know", "vault_lines": ["Past eight years feel like I had my eyes closed, blindfolded", "Smoke before I make my decisions", "That's how I take the high road", "Say I never get alone time, that's a lie though", "I'm still alone with everybody as far as I know"], "meaning": "Drake feels as though periods of his life happen so fast that he’s seemingly blindfolded by how quickly time passes…\n\nSometimes when life goes fast, smoking and drugs are the ways we can seemingly “slow” things down\n\nAlso a play on “taking the high road” in life where you avoid doing things that stoop to others’ lower level of vibration…", "annotation_id": "30661552", "url": "https://genius.com/30661552", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Vital", "line": "Remind me where I’m from again (6ix)", "vault_lines": ["Remind me where I'm from again (6ix)"], "meaning": "Drake refers to his hometown of Toronto, Canada, which has been awarded the moniker “6,” which represents Toronto’s six boroughs: East York, Etobicoke, North York, Scarborough, Toronto, and York whilst also representing Toronto’s area codes “416” and “647.”", "annotation_id": "29937338", "url": "https://genius.com/29937338", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Vital", "line": "Last thing I heard was Andre scream “Ice cold”", "vault_lines": ["Last thing I heard was Andre scream \"Ice cold\""], "meaning": "From Outkast’s “Hey Ya!” (2003), Drake would have been 17, before his rap career really began with Room For Improvement (2006)", "annotation_id": "24758979", "url": "https://genius.com/24758979", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Vital", "line": "Don’t let nobody sell my house on the bridle", "vault_lines": ["Don't let nobody sell my house on the bridle"], "meaning": "In 2016 during an interview with Zane Lowe on Apple Music, Drake announced that he was building a home – which he described as his “life’s work,” in the exclusive Bridle Path neighborhood of Toronto.\n\nDesigned by Canadian architect Ferris Rafauli, the house completed construction in late 2019, and since then has been featured heavily in publications, and videos alike.\n\nThe house was the cover story of the May 2020 issue of Architectural Digest, in which Drake mentioned that the house “will be one of the things I leave behind, so it had to be timeless and strong.”\n\nThe home has also been featured in a few of his music videos – for “Money in the Grave,” “When to Say When,” “Chicago Freestyle” and “Toosie Slide.”", "annotation_id": "19565534", "url": "https://genius.com/19565534", "state": "accepted", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Vital", "status": "done", "targets": 4, "clicked": 4, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Drake-vital-lyrics", "genius_title": "Vital"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Waiting To Exhale", "line": "Preme inside Delilah with the handheld", "vault_lines": ["Preme inside Delilah with the handheld"], "meaning": "Preme inside Delilah with the handheld – Preme (formerly P.Reign) is one of Drake’s close friends and in this line Drake is saying that Preme got the gun inside the club. Implying that even in seemingly safe or elite spaces, there’s an underlying tension and a need for protection.", "annotation_id": "35132242", "url": "https://genius.com/35132242", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
