{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "I been out the way in a cut, it’s been a minute (Been a minute)", "vault_lines": ["I been out the way in a cut, it's been a minute (Been a minute)"], "meaning": "Drake is likely refering to the 1 year gap between the one this song is featured on, to the one before this being Her Loss, but this doesnt make much sence as 1 year isnt long of a hiatus in between albums AND drake also dropped 4 singles in between so idrk what hes talking abt here", "annotation_id": "39241037", "url": "https://genius.com/39241037", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "Bunch of sedatives, hypnotics in my system, okay", "vault_lines": ["Bunch of sedatives, hypnotics in my system, okay"], "meaning": "Sedatives include benzodiazepines (like Xanax, Valium, and Ativan), barbiturates, and sleep drugs. Hypnotic drugs are a class of medications primarily used as sleep aids. Drake has talked about the use of these classes of drugs before in previous songs, most famously in his verse on Travis Scott’s “Sicko Mode”:\n\nI did half a Xan, thirteen hours ‘til I land", "annotation_id": "37553425", "url": "https://genius.com/37553425", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "I’m geekin’ off of my pride", "vault_lines": ["I'm geekin' off of my pride"], "meaning": "Drake is “high” off of his success and confidence.", "annotation_id": "36860488", "url": "https://genius.com/36860488", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
