{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "(Okay, so?)", "vault_lines": ["But I heard that you fuckin' with a nigga that I know (Okay, so?)"], "meaning": "The woman in question that supposedly started this whole rift between Drake & Pluto (Future); Diana (IG: @dianaduhh___) has a single word or title in her bio “Princess ❥”.\n\nThe british accent “Okay, so?” is a play on the “Princess” Diana trope. With it coming immediately after “But I heard that you fucking with a niggah that I know” then Yachty saying ”Fuck em, yea yea”, solidifies that Drake & the woman in question know she’s dealing with an acquaintance of his, but he’s still gonna backdoor him.\n\nThis adds even more context to the track. Initially many thought this was a positive ode to Future, when in actuality it was shade/a diss. Essentially “This heaux is fucking with Future, but I want her too. If Future was in my shoes, he’d still fuck the heaux…. So I did it.”", "annotation_id": "31573387", "url": "https://genius.com/31573387", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "Where you get that jeans from? Who sewed the buttons?", "vault_lines": ["Where you get that jeans from? Who sewed the buttons?"], "meaning": "Drake references jeans literally and figuratively to mean genes as well. He asks where she got her genes from because her genetics are so good she’s popping out the front and the back of her actual jeans.", "annotation_id": "29949986", "url": "https://genius.com/29949986", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "Swear I wanna tear your box out like a coach", "vault_lines": ["Swear I wanna crack behind your back like a joke", "Swear I wanna tear your box out like a coach", "Girl, I wanna slide in your box like a vote"], "meaning": "Drake uses a simile as a play on words to reference a what he wants to do to a woman’s vagina, often referred to as a Box, in which he wants to “tear.  Coaches teach players to Box-out", "annotation_id": "29773764", "url": "https://genius.com/29773764", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "‘Cause that shit still poppin’ out the front and the back That shit still poppin’ out the, damn That shit came poppin’ out them jeans like a ghost Girl, you gotta pop that on me like a Coke", "vault_lines": ["'Cause that shit still poppin' out the front and the back", "That shit still poppin' out the, damn", "That shit came poppin' out them jeans like a ghost", "Girl, you gotta pop that on me like a Coke"], "meaning": "Drake references the curves on a woman saying that her booty is large in nature to the point where he is amazed at the way the jeans fit;most importantly how the buttons are holding strong.\nHe then mentions that the parts of her have  popped out, like ghosts pop out to surprise people.\nLastly, he uses a simile to compare the “popping out” to Coke which is a reference to the soda “pop” Coca-cola.", "annotation_id": "29773742", "url": "https://genius.com/29773742", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "I ain’t got a strap, I gotta risk it, okay", "vault_lines": ["I ain't got a strap, I gotta risk it, okay"], "meaning": "Drake uses the word “Strap” often called a gun, a weapon, or “protection”.\n\nIn this case, that protection is a condom, something he did not have. So, to follow what Pluto did:\n\n“He’d fuck the ho…..”\n\nDrake had to risk it and go unprotected.", "annotation_id": "29773467", "url": "https://genius.com/29773467", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "Swear I wanna crack behind your back like a joke", "vault_lines": ["Swear I wanna crack behind your back like a joke", "Swear I wanna tear your box out like a coach"], "meaning": "Drake wants to “crack” this woman, meaning he wants to have sex with her, preferably from behind, just like how people “crack” jokes behind people’s back.", "annotation_id": "29763391", "url": "https://genius.com/29763391", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "Workin’ on a album, now it’s finished", "vault_lines": ["Workin' on a album, now it's finished"], "meaning": "On January 21, 2023, during his free concert at the Apollo Theater, Drake teased the release of an album, saying he wanted to “strike up more emotions, maybe this year”.\n\nOn October 6, 2023, almost 10 months later, after a few delays, dropped FATD at 6 am EST. Album finished.", "annotation_id": "29763365", "url": "https://genius.com/29763365", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "(Yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, thought they knew my body, guess they don't", "So the question is, the question is (Yeah)", "What would Pluto do? He'd fuck the ho, so I did it (Yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "Sample use of “Differences” by Ginuwine. Drake is knows for using Ginuwine samples and does it again here", "annotation_id": "29751279", "url": "https://genius.com/29751279", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "Life is goin’ just how I predicted, okay", "vault_lines": ["Life is goin' just how I predicted, okay"], "meaning": "Drake may be referring to his 10 year old prediction made in 2013’s “Tuscan Leather,” claiming that he stood the test of time and is still at the top and relevant:\n\nI’m tired of hearin' ‘bout who you checkin’ for now\nJust give it time, we’ll see who’s still around a decade from now\nThat’s real", "annotation_id": "29750063", "url": "https://genius.com/29750063", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "Girl, I want us hangin’ in the summer like a coat Girl, I wanna slide in your box like a vote", "vault_lines": ["Swear I wanna tear your box out like a coach", "Girl, I want us hangin' in the summer like a coat", "Girl, I wanna slide in your box like a vote"], "meaning": "The summertime has a warmer temperature climate, so there wouldn’t be much reason for a person to wear a coat hence why they are hung in the closet during this time.\n\nThe next line references sliding in her box (pussy) and references how votes slide into ballot boxes.", "annotation_id": "29742332", "url": "https://genius.com/29742332", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "Girl, you got me beggin’ for a ten like I’m broke (Slatt)", "vault_lines": ["Girl, you got me beggin' for a ten like I'm broke (Slatt)"], "meaning": "He’s saying the woman he’s after is clearly a 10 out of 10 but for whatever reason she won’t give him the time of day. With a net worth near $300M it’s obvious he doesn’t need to beg for a $10, but this one is different", "annotation_id": "29742326", "url": "https://genius.com/29742326", "state": "pending", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
