{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What Would Pluto Do", "line": "Tryna have you comin’ out your shell like the yolk (Ooh)", "vault_lines": ["Tryna have you comin' out your shell like the yolk (Ooh)"], "meaning": "To come out of your shell is another meaning for leaving your comfort zone or being more interested in things.\n\nEggs have shells with yellow stuff in the middle called a yolk.", "annotation_id": "29738477", "url": "https://genius.com/29738477", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
