{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Knife Talk", "line": "Sticker, AK-40 to your liver", "vault_lines": ["Sticker, AK-40 to your liver"], "meaning": "In Juicy J „Feed the Streets” ft. Project Pat / A$AP Rocky, it’s clearly „Stick a AK-40 to your liver”, which fits better than „sticker”. It’s also the official Genius lyrics for Juicy J song.", "annotation_id": "41228741", "url": "https://genius.com/41228741", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
