{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Knife Talk", "line": "Smith & Wesson, I’m 4L Gang reppin’", "vault_lines": ["Smith & Wesson, I'm 4L Gang reppin'"], "meaning": "Smith and Wesson is a firearm company. 4L gang is an Atlanta-based gang that 21 is part of, where 4L stands for “4 Life\"", "annotation_id": "39375215", "url": "https://genius.com/39375215", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
