{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "More M’s", "line": "Seen her with her nigga, waved my hand, I’m like, “Hey, friend,”", "vault_lines": ["Seen her with her nigga, waved my hand, I'm like, \"Hey, friend,\""], "meaning": "Savage acting like a gay friend so the boyfriend doesn’t suspect anything", "annotation_id": "36559193", "url": "https://genius.com/36559193", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "More M’s", "line": "You look good on camera, baby, let’s go make a film", "vault_lines": ["You look good on camera, baby, let's go make a film"], "meaning": "21 is referring to making a sex tape, which is common among rappers. Recently Blueface had one leaked, and most famously, Kim Kardashian and Ray J’s made one", "annotation_id": "35010140", "url": "https://genius.com/35010140", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
