{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Goin In", "line": "I’m so official, all I need is a whistle", "vault_lines": ["I'm so official, all I need is a whistle"], "meaning": "Wayne references an Official here or in some sports a Referee, and Weezy claims he only needs a whistle to be like an Official.\n\n Weezy could also be making a Stevie Wonder reference here as he has in songs like ‘Mr.Carter.’ Because even though officials have whistles they are fucking blind.", "annotation_id": "38095462", "url": "https://genius.com/38095462", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Goin In", "line": "I’m goin’ in, I’m goin’ in I’m goin’ in, I’m goin’ in And I’ma go hard, and I’ma go hard And I’ma go hard, and I’ma go hard Bitch I’m goin’ in, I’m goin’ in I’m goin’ in, I’m goin’ in And I’ma go hard, and I’ma go hard And I’ma go hard, and I’ma go hard", "vault_lines": ["I'm goin' in, I'm goin' in", "And I'ma go hard, and I'ma go hard", "Bitch I'm goin' in, I'm goin' in"], "meaning": "“Going in” as a rapper basically means going into your bag of skills & to attack the beat . In essence “going hard ” means the same thing .. This could be a double meaning here as it also hints at some sexual lingo  simultaneously", "annotation_id": "31135638", "url": "https://genius.com/31135638", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Goin In", "line": "She open up her mouth and then I blow her brains out", "vault_lines": ["She open up her mouth and then I blow her brains out"], "meaning": "As in the last line, Wayne compares his penis to a pistol. Him “blowing her brains out” really means ejaculating in her mouth.", "annotation_id": "28485943", "url": "https://genius.com/28485943", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
