{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Little Bit", "line": "I think I’m a little bit, little bit A little bit in love with you But only if you’re a little bit Little bit in love with me", "vault_lines": ["A little bit in love with you", "I guess that I'm a little bit, a little bit", "I love you, love you, a little bit", "I think I'm a little bit, little bit", "But only if you're a little bit", "Little bit in love with me", "A little bit in love with you, oh", "A little bit, a little bit"], "meaning": "Lykke is saying how she is in love with a person a little bit, but that’s only if they’re in love with her", "annotation_id": "31056645", "url": "https://genius.com/31056645", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
