{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Little Bit", "line": "So we don’t confirm the fling", "vault_lines": ["So we don't confirm the fling"], "meaning": "A theme also seen in Jungle, Drizzy can’t confirm any relationships due to him being fearful of his status  destroying every ounce of privacy the relationship currently has.\nIn Jungle he raps, “I take somebody else’s car, drive there undercover”.", "annotation_id": "26743046", "url": "https://genius.com/26743046", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Little Bit", "line": "I love you, love you, a little bit I would do it, you would say it You would mean it, we could do it It was you and I and only I, mmm", "vault_lines": ["A little bit in love with you", "I would do it, push a button", "I love you, love you, a little bit", "I would do it, you would say it", "You would mean it, we could do it", "It was you and I and only I, mmm", "I think I'm a little bit, little bit", "A little bit in love with you, oh", "A little bit, a little bit"], "meaning": "After confessing all of the things she’d do for him, she admits she loves him.\n\nAfter all, most people would go to any heights for their loved ones. As she declares the love she has for him, she expects Drake to let go of his ego and say that he loves her back.\n\nAlso, preceding into the hook take note that Lykke Li sings it this time. Not only does Drake have issues with declaring his love she does as well.", "annotation_id": "1802490", "url": "https://genius.com/1802490", "state": "accepted", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Little Bit", "line": "I know you told me break their hearts", "vault_lines": ["I know you told me break their hearts"], "meaning": "Perhaps as a metaphor to the “music industry” it has taught Drake to break every girl’s heart and deny them in order to chase his dream. He has gained many groupies now but, this girl is different.\n\nAs an interlude on Buried Alive (Interlude), Kendrick Lamar gives an explanation on this relationship.", "annotation_id": "1791369", "url": "https://genius.com/1791369", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Little Bit", "line": "Feels so right but it’s just, so wrong", "vault_lines": ["Feels so right but it's just, so wrong"], "meaning": "They really should not be together because, of Drake’s reputation. Although, he is really happy with her it wouldn’t be right because as a big shot celebrity he is bound to do wrong by the girl.\n\n\n\nDrizzy is known to blow money at strip clubs. As a deduction in taxes he blew $50,000 on strippers who, really does not deserve to be taken care of as much as this woman that he has fallen for.", "annotation_id": "1791361", "url": "https://genius.com/1791361", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Little Bit", "line": "Both hearts beat like a metronome", "vault_lines": ["The pressure's on, both hearts beat like a metronome"], "meaning": "A metronome is a special device in music it measures the beats per minute of certain clicking noises and it maintains a stable rhythm. The both of their hearts are “fixed” together and they beat together in unison at the same pace.", "annotation_id": "1769582", "url": "https://genius.com/1769582", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Little Bit", "line": "Both in sync like a Justin song", "vault_lines": ["Both in sync like a Justin song"], "meaning": "This is a play on words. He is saying they are in-sync (to be in synchronization or to be in a state of agreement/harmony) –  he is also referencing Justin Timberlake who was a member of the group *NSYNC.", "annotation_id": "378871", "url": "https://genius.com/378871", "state": "accepted", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
