{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Loving You No More", "line": "Lovin’ you no more I just, I can’t, I just can’t be lovin’ you no more I love you more than I love myself", "vault_lines": ["I just, I can't, I just can’t be loving you no more (no, no, baby)", "Lovin' you no more", "I just, I can't, I just can’t be lovin' you no more", "I love you more than I love myself"], "meaning": "Claims he loves his girl so much he’s not focusing on whats good for him\n\nConsidering Diddy is an egomaniac, I find that hard to believe (I’m sure his girlfriend – failed R&B star Cassie – would have a hard time believing it as well)", "annotation_id": "54145", "url": "https://genius.com/54145", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
