{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Extra Special", "line": "Look I ought to be thankful with women I have plenty of luck And when it comes to relationships, many is stuck", "vault_lines": ["And when it comes to relationships, many is stuck", "Look I ought to be thankful with women I have plenty of luck"], "meaning": "Drake has had his fair share of women which he is quite thankful for, but none of his relationships with these girls actually go anywhere. One of the girls Drizzy may have been referring to is a girl named “Jade Lee”, who he later mentioned on his sophomore album Take Care.\n\nEven now in Drake’s career he is often linked to many women.", "annotation_id": "332452", "url": "https://genius.com/332452", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
