{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Own It", "line": "Own it, own it, own it, own it Own it, own it, own it, own it Own it, own it, own it, own it Own it, own it, own it, I said Go own that shit, own that shit Own that shit, own that shit Go and own that shit, own that shit Own that shit, you own that shit, go and", "vault_lines": ["Own it, own it, own it, own it", "Own it, own it, own it, I said", "Go own that shit, own that shit", "Own that shit, own that shit", "Go and own that shit, own that shit", "Own that shit, you own that shit, go and", "Go own that shit", "Own that shit, own that shit, own that shit"], "meaning": "Drake’s telling this female (or anyone for that matter) to “go own it,” or to take pride in what they do.  He wants whoever he’s talking to to make him proud.\n\nDrizzy wants to commit to this girl, so he’s telling her to go own that shit.", "annotation_id": "2229296", "url": "https://genius.com/2229296", "state": "accepted", "votes": 91, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Own It", "line": "It ain’t a secret, baby, everybody saw us Guess whose it is? Guess whose it is? Guess whose it is? It’s yours", "vault_lines": ["Guess whose it is? Guess whose it is? (Yours)", "It's yours, it's yours, it's yours, it's", "It's yours, it's yours", "Own it, baby, own it, it's yours", "Guess whose it is? Guess whose it is? Yours", "It ain't a secret, baby, everybody saw us", "Guess whose it is? It's yours"], "meaning": "https://twitter.com/COLEMANCOOKING/status/371136892840210432\nEveryone on Twitter saw them and so did the paparazzi.", "annotation_id": "2224644", "url": "https://genius.com/2224644", "state": "accepted", "votes": 35, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Own It", "line": "You ain’t even hit me when that nigga had threats for me, girl You don’t love me, you just say that shit to get to me, girl", "vault_lines": ["Own that shit, own that shit", "You ain't even hit me when that nigga had threats for me, girl", "You don't love me, you just say that shit to get to me, girl", "Own that shit, own that shit, own that shit"], "meaning": "Drake is referring to his altercations with Chris Brown. When he was threatening Drake over the fight in the club, this girl didn’t even call to see how Drake was doing\n\n\n\nShe doesn’t love him, she just tells him she does to fuck with him", "annotation_id": "2216596", "url": "https://genius.com/2216596", "state": "accepted", "votes": 63, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Own It", "line": "Next time we fuck, I don’t wanna fuck, I wanna make love Next time we talk, I don’t wanna just talk, I wanna trust Next time I stand tall, I wanna be standin’ for you", "vault_lines": ["Next time we talk, I don't wanna just talk, I wanna trust", "Next time I stand tall, I wanna be standin' for you", "Next time we fuck, I don't wanna fuck, I wanna make love"], "meaning": "Seems like Drake is done with just “doing it” – he wants something intimate, like a committed relationship.", "annotation_id": "2214804", "url": "https://genius.com/2214804", "state": "accepted", "votes": 92, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Own It", "line": "[Intro: PARTYNEXTDOOR] Own it It’s yours It’s yours", "vault_lines": ["Own it, own it, own it, own it", "It's yours, it's yours, it's yours, it's", "It's yours, it's yours", "Own it, baby, own it, it's yours"], "meaning": "In the transition from “Wu-Tang Forever,” Drake continues to borrow “it’s yours” from the Wu-Tang classic, “It’s Yourz.”", "annotation_id": "2214636", "url": "https://genius.com/2214636", "state": "accepted", "votes": 67, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Own It", "line": "’Cause you got the Batphone and my work line You should call", "vault_lines": ["'Cause you got the Batphone and my work line"], "meaning": "In addition to a normal phone, Batman had a special Batphone for the mayor or police to call whenever needed. The girl in question has both of Drake’s numbers; the private (important friends and family line) and business line. She has no reason not to call. He could also be referring to singer Rihanna in this line because — similar to Batman’s sidekick Robin — her real first name is Robyn.", "annotation_id": "2213487", "url": "https://genius.com/2213487", "state": "accepted", "votes": 43, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Own It", "line": "Couple bitches tryna have me on the Maury", "vault_lines": ["Couple bitches tryna have me on the Maury"], "meaning": "Some of his past lovers claim Drake fathered their child. One way to find out is a paternity test on the Maury Povich Show, but Drake simply doesn’t have time for that", "annotation_id": "2213274", "url": "https://genius.com/2213274", "state": "accepted", "votes": 44, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
