{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Trust Issues", "line": "Looking for some things and I think that I can find ’em in you, in you", "vault_lines": ["Looking for some things and I think that I can find 'em in you, in you"], "meaning": "He is searching for certain qualities that he wants someone to have and he believes he can find it in this girl which is probably why he only trusts her", "annotation_id": "38969932", "url": "https://genius.com/38969932", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Trust Issues", "line": "All I care about is money and the city that I’m from I’ma sip until I feel it, I’ma smoke it ’til it’s done I don’t really give a fuck and my excuse is that I’m young And I’m only getting older, somebody should’ve told you I’m on one (Ayy), fuck it, I’m on one (Yeah) I said I’m on one, fuck it, I’m on one, a strong one Two white cups and I got that drink It could be purple, it could be pink Depending on how you mix that shit Money to be got, and I’ma get that shit ’Cause I’m on one, fuck it, I’m on one", "vault_lines": ["So you're the only one", "And I'm only getting older, somebody should've told you", "I could tell, I could tell, I could tell", "I'm on one (Ayy), fuck it, I'm on one (Yeah)", "And it's all that I've been getting lately", "On drank and let's all get faded, yeah", "I said I'm on one, fuck it, I'm on one, a strong one", "It could be purple, it could be pink", "Depending on how you mix that shit", "'Cause I'm on one, fuck it, I'm on one"], "meaning": "Drake interpolates the chorus of DJ Khaled’s May 2011 track, “I’m on One,” where he discusses the effects of promethazine and his meteoric rise in the rap game.\n\nWhile the lyrics are identical on each track, Drake slows down his flow on this interlude to portray a softer image.", "annotation_id": "17732641", "url": "https://genius.com/17732641", "state": "accepted", "votes": 78, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Trust Issues", "line": "Uh Aw yeah, aw yeah Call up on drank and let’s Let’s call up and, uh", "vault_lines": ["Call up on drank and let's", "Let's call up and, uh", "Let's call up on drank and let's all get wasted", "On drank and let's all get faded, yeah, uh", "On drank and let's all get faded, yeah", "Let's call up on, uh"], "meaning": "Call Up On Drank, is a 1997 mixtape released by DJ Screw.\n\nIn a May 2011 blog post, Drizzy posted a link to Fat Pat & Mike D’s freestyle from Call Up On Drank:\n\nThis has inspired Take Care. RIP Pat. RIP Screw.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?feature=player_embedded&v=4Wy8I4Evd0w", "annotation_id": "555285", "url": "https://genius.com/555285", "state": "accepted", "votes": 36, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Trust Issues", "line": "I’m all day with it, man, AM to the PM", "vault_lines": ["I'm all day with it, man, AM to the PM"], "meaning": "“AM 2 PM” is a song off of Drake’s February 2006 album, Room for Improvement.", "annotation_id": "264332", "url": "https://genius.com/264332", "state": "accepted", "votes": 40, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Trust Issues", "line": "Women want to fuck like they’re me and I’m them", "vault_lines": ["Women want to fuck like they're me and I'm them"], "meaning": "On his February 2009 track, [“Ignant Shit,” Drake raps about how he doesn’t fall for his lady fans because he knows they like him for the fame and the money.\n\nBut I never get attracted to fans\n‘Cause the eager beaver could be the collapse of a dam\n\nThis line is also borrowed from Lil Wayne’s April 2007 track, “N.O. Nigga.”\n\nBitches wanna fuck like they’re me and I’m them", "annotation_id": "247197", "url": "https://genius.com/247197", "state": "accepted", "votes": 73, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
