{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Forgot I Was Famous", "line": "Spread them knees, let me", "vault_lines": ["Spread them knees, let me"], "meaning": "Drake is asking the woman to have sex with him, by asking her to spread her knees, a variation on the common expression “spread your legs”.\nThe end of this line “let me” is completed by the first word in Uzi’s very next line in the chorus, which is “fuck”. This further evidences Drake’s request for sex with the woman", "annotation_id": "36972907", "url": "https://genius.com/36972907", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Forgot I Was Famous", "line": "This is a not a Dawn, no boy (Uh-huh) Pull up in a Phantom, not a broke boy (Yeah, ayy)", "vault_lines": ["This is a not a Dawn, no boy (Uh-huh)", "Pull up in a Phantom, not a broke boy (Yeah, ayy)"], "meaning": "The car is not a rolls royce dawn but instead the more expensive Phantom", "annotation_id": "32541091", "url": "https://genius.com/32541091", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Forgot I Was Famous", "line": "Can’t name one girl that don’t wanna stand next to me (Ayy, ayy)", "vault_lines": ["Can't name one girl that don't wanna stand next to me (Ayy, ayy)"], "meaning": "They refer to how any girl would love to be with them because of how famous they are.", "annotation_id": "30822000", "url": "https://genius.com/30822000", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
