{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Another Late Night", "line": "You take G6s knowin’ you’ll never take one with pilot (’Kay)", "vault_lines": ["You take G6s knowin' you'll never take one with pilot ('Kay)"], "meaning": "“G6” refers to the Gulfstream G650, a model of private jet made by Gulfstream. Here, Yachty says that despite someone’s awareness of luxury jets like the G6, they may never have the chance to fly in one with a pilot.", "annotation_id": "30946065", "url": "https://genius.com/30946065", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Another Late Night", "line": "It be so pure I don’t even fuck, ain’t tryna raise her mileage", "vault_lines": ["It be so pure I don't even fuck, ain't tryna raise her mileage"], "meaning": "Here, Yatchy indicates he doesn’t want to have sex with the girl to avoid potentially “corrupting” her. He uses “mileage” as slang for the number of people slept with, with “pure” suggesting she’s a virgin.", "annotation_id": "30945830", "url": "https://genius.com/30945830", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Another Late Night", "line": "Dirty how I did him in the Wraith", "vault_lines": ["Dirty how I did him in the Wraith"], "meaning": "“Wraith” refers to a Rolls Royce model of the same name, while “Did him dirty” suggests some form of misconduct or mistreatment towards the person in the car.", "annotation_id": "30945667", "url": "https://genius.com/30945667", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Another Late Night", "line": "Long as she don’t lie to me, then it’s okay", "vault_lines": ["Long as she don't lie to me, then it's okay"], "meaning": "Mans got his priorities straight\nAnd conveying her as a ‘pretty’ liar and also calling her ‘bae’ since he can stand some pretty little lies, and its okay for drake as long as she doesnt lie to HIM\n(like fr imagine being drake’s bitch and lying to him)", "annotation_id": "30790667", "url": "https://genius.com/30790667", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
