{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Another Late Night", "line": "We catch the opps, don’t want no apologies, just kiss the ring (Mwah)", "vault_lines": ["We catch the opps, don't want no apologies, just kiss the ring (Mwah)"], "meaning": "Here Lil Yatchy is talking about a gun to his opps mouth. Since the triggergaurd is usually called a ring.", "annotation_id": "29858642", "url": "https://genius.com/29858642", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Another Late Night", "line": "Thinkin’ ‘bout this styrocup, really Wockin’", "vault_lines": ["Thinkin' 'bout this styrocup, really Wockin'"], "meaning": "Lean is a beverage consisting of a soft drink and cough syrup.\n\nYachty is saying that the cough syrup he uses is from the Wockhardt brand.\n\nLean is usually served in two styrofoam cups stacked within each other.", "annotation_id": "29764968", "url": "https://genius.com/29764968", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Another Late Night", "line": "It’s just another late night with my bitch, ayy Just another late night with my bitch, ayy (With my bitch) And I hate to even call her ass my bitch, ayy (Yeah, my bitch) ’Cause I love that ho, don’t even make no sense, man (Pssh, pssh) Just another late night with my dawg (Pssh, with my dawg) Just another late night with my bitch (Pssh, with my bitch) And we ridin’ ’round tryna make sense (Make sense) Of whatever comes first, it comes next (Yeah, blatt)", "vault_lines": ["It's just another late night with my bitch, ayy", "Just another late night with my bitch, ayy (With my bitch)", "And I hate to even call her ass my bitch, ayy (Yeah, my bitch)", "'Cause I love that ho, don't even make no sense, man (Pssh, pssh)", "Just another late night with my dawg (Pssh, with my dawg)", "Just another late night with my bitch (Pssh, with my bitch)", "And we ridin' 'round tryna make sense (Make sense)", "Of whatever comes first, it comes next (Yeah, blatt)", "Huh, yeah (Pssh), huh, yeah, yeah, huh (Pssh)"], "meaning": "Drake is referring to his interview with Caleb Pressley, where Pressley asks “What’s the right thing for me to call women; bitches or hoes?”. In which Drake replies “I’m proud to say I dont really drop the B word in person… I say it in raps.”\n\nhttps://youtu.be/vFGWIhnE3i4?si=-k1p4xxbt5mdfKvA&t=272", "annotation_id": "29761361", "url": "https://genius.com/29761361", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Another Late Night", "line": "She actin’ Hollywood, this ain’t L.A., no way", "vault_lines": ["She actin' Hollywood, this ain't L.A., no way"], "meaning": "“actin' Hollywood” refers to the idea that someone believes that they are too famous to talk to you or too cool to talk to you.\n\nDrake then says “no way”, which shows that Drake doesn’t approve of this behavior.", "annotation_id": "29743575", "url": "https://genius.com/29743575", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
