{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Gently", "line": "Either I slow down the trip or I speed up the visa Mi nah wan’ leave ya Grab Eliza, bring her to Ibiza", "vault_lines": ["Either I slow down the trip or I speed up the visa", "Mi nah wan' leave ya", "Grab Eliza, bring her to Ibiza"], "meaning": "Drake is talking about extending the length of his trip to spend more time with a girl he met, or to speed up obtaining a visa for her so she can join him on his travels.", "annotation_id": "29813331", "url": "https://genius.com/29813331", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Gently", "line": "En RD están to’s mis cueros, en PR to’a las yales", "vault_lines": ["En RD están to's mis cueros, en PR to'a las yales"], "meaning": "En Puerto Rico y República Dominicana el vocablo “cuero” significa prostituta, aunque en Ecuador y Venezuela tiene el significado de una mujer que es amante de un hombre", "annotation_id": "29771441", "url": "https://genius.com/29771441", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Gently", "line": "Ay, santo, Dios mío, qué acicale", "vault_lines": ["Ay, santo, Dios mío, qué acicale"], "meaning": "This is an interpolation of the dembow song “Hay Santo” made by dominican artist Rochy RD ft. Jonatan Burlon.\n\n“Acicale” from the verb “acicalar” means grooming, like when you’re dressed up and you’re looking good.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e_wGaSDmnko", "annotation_id": "29752960", "url": "https://genius.com/29752960", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Gently", "line": "¿Usted se cree que yo quiero que me invierta mi dinero en la 42 donde la gente está bailando dembow?", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "English Translation:\n\nYou think I want you to invest my money in La 42, where people are dancing to dembow?\n\n\n\nDiulka Cristina Pérez is a Dominican journalist, broadcaster, television host and politician.\n\nThey extracted this clip from a speech by Diulka on Zol FM (Dominican radio program). In this speech, she talks about an investment being planned by PROPEEP (a Dominican government institution that helps people) of 39 million Dominican pesos in the Capotillo sector (La 42).\n\nhttps://youtu.be/Cim9OndVk3o?si=ZQ1GKuPjGNL644iW&t=278", "annotation_id": "29752812", "url": "https://genius.com/29752812", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Gently", "line": "Me gusta su culazo perreando Le da hasta abajo, le gusta este tamaño", "vault_lines": ["Me gusta su sonrisa aunque me haga daño", "Me gusta su culazo perreando", "Le da hasta abajo, le gusta este tamaño"], "meaning": "“I like that ass while it’s shaking\nShe brings it down low, she likes this size”\n\nPerriando is a puertorrican dance usually danced to reggaeton and dembow. It’s characterized by the grinding of the ass against another dancer’s pelvis in a rhythmic fashion.", "annotation_id": "29743787", "url": "https://genius.com/29743787", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Gently", "line": "[Outro: Bad Bunny]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "English Translation:\n\nThe baby has a husband and didn’t tell me anything\nDon’t worry, that’s nothing\nTwo hundred bottles and more are coming around\nMore are coming around\nThe baby has a husband and didn’t tell me anything\nDon’t worry, that’s nothing\nMany baby girls and more are coming around\nMore are coming around", "annotation_id": "29739359", "url": "https://genius.com/29739359", "state": "accepted", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
