{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Gently", "line": "I live like Sopranos, Italianos", "vault_lines": ["I live like Sopranos, Italianos"], "meaning": "The Sopranos is an American television series that follows New Jersey-based Italian-American mafia crime families. It is widely considered one of the most influential television series.\n\n\n\nPicture of the Soprano Family members.\n\n\nDrake is most likely drawing a parallel between the mafia style Soprano Family and his own entourage, due to the loyalty and hierarchy that are required and valued.", "annotation_id": "29726275", "url": "https://genius.com/29726275", "state": "accepted", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Gently", "line": "[Verse 2: Bad Bunny]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "English Translation:\n\nIn Casa de Campo, chucky, in Mexico I’m savage\nBaby, I’m going to screw up your cosmetics\nClimb on me, put the ski mask on me\nTurn down the lights and close the curtain\nI don’t want a video, I’m tired of the photo\nI’m sick of everything in the world, except for that pussy, that pussy, ha\nExcept for that pussy, that pussy, ha, ayy\nChampagne bottle I uncorked\nI got horny when I heard her\nCalling me “daddy” inside the Porsche\nFuck, mami, holy shit\nHow delicious you fuck, ha\nThe Puerto Rican girls ask me for dick, the Cuban girls want dick\n“Fuck me so good,” the white girl tells me\nMami, you went too far, hey", "annotation_id": "29726260", "url": "https://genius.com/29726260", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Gently", "line": "I’ve been El Chico for cincuenta años", "vault_lines": ["I've been El Chico for cincuenta años"], "meaning": "Translation:\n\nI’ve been The Boy for fifty years.\n\nThe Boy is one of Drake’s many other monikers.", "annotation_id": "29726223", "url": "https://genius.com/29726223", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
