{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Hoe Phase", "line": "[Intro] What am I supposed to think about? Settling down soon for me, settling down I don’t want you all over the world no more, you’ve seen all of that stuff You did enough, it’s time for you to settle down and give me them grandbabies You’re ruining my day, I-I’m having motion, mom", "vault_lines": ["What am I supposed to think about?", "Did you forget? Did you forget?", "It's like that, that, it's like— it's like that, that", "It's like that, like that, that, it's like, it's like that, that", "Settling down soon for me, settling down", "It's like— it's like that, that, it's like— it's like that, that", "I don't want you all over the world no more, you've seen all of that stuff", "It's like— it's like that, that it's like that, like that, that", "You did enough, it's time for you to settle down and give me them grandbabies", "It's like that, like that", "You're ruining my day, I-I'm having motion, mom", "It's like that, that", "It's like— it's like that, that", "It's like that— like that, that", "I-i-i-i-it's— it's like that, that"], "meaning": "Drake is 40. Drake has traveled all around the world and has no doubt hooked up/had relationships with an innumerable amount of girls. He has also came close to proposing to women a total of 42 times, immortalized in the necklace below.\n\n\n\nAlthough Drake already has a prized posession in his son Adonis, it wouldn’t be unreasonable to think that Sandi Graham would expect him to settle down and find a true partner at this stage in his life.\n\nLike the girl in this song having her “hoe phase”, Drake has had his own playboy phase, and recognizes that it needs to end soon.", "annotation_id": "39814734", "url": "https://genius.com/39814734", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
