{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Preach", "line": "She keep it wet like tsunami She think she sunk the Titanic", "vault_lines": ["She keep it wet like tsunami", "She think she sunk the Titanic"], "meaning": "PARTY gives a shout to his possible girl Lani TSUNAMI, and says he is getting her so forcefully wet, hence the tsunami reference, that “SHE THINKS SHE SUNK THE TITANIC”. Not “she think she selling Titanic”.\nSo the wave he has her on, her tsunami, was so strong it over took the great unsinkable ship the Titanic. Titanic possibly a reference to his dick game. She THINK she handling him.", "annotation_id": "4941972", "url": "https://genius.com/4941972", "state": "verified", "votes": 48, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
