{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Preach", "line": "Boy, you should know that Your love is always on my mind And I can’t deny it I want you, I’m on you", "vault_lines": ["You know what's going on, you know what's going on", "Boy, you should know that", "Your love is always on my mind", "And I can't deny it", "I want you, I'm on you"], "meaning": "This sample comes from Ciara’s song, “Body Party”\n\nBoy you should know that\nYour love is always on my mind\nAnd I can’t deny it\nI want you, I’m on you\n\nhttp://youtu.be/fO0hQ5ylGFQ?t=1m41s", "annotation_id": "4930130", "url": "https://genius.com/4930130", "state": "accepted", "votes": 47, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
