{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Doing His Thing", "line": "But, I’m not stupid (Nah), I’m tight fisted", "vault_lines": ["But, I'm not stupid (Nah), I'm tight fisted"], "meaning": "Drake stays perpetuating the stereotypes of his Jewish brethren.\n\n\n\nIn all seriousness Drizzy is doing the smart thing by being frugal with his money around these gold-digging women.", "annotation_id": "2809847", "url": "https://genius.com/2809847", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
