{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "Take my credit card, spend like you ain’t had shit", "vault_lines": ["Three, take my credit card, spend like you ain't had shit"], "meaning": "Double entendre with drake upon his issues with transactional relationships and sleeping with girls for his money, fame and riches.\n\nalso a sexual reference to swiping a credit card.", "annotation_id": "39847404", "url": "https://genius.com/39847404", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "I said, I’m so loved and I’m so hated, so conflicted, I’m so jaded", "vault_lines": ["I said, I'm so loved and I'm so hated, so conflicted, I'm so jadеd", "I said, \"I'm so loved and I'm so hated, so conflicted, I'm so jaded\""], "meaning": "Not the first time Drake has used the slang word jaded, which means to feel weary, exhausted, or cynical — usually from having experienced too much of something (fame, relationships, success, betrayal, etc.) the repetition of “so” builds upon how he is overstimulated/overwhelmed by this situation.\n\nDrake has used it in 2018 for the track “Jaded” from the album Scorpion:\n\nYes, I’m hurting, yes, I’m jaded", "annotation_id": "39844644", "url": "https://genius.com/39844644", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "Sexyy said, “What bitch is dissin’? Let me knock her off”", "vault_lines": ["Sexyy said, \"What bitch is dissin'? Let me knock hеr off\"", "Sexyy said, \"Which bitch is dissin'?\" Let me knock her off"], "meaning": "Sexxy Redd have a great relationship and are so close that Sexxy would fight a woman for Drake. She even took out a billboard to promote this trilogy of albums during the release weekend.", "annotation_id": "39842223", "url": "https://genius.com/39842223", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "Down on her knees, tryna reason with me Gotta bless her with something", "vault_lines": ["Down on her knees, tryna reason with me", "Gotta bless her with something"], "meaning": "Praying (communication with God for blessings) is done in the kneeling position. This ties into Drake’s 6 God persona.\n\nFellatio is also performed on the knees, which is possibly her “blessing” after pleading on her knees with Drake.", "annotation_id": "39841290", "url": "https://genius.com/39841290", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
