{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "They so pressed about the beef, it’s panini", "vault_lines": ["They so pressed about the beef, it's panini"], "meaning": "Panini are italian grilled sandwiches that can contain beef that are made being pressed by a pie iron. Drake compares his feud with Kendrick Lamar to that saying it’s squashed and angry fans should move on.", "annotation_id": "39792098", "url": "https://genius.com/39792098", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "Maya, Maya, you workin’ at Greta tonight or nah? Pick up, I need a whole section for the mob", "vault_lines": ["Maya, Maya, you workin' at Greta tonight or nah?", "Pick up, I need a whole section for the mob"], "meaning": "GRETA is a chain of bars all around Canada, one of them located in downtown Toronto, Fashion District about 1.3 kilometres away from the CN Tower.", "annotation_id": "39791942", "url": "https://genius.com/39791942", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "Pisceus is ridin’ ’round in Lam’, Mashallah", "vault_lines": ["Pisceus is ridin' 'round in Lam', Mashallah"], "meaning": "Mashallah (ما شاء الله) is an Arabic phrase that translates to “God has willed it” or “what God willed has happened”.\n\nIn this line Drake praises God and expresses gratitude for the lavish life he is descrbing.", "annotation_id": "39783291", "url": "https://genius.com/39783291", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "222Juju is goin’ Birki’ on a thot", "vault_lines": ["222Juju is goin' Birki' on a thot"], "meaning": "Juliet Charlotte, who goes by 222Juliet online, is a fashion stylist and social media influencer.\nThis nod continues Drake’s habit of referencing people from his real life circle into his lyrics.\n\nAn Hermès Birkin bag is one of the most expensive luxury handbags in fashion. Prices range from 40k to upwards of 300k.\n\nDrake shoutsout Juliet and her ability to flex her Luxury Bag on anyone, anywhere.", "annotation_id": "39782426", "url": "https://genius.com/39782426", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "Let me hear your body talk, girl, on three", "vault_lines": ["Let me hear your body talk, girl, on three", "Yeah, let me hear your body talk, girl, on three"], "meaning": "This is an interpolation of Jhené Aiko‘s first verse on her song Sativa.\n\nTold ‘em, “Go on, take a shot on three”\n\nJhené and Drake have collaborated before in 2011 on July from Jhené’s debut mixtape Sailing Soul(s) and 2013 on From Time from Drake’s third album Nothing Was The Same.", "annotation_id": "39782316", "url": "https://genius.com/39782316", "state": "pending", "votes": -6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "If I’m drinkin’, what? Peach Bellini", "vault_lines": ["If I'm drinkin', what? Peach Bellini"], "meaning": "Drakes favorite drink, peach bellni", "annotation_id": "39781320", "url": "https://genius.com/39781320", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "High Fives", "line": "Wear my diamond glove, they could never see me", "vault_lines": ["Wear my diamond glove, they could never see me"], "meaning": "Referring to Michael Jackson’s diamond glove, and also the (inspired) glove featured on the cover of his albumICEMAN.\n\nIceman album cover art\n\nThe picture drake is referencing in this line is from a from a fan account on instagram @drake", "annotation_id": "39776078", "url": "https://genius.com/39776078", "state": "pending", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
