{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Outside Tweaking", "line": "Left me his Visa He don’t love me, I don’t love him either", "vault_lines": ["left me his Visa", "He don't love me, I don't love him either"], "meaning": "He left her his credit card for spending, but it’s a loveless, transactional setup — no real feelings on either side.", "annotation_id": "39959977", "url": "https://genius.com/39959977", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Outside Tweaking", "line": "I feel so much emotion And when I’m ’bout to peak I would prefer that we’re speakin’ So if you could get on a flight And be here by the weekend", "vault_lines": ["I feel so much emotion", "And when I'm 'bout to peak", "I would prefer that we're speakin'", "So if you could get on a flight", "And be here by thе weekend", "And if you book me the flight", "I could be there by the weekend"], "meaning": "He’s overwhelmed with feelings, wants real conversation at the height of it instead of distance, and asks her to fly out immediately to talk.", "annotation_id": "39959969", "url": "https://genius.com/39959969", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Outside Tweaking", "line": "I was sayin’ we should get some sun I was thinkin’ beaches with the sand Askin’ if your manager could come It seem like your manager’s your man", "vault_lines": ["Askin' if your manager could come", "It seem like your manager's your man", "I was sayin' we should get some sun", "I was thinkin' beaches with the sand"], "meaning": "You suggested a romantic getaway, but her wanting her manager there makes you suspect he’s actually her man or too involved.", "annotation_id": "39959946", "url": "https://genius.com/39959946", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Outside Tweaking", "line": "Just performed for twenty thousand fans Now she want twenty thousand bands How the fuck does that make sense? Baby, I’m just tryna understan", "vault_lines": ["Just performed for twenty thousand fans", "Now she want twenty thousand bands", "How the fuck does that make sense?", "Baby, I'm just tryna understan"], "meaning": "You just killed a big show for 20k people, but now she’s demanding $20k cash from you — questioning the entitled, unrealistic expectation after your success.", "annotation_id": "39959930", "url": "https://genius.com/39959930", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Outside Tweaking", "line": "Yeah, all these other bitches get procedures Copy my titties, wanna squeeze ’em Show him somethin’, make him a believer", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, all these other bitches get procedures", "Copy my titties, wanna squeeze 'em", "Show him somethin', make him a believer"], "meaning": "Stunna is suggesting that all these girls want to match her ‘pearls’  through plastic surgery…. when she shows them to her man, he can see their real", "annotation_id": "39891943", "url": "https://genius.com/39891943", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
