{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Blue Green Red", "line": "Friends that I treated like family, they were just hanging around, around", "vault_lines": ["Friends that I treated like family, they were just hanging around, around"], "meaning": "Drake is likely making a reference to how, earlier this year, a lot of people that he perceived as friends, back-stabbed him. Fellow artists such as The Weeknd and/or Future.", "annotation_id": "32680185", "url": "https://genius.com/32680185", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
