{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "Young girls envy the life y’all leadin’", "vault_lines": ["Young girls envy the life y'all leadin'"], "meaning": "Envy sounds like “NV” which stands for Nevada. Las Vegas, which referenced in the song title, is located in the U.S. state.", "annotation_id": "40949735", "url": "https://genius.com/40949735", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "Ask Lo, ask Lo, I always request you", "vault_lines": ["Ask Lo, ask Lo, I always request you"], "meaning": "Ass Low, Ass low* Drake is referring to a stripper dancing low while in the club", "annotation_id": "39013868", "url": "https://genius.com/39013868", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "And she live in a mindset that I could never move to", "vault_lines": ["And she live in a mindset that I could never move to"], "meaning": "She lives in a mindset shaped by the fast-paced, party-driven lifestyle of Houstatlantavegas, one that Drake feels he could never fully adopt or relate to", "annotation_id": "38217527", "url": "https://genius.com/38217527", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "Houstatlantavegas (Ayy), Houstatlanta, she just stuck in Houstatlantavegas (Ayy), Houstatlantavegas (Ayy)", "vault_lines": ["Houstatlantavegas (Ayy), Houstatlanta, she just stuck in", "She just stuck in"], "meaning": "She’s trapped in a cycle of nonstop partying, money, and temptation. Houstatlantavegas represents this lifestyle, blending Houston, Atlanta, and Vegas.", "annotation_id": "38217485", "url": "https://genius.com/38217485", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "She doesn’t ever worry If she wants it, she’ll get it on her own She knows there’s more to life And she’s scared of ending up alone", "vault_lines": ["She doesn't ever worry", "If she wants it, she'll get it on her own", "She knows there's more to life", "And she's scared of ending up alone"], "meaning": "Drake describes her as independent and self-sufficient, confident that she can get what she wants without relying on anyone else, while also showing that beneath that confidence, she is aware there is more to life than this lifestyle and fears ending up emotionally alone", "annotation_id": "38214622", "url": "https://genius.com/38214622", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "You can’t resist it Especially when the light’s so bright And the money’s so right And it’s comin’ in every single night She don’t wanna leave", "vault_lines": ["You can't resist it", "Especially when the light's so bright", "And the money's so right", "And it's comin' in every single night", "She don't wanna leave"], "meaning": "She is attracted to the lifestyle because of the attention, spotlight, and consistent money, which makes it difficult for her to leave even if it becomes emotionally draining, trapping her in a repetitive cycle.", "annotation_id": "38214524", "url": "https://genius.com/38214524", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "Never satisfied with a nice calm evenin’", "vault_lines": ["Never satisfied with a nice calm evenin'"], "meaning": "two kinda evenings either you watch the orange sky or hit the strip club", "annotation_id": "32999153", "url": "https://genius.com/32999153", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "Until you find yourself, it’s impossible to lose you", "vault_lines": ["Until you find yourself, it's impossible to lose you"], "meaning": "The girl feels so alone and dependent that until she can take care of herself she will never leave his side", "annotation_id": "30648911", "url": "https://genius.com/30648911", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "You go get fucked up and we just show up at your rescue Carry you inside, get you some water and undress you I give you my all and the next morning you’ll forget who Or why, or how, or when Tonight, it’s prolly ’bout to happen all over again", "vault_lines": ["And I don't blame you at all", "You go get fucked up and we just show up at your rescue", "Carry you inside, get you some water and undress you", "I give you my all and the next morning you'll forget who", "Or why, or how, or when", "Tonight, it's prolly 'bout to happen all over again"], "meaning": "She’s had a wild night to the point where she can’t take care of herself so drake or whoever shows up to help her get herself together for bed, but by the next morning she’s so messed up or hungover from the night before that she won’t even know who they are because she was just not in the correct space of mind the night before to actually have took the time to meet them.", "annotation_id": "18366900", "url": "https://genius.com/18366900", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "'’Cause the ones you throw will get her out of", "vault_lines": ["''Cause the ones you throw will get her out of"], "meaning": "refers to the $1 bills being thrown at the stripper while she dances.\nthis money will keep her afloat and buy her flight ticket to the next city where she is going to be working more clubs.", "annotation_id": "20072995", "url": "https://genius.com/20072995", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "I’d probably go and tattoo your name on my heart I swear, I start to think that I’m going crazy", "vault_lines": ["I'd probably go and tattoo your name on my heart", "I swear, I start to think that I'm going crazy"], "meaning": "Drizzy is infatuated with this girl so much that he’s willing to permanently cement her onto his skin, such that he will see her name every time he looks in a mirror.\n\n\n\nUsually it’s the other way around – with the girl getting a regretful tattoo of a guy. That’s probably why Drizzy stops himself mid-thought and realizes this is an insane idea. He realizes he’s living in the present and not thinking at all about the future.\n\nTattoo your name across my heart\nSo it will remain\nNot even death could make us part\n\nNick Cannon didn’t have this revalation until it was too late…", "annotation_id": "4203152", "url": "https://genius.com/4203152", "state": "accepted", "votes": 26, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "Hey there, pretty girl You know exactly what you got And I don’t blame you at all", "vault_lines": ["Hey there, pretty girl", "You know exactly what you got", "And I don't blame you at all"], "meaning": "This chick uses her looks to lure in the guys. More specifically, she probably is getting man to throw more money her way when she strips.\n\n\n\nDrake doesn’t blame her, maybe because she’s just that hot, or maybe he’s had a few drinks. It’s most likely due to the fact that he just has a tendency to really understand the women.", "annotation_id": "1439259", "url": "https://genius.com/1439259", "state": "accepted", "votes": 34, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "All start peakin’, all-star weekend", "vault_lines": ["All start peakin', all-star weekend"], "meaning": "NBA All-Star games have taken place in both Las Vegas and Houston recently: hence that being a time when Drake would go to a city wiht strip clubs and see the girl in question\n\n\n“All Star Weekend” is also a huge partying event in Montreal which is famous amongst Canadian college kids for rampant hedonism (it’s awesome). Lots of people from Toronto (like Drake) go together and stay in the hotels downtown close to all the clubs", "annotation_id": "31159", "url": "https://genius.com/31159", "state": "accepted", "votes": 27, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Houstatlantavegas", "line": "And it go, “Hey now, now, watch her go down”", "vault_lines": ["And it go, \"Hey now, now, watch her go down\""], "meaning": "The stripper is dancing to R. Kelly’s “Bump N Grind Remix”\n\nFun fact: Juvenile’s “Rodeo,” another song about\nstrippers, sampled the remix as well.", "annotation_id": "30720", "url": "https://genius.com/30720", "state": "accepted", "votes": 44, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
