{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Right to Left", "line": "That you are les like NextSelection", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Drake is saying that if a female doesn’t like him, she must be a lesbian.\n\nNext Selection is Ryan Leslie’s (R-Les) label.", "annotation_id": "19860720", "url": "https://genius.com/19860720", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
