{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "One Night Stand", "line": "Said it started when I started liking pictures Making comments", "vault_lines": ["Said it started when I started liking pictures"], "meaning": "Specially now in the 21st century, social networks tend to play a much bigger role in social interactions. A whole new concept of interacting is being molded.\n\n\n\nLiking and commenting in somebody’s profile usually says you’re interested in that person. In the caso, he liked & made comments on her Facebook photos", "annotation_id": "3871575", "url": "https://genius.com/3871575", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
