{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "WNBA", "line": "Somebody’s birthday and the trips keep gettin’ longer Longer and longer", "vault_lines": ["Somebody's birthday and the trips keep gettin' longer", "And the trips keep gettin' longer and longer and longer", "Made those plans today and the trips keep gettin' longer, longer", "Longer and longer and longer", "And the trips keep gettin' longer", "Trips keep gettin' longer and longer and longer"], "meaning": "Every time Drake turns around, this woman is on another trip for another friend for their “birthday”. Now they are going from a few days to weeks at a time.", "annotation_id": "39959640", "url": "https://genius.com/39959640", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "WNBA", "line": "We’re both insecure, we both start to grow suspicious", "vault_lines": ["We're both insecure, we both start to grow suspicious"], "meaning": "Although they are not committed to one another. The idea of them seeing someone else, tends to lead the other thinking they already are. Whether true or not.", "annotation_id": "39959622", "url": "https://genius.com/39959622", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
