{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "WNBA", "line": "You’re pressure and pain", "vault_lines": ["You're pressure and pain"], "meaning": "Relevant quote: “The pain of grief is just as much a part of life as the joy of love; it is, perhaps, the price we pay for love, the cost of commitment.” — Colin Murray Parkes\nDrake is being honest here. Commitments create pressure, and love creates pain. Neither of these things are intentional, but true in most situations.", "annotation_id": "39857594", "url": "https://genius.com/39857594", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
