{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "All This Love", "line": "For more deals on the table than abridge game", "vault_lines": ["For more deals on the table than abridge game"], "meaning": "Bridge is a card game in which hands are called deals.  Drake is saying that there are more (record) deals on his metaphorical table (i.e. labels are trying to get him to sign) than a Bridge game.", "annotation_id": "244690", "url": "https://genius.com/244690", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "All This Love", "line": "I’m for real though I’m from Memphis, I’m often labeled as Trill so", "vault_lines": ["I'm for real though", "I'm from Memphis, I'm often labeled as Trill so"], "meaning": "In the South (i.e. Memphis) being called “trill” is a very positive thing (true & real).\n\nDrake spent much of his childhood in Memphis.", "annotation_id": "244676", "url": "https://genius.com/244676", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "All This Love", "line": "And the way that I Jack son, you figure Drake knew Sam L", "vault_lines": ["And the way that I Jack son, you figure Drake knew Sam L"], "meaning": "Sometimes women refer to a guy they want to fuck as a “jack”.\n\nDrake’s using wordplay to reference Samuel L Jackson.", "annotation_id": "244669", "url": "https://genius.com/244669", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
