{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOD", "line": "You know I’m a dog, I’m a hall pass demon", "vault_lines": ["You know I'm a dog, I'm a hall pass demon"], "meaning": "Drake acknowledges his player lifestyle, possibly referring to being unfaithful in relationships but getting away with it (“hall pass” implies permission).", "annotation_id": "34545121", "url": "https://genius.com/34545121", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOD", "line": "Holdin’ everybody heat ’cause they won’t find it on me", "vault_lines": ["Grind on me, grind on me", "Holdin' everybody heat 'cause they won't find it on me"], "meaning": "“Holdin' everybody heat ‘cause they won’t find it on me”\n“Heat” is slang for a firearm. This line suggests that Drake is around people who carry weapons, but he himself avoids being caught with one.", "annotation_id": "34545089", "url": "https://genius.com/34545089", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOD", "line": "I’m watchin’ the moves, I’m playin’ it close S.O.D. (Stacks on deck), super soak (Wet, wet)", "vault_lines": ["S.O.D. (S.O.D.), super soak (Wet, wet)", "Watchin' the moves, I'm playin' it close", "I'm watchin' the moves, I'm playin' it close", "S.O.D. (Stacks on deck)", ", super soak (Wet, wet)", "I'm watching the moves, I'm playin' it close"], "meaning": "A subliminal shot to Soulja Boy’s label Stacks On Deck Money Gang ,or how it’s commonly abbreviated ,SODMG.", "annotation_id": "33548402", "url": "https://genius.com/33548402", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOD", "line": "Watchin’ the moves, I’m playin’ it close S.O.D. (Stacks on deck), super soak (Wet, wet)", "vault_lines": ["S.O.D. (S.O.D.), super soak (Wet, wet)", "Watchin' the moves, I'm playin' it close", "I'm watchin' the moves, I'm playin' it close", "S.O.D. (Stacks on deck)", ", super soak (Wet, wet)", "I'm watching the moves, I'm playin' it close"], "meaning": "A subliminal shot to Soulja Boy’s label Stacks On Deck Money Gang ,or how it’s commonly abbreviated ,SODMG.", "annotation_id": "33548391", "url": "https://genius.com/33548391", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOD", "line": "Jet is so big, it feel like a boat, stayin’ afloat (Stayin’ afloat)", "vault_lines": ["We fuck on a jet, it feel like a boat, stayin' afloat, yeah (Stayin' afloat)", "Jet is so big, it feel like a boat, stayin' afloat (Stayin' afloat)"], "meaning": "Drake refers to his jet, “Air Drake” in this bar. Air Drake is a fully customized Boeing 676-200ER and features a cloud design and decals from tip to tail designed by none other than the late Virgil Abloh.\nThe interior was also fully refurbished, making this a truly special jet, not to mention one of the (if not the) biggest jets in the rap game.\n\nThe boat part in this verse may also be left over from when Yachty gave the song to Drake.", "annotation_id": "33265066", "url": "https://genius.com/33265066", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOD", "line": "We fuck on a jet, it feel like a boat, stayin’ afloat, yeah (Stayin’ afloat)", "vault_lines": ["We fuck on a jet, it feel like a boat, stayin' afloat, yeah (Stayin' afloat)", "Jet is so big, it feel like a boat, stayin' afloat (Stayin' afloat)"], "meaning": "Drake refers to his jet, “Air Drake” in this bar. Air Drake is a fully customized Boeing 676-200ER and features a cloud design and decals from tip to tail designed by none other than the late Virgil Abloh.\nThe interior was also fully refurbished, making this a truly special jet, not to mention one of the (if not the) biggest jets in the rap game.\n\nThe boat part in this verse may also be left over from when Yachty gave the song to Drake.", "annotation_id": "33265057", "url": "https://genius.com/33265057", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOD", "line": "Jet is so big, it feel like a boat, stayin’ afloat (Stayin’ afloat)", "vault_lines": ["We fuck on a jet, it feel like a boat, stayin' afloat, yeah (Stayin' afloat)", "Jet is so big, it feel like a boat, stayin' afloat (Stayin' afloat)"], "meaning": "Drake refers to his jet, “Air Drake” in this bar. Air Drake is a fully customized Boeing 676-200ER and features a cloud design and decals from tip to tail designed by none other than the late Virgil Abloh.\nThe interior was also fully refurbished, making this a truly special jet, not to mention one of the (if not the) biggest jets in the rap game.\n\nThe boat part in this verse may also be left over from when Yachty gave the song to Drake.", "annotation_id": "33264800", "url": "https://genius.com/33264800", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOD", "line": "Four Seasons", "vault_lines": ["Shawty wanna ride at the Four Seasons"], "meaning": "Four Seasons is a Canadian luxury hotel and resort company with headquarters at Toronto, Ontario, Canada.\n\nThe Four Seasons Hotel has also featured in various hip hop cultural happenings. For one, the never-ending Drake/Meek Mill beef saw Drizzy on “Summer Sixteen” speaking “Out in front of Four Seasons”\n\nChecked here: https://medium.com/true-too/what-is-hip-hops-infatuation-with-the-four-seasons-hotel-dc050a279c95", "annotation_id": "33075601", "url": "https://genius.com/33075601", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
