{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOD", "line": "Both ears, right wrist, all that’s freezin’", "vault_lines": ["Both ears, right wrist, all that's freezin'"], "meaning": "“Freezin'” is referring to “ice”/diamonds. So Drake has diamond studs and diamonds on his watch.", "annotation_id": "32792928", "url": "https://genius.com/32792928", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOD", "line": "Who said I can’t dance with a 9 on, 9 on, 9 on, 9 on, 9 on me?", "vault_lines": ["Grind on me, grind on me", "Who said I can't dance with a 9 on, 9 on, 9 on, 9 on, 9 on me?", "Who am I? Who am I?"], "meaning": "He can still party on the dance floor even though he’s got a 9mm handgun on him.\n\nThis is similar to Eminem’s line in Fat Joe’s song “Lean Back Remix”:\n\nShake that ass a little more my way, but baby, I don’t dance not that I can’t, there’s a pistol in my pants, come on", "annotation_id": "32785074", "url": "https://genius.com/32785074", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
