{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Housekeeping Knows", "line": "Attitude on Clayco, but my ass is on Brazil", "vault_lines": ["Attitude on Clayco, but my ass is on Brazil"], "meaning": "Latto is saying since she from Clayco (the metropolitan area of Atlanta, Georgia) she got an atlanta attitude\n\n“ ass is on Brazil ” is a way of Latto implying Brazilian butt lift (BBL) she has.", "annotation_id": "32622410", "url": "https://genius.com/32622410", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Housekeeping Knows", "line": "Up in the 6, up, up in the 6 Up in the 6, they do whatever they feel", "vault_lines": ["Up in the 6, up, up in the 6", "Up in the 6, they do whatever they feel"], "meaning": "“6” refers to Drake’s hometown of Toronto, as “6” is short for Toronto area codes “416” and “647”, and also refers to Toronto’s six boroughs, being East York, Etobicoke, North York, Scarborough, Toronto, and York.", "annotation_id": "32583019", "url": "https://genius.com/32583019", "state": "accepted", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
