{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Juice", "line": "And yeah, my G-pass is as valid as can be", "vault_lines": ["And yeah, my G-pass is as valid as can be"], "meaning": "A G-pass is a pass that certifies one as a gangster (although it was probably given to him by Lil Wayne)\n\nG-pass can also be considered the highest ranked Canadian driver license. (Ontario)", "annotation_id": "47235", "url": "https://genius.com/47235", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Juice", "line": "While you and all your homeboys hang in Lenox Mall", "vault_lines": ["While you and all your homeboys hang in Lenox Mall"], "meaning": "You could care less about Drake fucking your girl since you’re “shuttin' shit down at the mall” with your homies\n\nLenox mall is a shopping center located in Atlanta.", "annotation_id": "47232", "url": "https://genius.com/47232", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Juice", "line": "I can’t see you through the Mosley Tribes So I don’t even flinch if you throw me high-fives", "vault_lines": ["I can't see you through the Mosley Tribes", "So I don't even flinch if you throw me high-fives"], "meaning": "Mosley Tribes are a brand of shades that Drake often wears\n\nDrake’s are so dark that he can barely see through them (so he probably shouldn’t drive in them, right?)", "annotation_id": "44139", "url": "https://genius.com/44139", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Juice", "line": "Twenty-thousand for a verse is our routine quote", "vault_lines": ["Twenty-thousand for a verse is our routine quote"], "meaning": "Whenever a rapper asks to feature him on a song, he usually (at that time) would quote $20,000, although by now, it’s probably over a few hundred thousand.", "annotation_id": "44135", "url": "https://genius.com/44135", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Juice", "line": "I’m still fly, you can’t float", "vault_lines": ["I'm still fly, you can't float"], "meaning": "If you’re “fly,” you’re cooler than everyone else. You’re also way above sea level, whereas someone who can’t float is below sea level, meaning they’re lame\n\nAlso a play on the title of his “I’m Still Fly” freestyle", "annotation_id": "44134", "url": "https://genius.com/44134", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Juice", "line": "Run this shit, Usain Bolt", "vault_lines": ["Run this shit, Usain Bolt"], "meaning": "Usain Bolt was the Gold Medal champion in the 2008 summer olympics in 100m, 200m, and 4x100m. Usain Bolt continues to dominate these events, and in other words, he runs this shit!\n\nHe also had a documentary about him called “Usain Bolt: The Fastest Man Alive”.", "annotation_id": "44130", "url": "https://genius.com/44130", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
