{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Lake Como*", "line": "All these other niggas been actin’ like they woke", "vault_lines": ["All these other niggas been actin' like they woke"], "meaning": "Drake calls out rappers who portray themselves as woke or conscious primarily for the mass appeal or trendiness rather than genuine conviction. This can be interpreted as an allusion to Kendrick Lamar whom Drake believe is adopting the woke persona just as a mere marketing strategy.\n\nThis perspective aligns with Drake’s one decade old sentiment on The Game’s song “100” (2015), where he raps:\n\nI would have all of your fans\nIf I didn’t go pop and I stayed on some conscious shit\n\n\n\nKendrick Lamar performing, whilst shackled in chains, at the 2016 Grammys", "annotation_id": "36832085", "url": "https://genius.com/36832085", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Lake Como*", "line": "Aperol Spritz", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Continuing with the Italian theme, Aperol Spritz is an orange-colored Italian cocktail made of Prosecco, Aperol, club soda with an orange slice for garnish.", "annotation_id": "36825925", "url": "https://genius.com/36825925", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Lake Como*", "line": "Lake Como, Cigarette Boat", "vault_lines": ["Lake Como, Cigarette Boat"], "meaning": "Lake Como, in Northern Italy’s Lombardy region, is an upscale resort area, a favoured retreat area for the wealthy due to its views, villas and tranquility.\n\nCigarette Racing boats are high performance luxury yachts that are highly desirable and expensive.", "annotation_id": "36818563", "url": "https://genius.com/36818563", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
