{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Don’t Worry", "line": "B4U and O, they gettin’ kicked up out the lobby (Ayy, ayy)", "vault_lines": ["B4U and O, they gettin' kicked up out the lobby (Ayy, ayy)", "Before you went old and getting kicked up out the lobby (Ayy, ayy)"], "meaning": "This is a double entendre because B4U is also the name of the producer. “Before you/B4U” had been kicked out of a lobby.", "annotation_id": "39799014", "url": "https://genius.com/39799014", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
