{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Don’t Worry", "line": "She wanna go next door, she wanna meet PARTY (Ayy, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["She wanna go next door, she wanna meet PARTY (Ayy, yeah)"], "meaning": "Drake is referencing his friend and record label member PARTYNEXTDOOR.\n\nPARTYNEXTDOOR is a Canadian artist who was the first to sign to Drake’s OVO Sound label back in 2013.\n\nThe pair have featured in over 30 songs together, with the two releasing a joint album titled $ome $exy $ongs 4 U in February 2025.", "annotation_id": "39776566", "url": "https://genius.com/39776566", "state": "pending", "votes": -3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
