{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Privileged Rappers", "line": "Textin’ emojis, tongue out, eggplant, must’ve went over her head (21)", "vault_lines": ["Textin' emojis, tongue out, eggplant, must've went over her head (21)"], "meaning": "This bar is able to go with the previous bar. This is referring to lame ass dudes instead of being direct they texting wit emojis on what they wanted to do. This could also just mean plain and simple she don’t fuck wit bro like dat therefore the emojis “going over her head”", "annotation_id": "27746672", "url": "https://genius.com/27746672", "state": "pending", "votes": -8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Privileged Rappers", "line": "Why you pull up at 1 in the morning and sit on the edge of the bed? (For what?)", "vault_lines": ["Why you pull up at one in the morning and sit on the edge of the bed? (For what?)"], "meaning": "Of Course this is referring to “sneaky linking”, but dude snuck in and is too pussy to make the first move therefore sitting at the edge of the bed instead of laying it down.", "annotation_id": "27746668", "url": "https://genius.com/27746668", "state": "pending", "votes": -5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Privileged Rappers", "line": "Catch him outside of the studio (Pussy), make him repeat what he said (Pussy, pussy)", "vault_lines": ["Catch him outside of the studio (Pussy), make him repeat what he said (Pussy, pussy)"], "meaning": "21 Savage is talking about rappers who diss/sneak diss him in songs. He’s going to catch them outside the studio and make them repeat what they said. This is unlikely to happen since they’re scared of 21 Savage in real life and they’re bluffing and capping (lying) in their songs.", "annotation_id": "27162467", "url": "https://genius.com/27162467", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Privileged Rappers", "line": "I hate a privileged rapper that ain’t had a hit since he signed", "vault_lines": ["I hate a privileged rapper that ain't had a hit since he signed (Let's do it)"], "meaning": "Drake talking about rappers who don’t have what it takes to make a hit song when they get signed. They be dropping mid (average) songs. Unmotivated and lazy to take their craft seriously.", "annotation_id": "27090326", "url": "https://genius.com/27090326", "state": "accepted", "votes": 27, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Privileged Rappers", "line": "4L step team steppin’ on shit ’til it’s quiet", "vault_lines": ["4L step team steppin' on shit 'til it's quiet"], "meaning": "4L is 21 a 21’s gang/group. Stepping on shit means killing all the opps till they’re dead.", "annotation_id": "27090275", "url": "https://genius.com/27090275", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Privileged Rappers", "line": "Niggas be full of excuses, act like they takin’ they time (For real, for real)", "vault_lines": ["Niggas be full of excuses, act like they takin' they time (For real, for real)"], "meaning": "This is a possible shot at long time rival Kendrick Lamar, as there was a lengthy 5 year gap, 1,855 days to be exact, between his last two studio albums, 2017’s DAMN. and 2022’s Mr Morale & The Big Steppers, in which off the track “Worldwide Steppers” Kendrick proclaimed he had writer’s block for two years and therefore took his time crafting his recent project. Drake dismisses this reasoning as an excuse which does not justify a 5 year wait, taking a jab at Kendrick’s pedigree as an emcee.\n\nDrake and Kendrick have been in a war of subliminals ever since Kendrick’s infamous “Control” verse, hence why this could be another competitive jab towards him.", "annotation_id": "27084178", "url": "https://genius.com/27084178", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Privileged Rappers", "line": "Niggas don’t know how I live, but that’s ’cause they live at the Hyatt, ayy", "vault_lines": ["Niggas don't know how I live, but that's 'cause they live at the Hyatt, ayy"], "meaning": "Hyatt Hotels & Resorts is a company that franchises luxury hotels, all-inclusive resorts, and vacation properties.", "annotation_id": "27072004", "url": "https://genius.com/27072004", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Privileged Rappers", "line": "Make a diss and see how fast you go from the booth to a blunt (Pussy)", "vault_lines": ["Make a diss and see how fast you go from the booth to a blunt (Pussy)"], "meaning": "Putting someone in a blunt, also called smoking a pack, is a way to disrespect opps after they’re killed. Being a famous rapper, 21 knows he is a valuable target, but he still isn’t backing down if someone disrespects his name.\n\nMoreover, booth is a homophone of boof which is a slang term for weed.", "annotation_id": "27067918", "url": "https://genius.com/27067918", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
