{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Privileged Rappers", "line": "How you come over to the spot when you know it’s your time of the month? (How?)", "vault_lines": ["How you come over to the spot when you know it's your time of the month? (How?)"], "meaning": "21 Savage claims to be disappointed when this certain woman he might have a “connection” with, wanted to come over for her own benefit at her presence, claiming she’s on her menstrual period when 21 Savage’s intentions was to “make love” with her.", "annotation_id": "27052860", "url": "https://genius.com/27052860", "state": "accepted", "votes": 35, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
