{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "What I’m Thinkin’ Right Now", "line": "So read 48 Laws if you never read it Because that is one of the main reasons I’m level-headed", "vault_lines": ["So read 48 Laws if you never read it", "Because that is one of the main reasons I'm level-headed"], "meaning": "Most people are born naive when it comes to dealing with other people, who can be political and manipulative. The 48 Laws will open your eyes up to some of the darker aspects of human nature and make it easier for you to maintain your emotional equilibrium when you face off with the manipulators and other power types.", "annotation_id": "1333125", "url": "https://genius.com/1333125", "state": "verified", "votes": 22, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
