{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "My girl, you’re so underappreciated (The tricks) Just ’cause your body ain’t PG-rated", "vault_lines": ["My girl, you're so underappreciated (The tricks)", "Just 'cause your body ain't PG-rated"], "meaning": "PG-rated means that something is suitable for general viewing.. Drake considers that his girl is not given the credit she deserves due to the stereotypes associated with the sexualization of Big Beautiful Women (BBW)", "annotation_id": "41076494", "url": "https://genius.com/41076494", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "No girl makes me feel like this", "vault_lines": ["I swear no girl makes me feel like this", "No girl makes me feel like this", "No girl makes me feel like"], "meaning": "So basically, here Drake says that he just happens to found a girl, that indeed makes him feel something different, in comparison with other girls.\n\nThis bar emphasises his large catalog of women too.", "annotation_id": "40746982", "url": "https://genius.com/40746982", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "I’ma rep every fuckin’ hood I’m ’bout to rep every hood, so you just need to start shaking If you got an oyster, suck it If you got a drink in your hand, sip your drink while you shaking Bitch, I don’t give a fuck, show me a new trick", "vault_lines": ["I'ma rep every fuckin' hood", "I'm 'bout to rep every hood, so you just need to start shaking", "If you got an oyster, suck it", "If you got a drink in your hand, sip your drink while you shaking", "Bitch, I don't give a fuck, show me a new trick"], "meaning": "The intro before the song starts features a sample of Hasizzle, a New Orleans rapper and veteran of the bounce music scene. It was likely taken from one of his live events, where he’s hyping up the crowd before a bounce record gets played.", "annotation_id": "40206130", "url": "https://genius.com/40206130", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "So much ass you should be cremated", "vault_lines": ["So much ass you should be cremated"], "meaning": "The woman Drake is addressing has an ass of such proportions that it would be impossible for her body to fit in a casket, so he suggests she should be cremated instead.\n\nNote that he slurs his pronunciation of “ass” so that it sounds like “ash”, which is exactly what you get from being cremated.", "annotation_id": "39972353", "url": "https://genius.com/39972353", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "Big girl, I will show you what I’m made of", "vault_lines": ["Big girl, I will show you what I'm made of"], "meaning": "“Big Girl” is a subtle reference to that Drake likes fat bitches.", "annotation_id": "39813269", "url": "https://genius.com/39813269", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "Take you to town Girl, let me lead the way (The tricks)", "vault_lines": ["Girl, let me lead the way", "Take you to town"], "meaning": "“Take you to town” is a play on the phrase “going to town.” Going to town on something means to do something with a sense of enthusiasm, completeness, or vigor.\n\nThis line is referring to sexual climax. Drake is implying that he will “lead” her “to town,” which represents sexual climax.", "annotation_id": "39807422", "url": "https://genius.com/39807422", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "Tell me, what’s the ETA?", "vault_lines": ["Tell me, what's the ETA?"], "meaning": "ETA stands for Estimated Time of Arrival. Drake is asking the subject of this song when they will be arriving.", "annotation_id": "39807337", "url": "https://genius.com/39807337", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "Let her do what she want, my baby Letter just like abbreviations", "vault_lines": ["Let her do what she want, my baby", "Letter just like abbreviations"], "meaning": "This is a play on the phrase “Let her.” In the first line, he says “let her do what she wants.” In the second line, he says “Letter” (let her) just like abbreviations.\n\nTwo common types of abbreviations are “initialisms” and “acronyms.” Both types use the first letter of each word in a phrase to create a shortened version of the phrase.", "annotation_id": "39807240", "url": "https://genius.com/39807240", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "I’m gonna need new bed if you jumping on me like that (The tricks)", "vault_lines": ["I'm gonna need new bed if you jumping on me like that (The tricks)"], "meaning": "If the woman jumps on top of him in bed, they might damage the bed due to her heavy weight.", "annotation_id": "39807170", "url": "https://genius.com/39807170", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "Come closer, I’m not afraid We both know my type, it’s okay", "vault_lines": ["Come closer, I'm not afraid", "We both know my type, it's okay"], "meaning": "This song is about a BBW (Big Beautiful Woman). Drake is assuring the woman that he is not intimidated by her large size, and that his affinity for women with her body type is well known. Therefore she should not feel ashamed or insecure.", "annotation_id": "39807127", "url": "https://genius.com/39807127", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "BBW", "line": "I swear no girl makes me feel like this", "vault_lines": ["I swear no girl makes me feel like this", "No girl makes me feel like this", "No girl makes me feel like"], "meaning": "Women besides the woman Drake is talking about don’t seem to give him the same feelings as this one does.", "annotation_id": "39794418", "url": "https://genius.com/39794418", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
