{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Prioritizing", "line": "You write me heartfelt words, I find out Chat’s behind ’em", "vault_lines": ["You write me heartfelt words, I find out Chat's behind 'em"], "meaning": "The lyric should be “I find out Chat’s behind it” in reference to ChatGPT’s prompt functionality and ability to write heartfelt messages.", "annotation_id": "39785378", "url": "https://genius.com/39785378", "state": "pending", "votes": 22, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Prioritizing", "line": "I feel like my phone knows we’re talking I think that the news knows we’re watching", "vault_lines": ["I feel like my phone knows we're talking", "I think that the news knows we're watching"], "meaning": "Here, Drake references the paranoia he is feeling in his “life right now”, a common theme which can also be seen in ‘Make Them Cry.’", "annotation_id": "39784362", "url": "https://genius.com/39784362", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Prioritizing", "line": "A.I. used to be some guy we tried to be like", "vault_lines": ["A.I. used to be some guy we tried to be like"], "meaning": "The lyric should be “A.I.” instead of “Ayy, I”. A.I. is in reference to both Allen Iverson and artificial intelligence.", "annotation_id": "39778137", "url": "https://genius.com/39778137", "state": "pending", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Prioritizing", "line": "Your engagement ring needs diamond testing", "vault_lines": ["Your engagement ring needs diamond testing"], "meaning": "Drake is suggesting to this girl that she needs her diamond ring tested because whoever gave it to her can’t actually afford a real diamond ring.", "annotation_id": "39776835", "url": "https://genius.com/39776835", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
