{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Milli Freestyle", "line": "Please comprehend I am a Surf Club general", "vault_lines": ["Please comprehend I am a Surf Club general"], "meaning": "SF members are a talented group of writers, producers, and artists as well, including Chase N Cashe, Hit-Boy, Kent M$NEY, Chili Chil, Stacy Barthe, Young Ry, and B. Carr, who produced Wiz Khalifa’s “Hopes And Dreams.”", "annotation_id": "1495921", "url": "https://genius.com/1495921", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Milli Freestyle", "line": "Ask your favorite rapper homie guarantee that he know", "vault_lines": ["Ask your favorite rapper homie guarantee that he know"], "meaning": "Drake is saying that everyone’s favourite rapper or just big/talented rappers know about him. Which is now defiantly true, he has worked with Lil Wayne, Jay-Z and many more.\n\nTwo examples of Drake working with Lil Wayne is Miss Me and H.Y.F.R (Hell Ya Fucking Right). An example of Drake working with Jay-Z is a song called Light Up on Drake’s first album, Thank Me Later.", "annotation_id": "1022182", "url": "https://genius.com/1022182", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Milli Freestyle", "line": "Look, I’m really the heir to the fortune of a millionaire", "vault_lines": ["Look, I’m really the heir to the fortune of a millionaire"], "meaning": "In this line, Drake is saying that he’s the heir to a lot of money from his family, who are fairly successful.\n\nHe’s also the heir to Cash Money, which is the fortune of the millionaires (both metaphorically and actually) Slim, Birdman and Lil Wayne.", "annotation_id": "1016644", "url": "https://genius.com/1016644", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Milli Freestyle", "line": "So well spoken man I should have went to Cambridge", "vault_lines": ["So well spoken man I should have went to Cambridge"], "meaning": "Cambridge is unquestionably one of the two top universities in the United Kingdom. Drake boasts here that he is so articulate and eloquent that he should have gone to a top University like Cambridge.", "annotation_id": "871146", "url": "https://genius.com/871146", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
