{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Would you have your bags packed at departure? Ayy", "vault_lines": ["Would you have your bags packed at departure? Ayy"], "meaning": "Basically Drake wants to know if she would just up and leave or would she stick around.", "annotation_id": "40079162", "url": "https://genius.com/40079162", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "What if I just end up back where we started? What if I can’t take this shit any farther?", "vault_lines": ["What if I just end up back where we started?", "What if I can't take this shit any farther?"], "meaning": "Fear of the cycle repeating — leaving but circling back to the same pain.", "annotation_id": "39959910", "url": "https://genius.com/39959910", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Spit it in your mouth ’cause you like that shit harsh", "vault_lines": ["Spit it in your mouth 'cause you like that shit harsh"], "meaning": "Means delivering raw, brutal truth (or dominance) because she gets off on the intensity and roughness.\n\nOr, she is just a freak and likes the rougher side of sex, such as having he partner spit in her mouth", "annotation_id": "39959888", "url": "https://genius.com/39959888", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Why are you and all your girls fallin’ apart? Put it on your last, then you livin’ large", "vault_lines": ["Why are you and all your girls fallin' apart?", "Put it on your last, then you livin' large", "Spend on you, spend on you, spend on you"], "meaning": "“Why are you and all your girls fallin’ apart?”\n\nQuestions the drama and breakdowns in her circle/relationship — calling out instability.\n\n“Put it on your last, then you livin’ large”\n\nMeans betting everything on your final shot/partner, then living big once it hits.", "annotation_id": "39959876", "url": "https://genius.com/39959876", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Know your love ain’t free (Know your love ain’t free) What’s the cost gon’ be? (Yeah, what’s the price?)", "vault_lines": ["Know your love ain't free (Know your love ain't free)", "What's the cost gon' be? (Yeah, what's the pricе?)"], "meaning": "Basically, Loe is ready to spend money and trick on her.", "annotation_id": "39959523", "url": "https://genius.com/39959523", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "She doing all that talking, I can’t wait to see (Is you gon’ back it up?)", "vault_lines": ["She doing all that talking, I can't wait to see (Is you gon' back it up?)"], "meaning": "We all have dealt with a person who talks a good game, but when you get them behind closed doors, they come off shy and inexperienced. Loe is hoping this one is different.", "annotation_id": "39959513", "url": "https://genius.com/39959513", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "I’m fly just like a pilot, sting just like a bee (Pilot) Your favorite rapper can’t go off the head like me", "vault_lines": ["I'm fly just like a pilot, sting just like a bee (Pilot)", "Your favorite rapper can't go off the head like me"], "meaning": "Loe Shimmy is referring to his style, fashion wise, when he says “Fly like a pilot, and holds his own on  on his tracks, when he says \"Stings like a bee”. And to cap it off, unlike many other rappers, he comes up with his lyrics off the top of his head.", "annotation_id": "39959487", "url": "https://genius.com/39959487", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "I’m just not anybody (Not anybody)", "vault_lines": ["I'm just not anybody (Not anybody)"], "meaning": "Loe Shimmy is being upfront and explaining that he is a guy in an exclusive club, his tax bracket is higher than the average.", "annotation_id": "39959447", "url": "https://genius.com/39959447", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Fleur-de-lis, I swear you hit New Orleans too hard", "vault_lines": ["Fleur-de-lis, I swear you hit New Orleans too hard"], "meaning": "The “Fleur-de-lis” is a French term for “Flower of the Lily” and is a historical symbol of French Royalty and also the logo of the NFL’s New Orleans Saints.\n\nHistorically, the Fleur-de-lis is connected to French nobility and the flower itself was said to be gifted to French Monarchy from the Virgin Mary in religious ceremonies. The three petals often represent the Holy Trinity and the flower represents purity.\n\nDrake is calling his girl pure and a virgin, while also questioning her frequent partying in NOLA.\n\nThis is also him acknowledging that she’s most likely truly not a virgin but to him she’s pure and is a callback to his verse in his 2015 hit track ‘Energy’ where he says:\n\n“I got strippers in my life, but they virgins to me”", "annotation_id": "39892266", "url": "https://genius.com/39892266", "state": "pending", "votes": -3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "I done made a name, I’m Super Z (I’m super zombie, bae), ayy", "vault_lines": ["I done made a name, I'm Super Z (I'm super zombie, bae), ayy"], "meaning": "Loe Shimmy has many albums that include the letter Z or zombie in the title.\nZuper PowerZ (2021)\nZ end (2022)\nZombieland 2.6 (2024)\nZombieland 2 (2024)\nThe Z files (2024)", "annotation_id": "39887941", "url": "https://genius.com/39887941", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Lease a yacht in St. Barts", "vault_lines": ["Made me want a lease a yacht in St. Barts"], "meaning": "Lease a = Lisa Simpson\nSt. Barts = Bart Simpson\nDrake mentions Homer and Marge from the Simpsons a few lines ago.", "annotation_id": "39883516", "url": "https://genius.com/39883516", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Homer diamonds sittin’ on my broken heart Swear I blew your head up, I should call you Marge", "vault_lines": ["Homer diamonds sittin' on my broken heart", "Swear I blew your head up, I should call you Marge", "Spend on you, spend on you, spend on you"], "meaning": "PROPOSED SUGGESTION:\n\n“ Homer “ is frank oceans company they have luxury Diamonds and it’s also the name of the famous Simpsons character.\nBlew your head up I should call you Marge because “ Marge Simpsons’s “ head is blue. Genius combo.", "annotation_id": "39823356", "url": "https://genius.com/39823356", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Take this shit and swallow it like Big Pharma", "vault_lines": ["Take this shit and swallow it like Big Pharma"], "meaning": "Drake a freak, telling her to swallow it either as a reference to a pill or something else… Just like big pharma he pushing stuff into mouths (pause)", "annotation_id": "39876246", "url": "https://genius.com/39876246", "state": "pending", "votes": -3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Fuck on me and then you just get out of Dodge", "vault_lines": ["Fuck on me and then you just get out of Dodge", "Spend on you, spend on you, spend on you"], "meaning": "Drake is basically saying: He has sex with his ting and then she just up and leaves. “Get out of Dodge” means to leave a place quickly to escape a bad situation. It originates from the lawless 1870s wild-west town of Dodge City, Kansas. The phrase was later popularized by the 1950s TV show Gunsmoke, where outlaws were ordered to clear out. Today, it means making a hasty exit from a sticky situation.", "annotation_id": "39857421", "url": "https://genius.com/39857421", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Take it off for me (You better not run from zombie) Take it off for me (You better not run from zombie)", "vault_lines": ["Take it off for me (You better not run from zombie)"], "meaning": "This line alludes LOE Shimmy’s song with Brent Faiyaz, “For Me” , in which they also repeat the line:\n\nTake it off for me\n\nZombie is a nickname for LOE Shimmy, referencing his debut EP Zombieland", "annotation_id": "39853210", "url": "https://genius.com/39853210", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Come show me you gon’ ride it ’til we get on E", "vault_lines": ["Spend on you, spend on you, spend on you", "Come show me you gon' ride it (Show me you gon' ride it)", "Come show me you gon' ride it 'til we get on E"], "meaning": "Getting “on E” means a car is in its fuel reserves, in reference to him and his partners energy.\nPlaying on words to describe sexual acts", "annotation_id": "39853126", "url": "https://genius.com/39853126", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
