{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Would you just go missin’ like milk carton?", "vault_lines": ["Would you just go missin' like milk carton?"], "meaning": "Drake is using a metaphor based on the old “missing person” photos printed on milk cartons in places like the U.S. during the 1980s and 1990s.\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/DMX_vpQsTXK/", "annotation_id": "39831884", "url": "https://genius.com/39831884", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "What if I go broke and I got no more racks to spend on you?", "vault_lines": ["If I go broke and ain't got no more racks to spend", "What if I go broke and I got no more racks to spend on you?", "Spend on you, spend on you, spend on you", "What if I got no more racks to spend on you?"], "meaning": "Possibly a line about Baby M, Drake’s muse for Hours In Silence. Drake notoriously paid her lawyer fees & her settlement amount to settle a legal case she was the accused in.", "annotation_id": "39829819", "url": "https://genius.com/39829819", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "What if I go broke and I got no more racks to spend on you?", "vault_lines": ["If I go broke and ain't got no more racks to spend", "What if I go broke and I got no more racks to spend on you?", "Spend on you, spend on you, spend on you", "What if I got no more racks to spend on you?"], "meaning": "Possibly a line about Baby M, Drake’s muse for Hours In Silence. Drake notoriously paid her lawyer fees & her settlement amount to settle a legal case she was the accused in.", "annotation_id": "39828661", "url": "https://genius.com/39828661", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "You fuckin’ on a Sav just like Big Mama", "vault_lines": ["You fuckin' on a Sav just like Big Mama", "Spend on you, spend on you, spend on you"], "meaning": "He mentions this as pertains to Latto (Big Mama) & 21 savage. The couple confirmed they were expecting their first child together when Latto debuted her pregnancy in her music video for “Business & Personal (Intro)”. Following the release, 21 Savage seemingly confirmed he is the father by posting Latto on his social media.", "annotation_id": "39824049", "url": "https://genius.com/39824049", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m Spent", "line": "Lick me like a lollipop, I’m Dwayne Carter", "vault_lines": ["Lick me like a lollipop, I'm Dwayne Carter"], "meaning": "Reference to Lil Wayne, real name Dwayne Carter, and his 2008 hit song “Lollipop” from Tha Carter III:\n\nShe-she-she licked me like a lollipop (Yeah)\nShe, she licked me like a lollipop, l-lollipop (Yeah)\nSh-sh-she licked me like a lollipop (Yeah)\nShe, she licked me like a lollipop, lollipop", "annotation_id": "39776570", "url": "https://genius.com/39776570", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
