{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Stuck", "line": "That just means that I took the Pamelor pill and we’re breakin’ it up", "vault_lines": ["That doesn't mean that we're breakin' up", "That just means that I took the Pamelor pill and we're breakin' it up"], "meaning": "Pamelor is the brand name for nortriptyline, a prescription antidepressant\n\nRather than referencing a breakup when talking about “splitting up”, Drake is talking about splitting the pill to share with his girl", "annotation_id": "38828835", "url": "https://genius.com/38828835", "state": "pending", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
