{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Side Pieces", "line": "I had a rough game I took two shots I was 0 for 2", "vault_lines": ["I had a rough game I took two shots I was 0 for 2"], "meaning": "A reference to Roy Hibbert’s disastorous game in the 2014 playoffs, when he had 0 points, 0 rebounds and 5 fouls. He shot 0 for 2.", "annotation_id": "3476200", "url": "https://genius.com/3476200", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Side Pieces", "line": "(Probably in the top balcony)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "The cheap seats/nose bleed seats. Reiterating  the point of a side piece they don’t get the benefits of being someone’s number one. They only get second best and front rows seats are out of the question for a side piece.", "annotation_id": "3441258", "url": "https://genius.com/3441258", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Side Pieces", "line": "Skylar this is the one thing that I’d be for you", "vault_lines": ["Skylar this is the one thing that I'd be for you"], "meaning": "Drake wouldn’t normally be a side piece for anybody, but he makes an exception for WNBA player Skylar Diggins. After a couple Instagram posts\n\n\n\nhttp://instagram.com/p/onGfdhDQER/?modal=true\nand some speculation, Drake officially declares his love for her on national T.V.\nLuckily for him, him dreams came true later that night.\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gtVr72d94nY", "annotation_id": "3439474", "url": "https://genius.com/3439474", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
