{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ESPYS: Honorable Mention", "line": "Yeah, season’s over, just hold on you’re going home", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, season's over, just hold on you're going home"], "meaning": "Playing off the title to his hit song “Hold On We’re Going Home” Drake says once the season is over then the players return back to their homes for the off-season.", "annotation_id": "3441443", "url": "https://genius.com/3441443", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ESPYS: Honorable Mention", "line": "Bartender I think I’ll have a Triple Crown", "vault_lines": ["Bartender I think I'll have a Triple Crown"], "meaning": "The Triple Crown is a sporting achievement in the sport of horse racing, with a horse winning three races at the Kentucky Derby, Belmont Stakes, and Preakness in the same year. Drake is referring to the horse “I’ll Have Another” who won at the Kentucky Derby and Preakness but couldn’t race the Belmont Stakes due to tendinitis.", "annotation_id": "3441432", "url": "https://genius.com/3441432", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ESPYS: Honorable Mention", "line": "And now the whole the whole U.S of A are soccer fans too", "vault_lines": ["And now the whole the whole U.S of A are soccer fans too"], "meaning": "Americans are highly criticized for not caring about soccer all over the world. However, as soon as World Cup 2014 started and USA reached the next round, a lot of ‘soccer fans’ popped up out of nowhere.", "annotation_id": "3440489", "url": "https://genius.com/3440489", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ESPYS: Honorable Mention", "line": "Collin Kaepernick you know I love to see you flexing It’s just a damn shame that Michael Crabtree can’t catch it", "vault_lines": ["Collin Kaepernick you know I love to see you flexing", "It's just a damn shame that Michael Crabtree can't catch it"], "meaning": "Colin Kaepernick has his own trademark touchdown celebration where he flexes his bicep and acts like he is kissing it:\n\n\n\nDrake loves to see Colin score touchdowns, but you can’t due to that when one of your receivers, Michael Crabtree, can’t catch.\n\n\n\nIt’s also worth noting that Crabtree only had 1 TD in the 8 games he played last season.", "annotation_id": "3440421", "url": "https://genius.com/3440421", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ESPYS: Honorable Mention", "line": "Can’t deal with life’s hurdles like you’re Lolo Jones", "vault_lines": ["Can't deal with life's hurdles like you're Lolo Jones"], "meaning": "Lolo Jones is an athlete who specializes in the 60 and 100 meter hurdles, and she recently sent shots at Drake on social media:\n\nhttps://twitter.com/lolojones/status/454405650647228416\n\nHe gets back at her by punning on “hurdles” because, you know, she fell at the Olympics and has problems with finding a boyfriend.", "annotation_id": "3440374", "url": "https://genius.com/3440374", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ESPYS: Honorable Mention", "line": "Honorable mention works for me and you Honorable mention, hey, hey", "vault_lines": ["Honorable mention works for me and you", "Honorable mention, hey, hey"], "meaning": "KD, was mentioned on the fact that he should win a Championship, just like Drake was a nominee for the Grammy’s Best Rap Album of 2014 award. They were a good run, but they both didn’t win.\nhttp://instagram.com/p/qispDuDQBz/?modal=true\n\nAnd that’s okay despite what Nelly thinks about being number two.\n\nTwo is not a winner and three nobody remembers.", "annotation_id": "3439661", "url": "https://genius.com/3439661", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ESPYS: Honorable Mention", "line": "Danica you don’t always come in first place we know But somehow in Nascar you’re the only face we know", "vault_lines": ["Danica you don't always come in first place we know", "But somehow in Nascar you're the only face we know"], "meaning": "Danica Patrick is the most known female Nascar driver; given the fact that no one really watches Nascar. She doesnt always win, but somehow she’s very widely known.", "annotation_id": "3439655", "url": "https://genius.com/3439655", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ESPYS: Honorable Mention", "line": "You ready Iggy Azalea and Swaggy P I love you both, you’re like a poor man’s Jay and Bey You know what I’m saying?", "vault_lines": ["Iggy Azalea and Swaggy P", "I love you both, you're like a poor man's Jay and Bey", "You know what I'm saying?"], "meaning": "He’s calling out the female rap artist Iggy Azalea and her boyfriend a basketball player for the LA Lakers, Nick Young also known as Swaggy P.\n\n\n\nThey aren’t the most powerful and best couple, but if you couldn’t have Jay-Z and Beyonce, you could settle for them.", "annotation_id": "3439634", "url": "https://genius.com/3439634", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ESPYS: Honorable Mention", "line": "KD, I know you’re here, I know you understand me Real talent doesn’t always win championships Like real music doesn’t always win Grammy’s But we’re okay...", "vault_lines": ["KD, I know you're here, I know you understand me", "Real talent doesn't always win championships", "Like real music doesn't always win Grammy's"], "meaning": "KD (Kevin Durant), a player for OKC didn’t win the championships this year, but that doesnt mean he wasnt worthy of one.\n\nHe compared this to the fact that at the Grammy’s this year Macklemore won The Best Rap Album award over people who clearly deserved it more than him.\n\nAt the Espys, the award show this was performed at they showed a picture of Macklemore in the background, behind Drake.", "annotation_id": "3439604", "url": "https://genius.com/3439604", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ESPYS: Honorable Mention", "line": "But even in Brazil inspirational dreams don’t always Come true", "vault_lines": ["But even in Brazil inspirational dreams don't always"], "meaning": "Playing in their home country, the Brasilian fútbol team was expected to at least make it to the championship game. Unfortunately for them, several key players (Neymar and Silva) were out and they were demolished 7-1 by the World Cup champions, Germany, in the semifinals.\n\nNo surprise they became the butt of a ton of jokes.", "annotation_id": "3439599", "url": "https://genius.com/3439599", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
