{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Goose and The Juice", "line": "I could be there for you if you wanted me to You tell me, what do you need that I can give you? Ten whole years, you’ve waited for him to be someone new Things aren’t changing, why would you wait? Take that ring off and move", "vault_lines": ["I could be there for you if you wanted me to", "You tell me, what do you need that I can give you?", "Ten whole years, you've waited for him to be someone new", "Things aren't changing, why would you wait? Take that ring off and move"], "meaning": "The whole chorus of this song is telling a story of Drake trying to take/be there someones wife after he believes her husband has not been there for her and is unwilling to change.\n\nDrake has done this in the past with people like Jennifer Lopez after her divorce from Ben Affleck.", "annotation_id": "39946135", "url": "https://genius.com/39946135", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Goose and The Juice", "line": "Take my hand", "vault_lines": ["So take my hand, come do my dance, I'll do it with you", "You come take my hand, you come do my dance"], "meaning": "Drake is offering to give away his hand because he doesn’t need them to clap.", "annotation_id": "39855056", "url": "https://genius.com/39855056", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Goose and The Juice", "line": "Can you and the girl in the mirror start callin’ a truce?", "vault_lines": ["Can you and the girl in the mirror start callin' a truce?"], "meaning": "PROPOSED SUGGESTION:\n\nHe’s asking a woman to stop battling with her reflection, the perfection she is so desperately chasing is already in the mirror", "annotation_id": "39777046", "url": "https://genius.com/39777046", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Goose and The Juice", "line": "Please just don’t settle for him, whatever you choose", "vault_lines": ["Please just don't settle for him, whatever you choose"], "meaning": "Drake is making a direct plea to a woman to not settle for her current partner or fiancé. By urging her not to “settle for him, whatever you choose,” he builds on the idea that her partner isn’t the correct choice for her, and he’s suggesting that even if she isn’t gonna choose him, then she atleast shouldn’t stay with her current partner as earlier in the track he addressed that her partner hasn’t changed in a decade so he’s offering himself as the better and more versatile option for her.", "annotation_id": "39818920", "url": "https://genius.com/39818920", "state": "pending", "votes": -5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Goose and The Juice", "line": "I could be there for you if you wanted me to You tell me, what do you need that I can give you? Ten whole years, you’ve waited for him to be someone new Things aren’t changing, why would you wait? Take that ring off and move", "vault_lines": ["I could be there for you if you wanted me to", "You tell me, what do you need that I can give you?", "Ten whole years, you've waited for him to be someone new", "Things aren't changing, why would you wait? Take that ring off and move"], "meaning": "During Drakes beef with Kendrick one of the topics Drake mentioned on Family Matters was Kendrick’s long term engagement to his girl friend Whitney. As of 2026 they have now been engaged for over a decade.\n\nLater Drake says “take my hand and do my dance” which almost seems reminiscent of the instructions Kendrick gave to Drake on Euphoria if he wanted to avoid escalating the beef…  “keep making me dance, wavin my hand and it won’t be no threat”\n\nHe even brings up her family and that he wants to meet them. Another thing Kendrick explicitly warned about on Euphoria was going after family.\n\nI’d agree that it’s a stretch, but then again… sneak dissing like this seems like exactly the kinda thing Drake would do to get under Kendrick’s skin… which also happens to be something Kendrick mentions on Euphoria", "annotation_id": "39814318", "url": "https://genius.com/39814318", "state": "pending", "votes": -12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Goose and The Juice", "line": "So take my hand, come do my dance, I’ll do it with you", "vault_lines": ["So take my hand, come do my dance, I'll do it with you", ", come do my dance, I'll do it with you (Just do it), I'll do it with you (Just do it)", "I'll do it with you (Just do it), I'll do it with you (Just do it), do it with you", "Do it with you (Just do it), I'll do it with you (Just do it), come do my dance", "With you (Just do it), do it with you (Just do it), come do my dance", "Do it with you, do it with you, come do my dance", "Do it with you, come do my— ayy", "Come do my dance", "I'll do it with you, I'll do it with you, come do my dance", "Do it with me, I'll do it with you", "You come take my hand, you come do my dance", "Come do my dance, do it with you", "With you, with you, with you, with you"], "meaning": "After spending the whole song trying to convince her to leave her fiancé, Drake ends the pitch with something small: just dance with me.", "annotation_id": "39804845", "url": "https://genius.com/39804845", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Goose and The Juice", "line": "I could be there for you if you wanted me to Just say the words, pack your bags, I’ll make an excuse", "vault_lines": ["I could be there for you if you wanted me to", "Just say the words, pack your bags, I'll make an excuse"], "meaning": "Drake is telling the girl that he wants to be there for her when she needs him most, even going out of his way to get her out of uncertain predicaments. This is toward the man he’s referring to in the chorus, so she can run away and be with him.", "annotation_id": "39796700", "url": "https://genius.com/39796700", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Goose and The Juice", "line": "’Cause you don’t see, unless you’re around me, that they wanna be you", "vault_lines": ["'Cause you don't see, unless you're around me, that they wanna be you"], "meaning": "Drake realizes that her friends are copying her, and he points it out, which she realizes only when she’s with him, when he points it out.", "annotation_id": "39796690", "url": "https://genius.com/39796690", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Goose and The Juice", "line": "The venue that your wedding is at has some shady reviews", "vault_lines": ["The venue that your wedding is at has some shady reviews"], "meaning": "He’s googling her wedding venue to find flaws.\n\nHe’s suggesting that her fiancé can’t even pick a reputable location for their big day. He’s planting a seed of doubt: “If he can’t get the venue right, how can he get your life right?”", "annotation_id": "39783293", "url": "https://genius.com/39783293", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Goose and The Juice", "line": "We talk true when you’re on the Goose and it’s mixed with the juice", "vault_lines": ["We talk true whеn you're on the Goose and it's mixеd with the juice"], "meaning": "“Goose” here refers to Grey Goose vodka, mixed with juice.\nDrake is saying that liquor brings out the honesty in her", "annotation_id": "39779330", "url": "https://genius.com/39779330", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
