{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Finesse", "line": "He can’t know finesse", "vault_lines": ["He can't know finesse"], "meaning": "“He can’t know” refers to The Weeknd finding out about Drake and his relationship with Bella Hadid who was previously mentioned with the “you and your sister line”. Drake and Abel had a falling out around 5 years prior to this as Abel didn’t want to sign with OVO, instead going his own direction. Drake doesn’t want Abel to find out he is missing with Abel’s ex, Bella.", "annotation_id": "40570234", "url": "https://genius.com/40570234", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Finesse", "line": "One thing at a time, I have to learn to hide One thing at a time, emotions running high I wish you felt alright", "vault_lines": ["One thing at a time, I have to learn to hide", "One thing at a time, emotions running high", "I wish you felt alright"], "meaning": "An overflow of emotions can lead to outbursts that push people away such as the ones that led to the lady to whom Drake he is singing to not wanting to be near him.\n\nEmotion is a theme revisited on the Scorpion album in the song Emotionless which samples Emotions.\n\nhttps://www.whosampled.com/Drake/Emotionless/", "annotation_id": "39902072", "url": "https://genius.com/39902072", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Finesse", "line": "You stay on my mind All the time, all the time", "vault_lines": ["All the time, all the time, all the–", "You stay on my mind", "All the time, all the time"], "meaning": "Here, he’s talking about Bella Hadid, the girl he FUMBLED cause he’s mad chopped.", "annotation_id": "38786482", "url": "https://genius.com/38786482", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
