{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "A Keeper", "line": "I found a new muse That’s bad news for you", "vault_lines": ["I found a new muse", "That's bad news for you"], "meaning": "Drake has moved on from his past lover, finding a source of inspiration in someone new to the dismay of his ex.\n\n\n\nWhile Drake could be discussing any of the many romantic partners from his past, this may be a reference to Julia Fox, who became an internet meme following her appearance on Call Her Daddy in which she declared herself to be Josh Safdie’s “muse” in writing the 2019 film Uncut Gems. Drake had a fling with Fox in 2019, reportedly gifting her two Hermès Birkin bags.", "annotation_id": "26079554", "url": "https://genius.com/26079554", "state": "pending", "votes": 33, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
