{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Come Real", "line": "I always wonder why you bother putting makeup on You don’t need it", "vault_lines": ["I always wonder why you bother putting makeup on", "You don't need it"], "meaning": "She doesn’t need make-up because her normal look is already beautiful enough for Drake. This goes back to his song “Best I Ever Had” when he says “Sweatpants, hair-tied, chillin' with no make-up on, That’s when you’re the prettiest, I hope that she dont take it wrong.”", "annotation_id": "496111", "url": "https://genius.com/496111", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Come Real", "line": "So stay real What you make me feel Is true beauty of the ultimate appeal I wouldn’t have it any other way I wouldn’t have it any other way", "vault_lines": ["I wouldn't have it any other way", "Make me feel good", "What you make me feel", "Is true beauty of the ultimate appeal"], "meaning": "In response to Drake’s chorus. She’s telling Drake that he is exactly what she wants in a man and to stay the way he is.", "annotation_id": "434308", "url": "https://genius.com/434308", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Come Real", "line": "And I’ll keep it up Im not sayin what you been stayin to me Ain’t exactly What I need to feel and know", "vault_lines": ["And I'll keep it up", "Im not sayin what you been stayin to me", "You don't need it", "What I need to feel and know", "What you make me feel"], "meaning": "Even though he assures her that she does not need to wear makeup or fancy clothes, she insists this is something she will continue to do, but heeds his advice.", "annotation_id": "424777", "url": "https://genius.com/424777", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
