{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Bahamas Promises", "line": "And for someone you don’t miss, I sure feel like somebody you need", "vault_lines": ["And for someone you don't miss, I sure feel like somebody you need"], "meaning": "This suggests that even though Hayley doesn’t seem to miss Drake, he speaker still feels like he is important to her. It reflects a sense of confusion or mixed emotions about his significance in her life.", "annotation_id": "30034391", "url": "https://genius.com/30034391", "state": "pending", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Bahamas Promises", "line": "You’re livin’ in my mind for free", "vault_lines": ["You're livin' in my mind for free"], "meaning": "This comes from the expression “You’re living in my mind for free”. The “rent-free” connotation often suggests that someone or something is occupying a significant amount of mental space or thoughts without any effort or payment on their part. It implies that this presence is involuntary and perhaps unwelcome.", "annotation_id": "30034383", "url": "https://genius.com/30034383", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Bahamas Promises", "line": "I’m slidin’ down Black Creek", "vault_lines": ["I'm slidin' down Black Creek"], "meaning": "The phrase “slidin' down” is slang for driving or moving through an area.  Black Creek Drive is a four lane north–south arterial road in Toronto, Ontario, Canada.\n\nDrake is driving down Black Creek Drive.", "annotation_id": "30034322", "url": "https://genius.com/30034322", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Bahamas Promises", "line": "Promise I won’t cause a scene I got too much respect for me", "vault_lines": ["Promise I won't cause a scene", "I got too much respect for me"], "meaning": "After this line you can hear Drake laughing. This is him acknowledging the hypocrisy of saying he has respect for himself– He is letting this girl treat him bad/cheating yet is still pining for her.", "annotation_id": "29773641", "url": "https://genius.com/29773641", "state": "accepted", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Bahamas Promises", "line": "I’m fucked up off of T3", "vault_lines": ["I'm fucked up off of T3"], "meaning": "T3 is a Canadian pill containing acetaminophen, codeine, and caffeine. Here Drake is likely referencing that he’s fucked up off a T3 aka codeine. see. https://www.canada.ca/en/health-canada/services/substance-use/controlled-illegal-drugs/codeine.html", "annotation_id": "29761547", "url": "https://genius.com/29761547", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Bahamas Promises", "line": "You put the “No” in monogamy (No)", "vault_lines": ["You put the \"No\" in monogamy (No)"], "meaning": "Monogamy is the state or practice of being in a relationship with one person at a time. Drake uses witty word play to symbolize the unfaithfulness of his companion. Drake is referencing the acts of disloyalty and dishonesty that led him to believe she wasn’t faithful to him within their relationship.", "annotation_id": "29756494", "url": "https://genius.com/29756494", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Bahamas Promises", "line": "You fucked up our Bahamas trip", "vault_lines": ["Broken pinky promises, you fucked up my Bahamas trip", "Broken pinky promises, you fucked up our Bahamas trip"], "meaning": "A lot of couples are scheduling trips months or even years ahead of them. Obviously they’re crazy in love and some of them are even making “pinky promises” that probably won’t last. A trip to Bahamas, a very famous destination, sounds romantic and perfect for a couple. But when the trip is set, it’s very likely that something can ruin it. That’s what happened here, even with the promise Drake and his girl had.", "annotation_id": "29735475", "url": "https://genius.com/29735475", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Bahamas Promises", "line": "You ain’t got nowhere to be It’s ’cause you should’ve been with me The list of things we could’ve been Damn Guess I’ll see you in my dreams", "vault_lines": ["You ain't got nowhere to be", "It's 'cause you should've been with me", "The list of things we could've been", "Guess I'll see you in my dreams"], "meaning": "Drake tells the girl that she should just be with him and reminisces on what they could’ve been. Sadly, he accepts the fact that they probably won’t be together, so he’ll just see her in his dreams.", "annotation_id": "29731306", "url": "https://genius.com/29731306", "state": "accepted", "votes": 35, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
