{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Wednesday Night Interlude", "line": "I’ve been thinkin’ about everything I don’t know if it’s because I’m lonely Lonely on a Wednesday night, girl, I’m lonely I’ll admit it if you just keep quiet, girl, I’m lonely That shit ain’t my fault, girl, ’cause I’m lonely", "vault_lines": ["I'm running on empty, I'm lonely", "When I'm lonely, when I'm lonely", "This shit ain't my fault when I'm lonely", "I've been thinkin' about everything", "I don't know if it's because I'm lonely", "Lonely on a Wednesday night, girl, I'm lonely", "I'll admit it if you just keep quiet, girl, I'm lonely", "That shit ain't my fault, girl, 'cause I'm lonely"], "meaning": "Party is actually having a depressing moment about been lonely and also reminiscing on the argument that got him to this point of loneliness on a Wednesday night from the line\n[I’ll admit it if you just keep quiet & That shit ain’t my fault}\nit looks like he had a fight with this girl is fucking with and now his lonely .Also its a little coincidental that ILoveMakonen uses Tuesday, Drake and Party uses Wednesday and The Weeknd uses Thursday theme and are all affiliated with the OVOXO movement", "annotation_id": "7839137", "url": "https://genius.com/7839137", "state": "verified", "votes": 39, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Wednesday Night Interlude", "line": "[Outro: PARTYNEXTDOOR] This shit ain’t my fault when I’m lonely", "vault_lines": ["When I'm lonely, when I'm lonely", "This shit ain't my fault when I'm lonely", "That shit ain't my fault, girl, 'cause I'm lonely"], "meaning": "Party looks back at the whole relationship  and even tho at the end she cheated with on her current man with party, he doesn’t hold guilt over his influence.", "annotation_id": "5031345", "url": "https://genius.com/5031345", "state": "verified", "votes": 22, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Wednesday Night Interlude", "line": "You’re young, yeah, have fun, girl, but I hope it was worth it ’Cause fuck it, I’m not here to judge Fuck it, I’m not here to love everything you did to ball Fuck it, I’m just glad you called Ring ring ring, what a thing Ring ring ring, school bell ah ring", "vault_lines": ["You're young, yeah, have fun, girl, but I hope it was worth it", "'Cause fuck it, I'm not here to judge", "Fuck it, I'm not here to love everything you did to ball", "Fuck it, I'm just glad you called", "Ring ring ring, what a thing", "Ring ring ring, school bell ah ring"], "meaning": "for the last couple lines of the song when he said “ring ring ring what that a ring ? ring ring ring school bell a ring” they are exact lines from a old shabba ranks song, which makes sense because party has jamaican roots which explains why he’d sing those lines\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wH_0_pijbZY", "annotation_id": "5006629", "url": "https://genius.com/5006629", "state": "verified", "votes": 40, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Wednesday Night Interlude", "line": "[Outro: PARTYNEXTDOOR] This shit ain’t my fault when I’m lonely", "vault_lines": ["When I'm lonely, when I'm lonely", "This shit ain't my fault when I'm lonely", "That shit ain't my fault, girl, 'cause I'm lonely"], "meaning": "Party is feeling the loneliness and the thoughts are getting to him.\n\nMaybe him and this girl are in a fight, and that’s the reason they haven’t slept together in a while. He feels it’s not his fault…\n\nAnd apparently he’s fixed his problem\n\nhttps://mobile.twitter.com/PARTYOMO/status/568953460412047360", "annotation_id": "4942420", "url": "https://genius.com/4942420", "state": "verified", "votes": 50, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Wednesday Night Interlude", "line": "You’re young, yeah, have fun, girl, but I hope it was worth it ’Cause fuck it, I’m not here to judge Fuck it, I’m not here to love everything you did to ball Fuck it, I’m just glad you called Ring ring ring, what a thing Ring ring ring, school bell ah ring", "vault_lines": ["You're young, yeah, have fun, girl, but I hope it was worth it", "'Cause fuck it, I'm not here to judge", "Fuck it, I'm not here to love everything you did to ball", "Fuck it, I'm just glad you called", "Ring ring ring, what a thing", "Ring ring ring, school bell ah ring"], "meaning": "Even though “PND ain’t with the ray tay” his solitude has got to him and he no longer cares about the questionable things she’s done in the past, he’s just relieved she’s hit him up and he’s ready to fuck – similar to the relief when the school bell rings and you get to go home. it’s not to be confused – he’s not here for a relationship.", "annotation_id": "4896848", "url": "https://genius.com/4896848", "state": "accepted", "votes": 43, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Wednesday Night Interlude", "line": "[Produced by PARTYNEXTDOOR]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "PND chopped up the introduction/screams in Ekali’s “Unfaith” to create this instrumental.\n\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PS8a6fiwVJs\n\nhttps://twitter.com/EkaliMusic/status/566123657567543296", "annotation_id": "4888847", "url": "https://genius.com/4888847", "state": "accepted", "votes": 53, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Wednesday Night Interlude", "line": "I’ve been thinkin’ about everything I don’t know if it’s because I’m lonely Lonely on a Wednesday night, girl, I’m lonely I’ll admit it if you just keep quiet, girl, I’m lonely That shit ain’t my fault, girl, ’cause I’m lonely", "vault_lines": ["I'm running on empty, I'm lonely", "When I'm lonely, when I'm lonely", "This shit ain't my fault when I'm lonely", "I've been thinkin' about everything", "I don't know if it's because I'm lonely", "Lonely on a Wednesday night, girl, I'm lonely", "I'll admit it if you just keep quiet, girl, I'm lonely", "That shit ain't my fault, girl, 'cause I'm lonely"], "meaning": "PARTY is remembering everything when being alone with his thoughts. It’s the middle of the week when PARTY calls her, but he’s not happy to admit why.\n\nHe blames his seclusion on his fame as he can’t help but distant himself from other people in fear that they’re only interested in his status.", "annotation_id": "4888632", "url": "https://genius.com/4888632", "state": "accepted", "votes": 64, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
