{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Messages From You", "line": "She’s starin’ in my face, somethin had to change Thought that all these feelings went away Ohhh", "vault_lines": ["She's starin' in my face, somethin had to change", "Thought that all these feelings went away", "I thought that all these feelings went away"], "meaning": "Lorraine is now looking at him, and she notices that since he’s looked at his phone, his indulgent, vibrant, attitude that he had been exuding all evening is gone, she knows that something isn’t right…he thought all those feelings that he had for his ex would go away", "annotation_id": "111496", "url": "https://genius.com/111496", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Messages From You", "line": "With this girl named Lorraine, who says she’s from L.A And keeps makin me laugh and even asks if she can pay", "vault_lines": ["With this girl named Lorraine, who says she's from L.A", "And keeps makin me laugh and even asks if she can pay"], "meaning": "This is a reference to the 1996 movie Swingers.\n\nThe main character Mike played by Jon Favreau  connects with a beautiful girl named Lorraine played by Heather Graham. The next day, he gets a call from the ex-girlfriend he’s been obsessed with but rejects her offer to get back together when Lorraine rings in on the other line.\nhttp://youtu.be/7RD-I8AOf10", "annotation_id": "111487", "url": "https://genius.com/111487", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
