{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Belong to the City (Demo)", "line": "Girl, I coulda changed your life But she heard it all", "vault_lines": ["Coulda changed your life", "'Cause she heard it all", "Girl, I coulda changed your life", "But she heard it all"], "meaning": "He being a celebrity, could have gave her a different lifestyle, but she’s heard how that life is. He may have wanted a different perspective to give her, but she decided to neglect it.", "annotation_id": "30015816", "url": "https://genius.com/30015816", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
