{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Pistols", "line": "Where were you this whole time? Come and see me now, not another time You should come see me on the regular I don’t know if we’ll find a better time Where were you this whole time? Come and see me now, not another time You should come see me on the regular I don’t know if we’ll find a better time", "vault_lines": ["Where were you this whole time?", "Come and see me now, not another time", "You should come see me on the regular", "I don't know if we'll find a better time"], "meaning": "This passage appears to be reminiscent of the chorus on PARTYNEXTDOOR’s “Come and See Me”, which Drake was featured on.\n\nAll she talkin' bout is, “Come and see me for once\nCome and see me for once\nYou don’t ever come to me, you don’t ever come to me”\n\nHowever, this time the perspective seems to be the other way around. Whereas “Come and See Me” sees the OVO artist being addressed by the girl in question, “Pistols” describes Drake being the persuasive factor.", "annotation_id": "14119205", "url": "https://genius.com/14119205", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Pistols", "line": "‘Cause I’ve been sleepin’ with a pistol in my bed I’d rather have you here instead, I gotta get outta my own head Don’t let me down, come here right now (Yeah) Don’t let me down, come here right now", "vault_lines": ["'Cause I've been sleepin' with a pistol in my bed", "I'd rather have you here instead, I gotta get outta my own head", "Don't let me down, come here right now (Yeah)"], "meaning": "These lines are a callback to Drake’s June 2016 OVO Sound loosie “4PM in Calabasas”:\n\nPistol by my bed, I’m sleep but I’m awake\nFor that one night when niggas try and reach inside my safe", "annotation_id": "13352913", "url": "https://genius.com/13352913", "state": "accepted", "votes": 30, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Pistols", "status": "done", "targets": 4, "clicked": 4, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Drake-pistols-lyrics", "genius_title": "Pistols"}
