{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Thank You Letter", "line": "La Vie en Rose and lived on Fox Trail", "vault_lines": ["... But this tape is for you when you worked at La Vie en Rose and lived on Fox Trail"], "meaning": "La Vie en Rose is a lingerie store, with locations all over Canada including Scarborough Town Centre\n\nScarborough/Malvern area (where flocka filmed his 0 to 100 vid)  their are a bunch of roads that end with trail my cousin lives on crow trail rd which is in Scarborough and I myself always forget the name as well.", "annotation_id": "5113316", "url": "https://genius.com/5113316", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
