{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Thank You Letter", "line": "Jay Wray", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Jay Wray and PARTYNEXTDOOR are good friends. Jay Wray is also apart of PND’s OMO crew and is tight OVO.\n\nDrake also gave Jay Wray a shoutout in Preach:\n\nYou know Jay Wray\nGot girls here going way way way way way way\nhttps://instagram.com/p/rNJ6Kmqe18/?modal=true\n\nJay Wray and PARTYNEXTDOOR at Drake’s house", "annotation_id": "4934630", "url": "https://genius.com/4934630", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
