{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Thank You Letter", "line": "Hazelton Hotel, Palace Hotel,", "vault_lines": [", Hazelton Hotel, Palace Hotel,"], "meaning": "Hazelton Hotel is a high-end hotel in Toronto, and Palace Hotel is a luxury hotel in San Francisco. Drake may have stayed at the hotels to rest while on road, or to enjoy some nights with beautiful women, or maybe to write rhymes. Whatever it was, it helped him.", "annotation_id": "4906568", "url": "https://genius.com/4906568", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
