{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Thank You Letter", "line": "Tyler", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Drake is a huge Raptors fan and an executive representative for the team – no wonder he’d include the team on here. In order:\n\n\nTyler Hansbrough\nAmir Johnson\nDemar DeRozan\nKyle Lowry\nPatrick Patterson\nTerrence Ross\nLouis Williams\nJonas Valanciunas\nJames Johnson\nBruno Caboclo\nLucas Nogueira\nChuck Hayes\nGreivis Vasquez\nGreg Stiemsma", "annotation_id": "4896439", "url": "https://genius.com/4896439", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
