{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Bria’s Interlude", "line": "Come on, Missy, fly with me Come on, Missy, fly with me, fly with me Come on, Missy, fly with me (Check it out, check it out) Come on, Missy, fly with me, fly with me", "vault_lines": ["Come on, Missy, fly with me", "Come on, Missy, fly with me, fly with me"], "meaning": "This is a sample from Missy Elliott’s 1997 track “Friendly Skies.”\n\nBeing away on long tour runs means that Drake is separated from his woman for an uncomfortable amount of time. This makes him increasingly paranoid that she’ll soon find someone else and start a new life without him.\n\nHe urges this woman to accompany him on his travels in hopes to keep her close. Drizzy has shown his willingness to fly girls he likes to his location and even pay for their hotel room.\n\nDuring his 2014 Houston Appreciation Weekend, Drake performed this hook adding lyrics “don’t you ever go missing on me”, claiming his vocals weren’t good enough at the time of the original recording to sing in this falsetto style.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/NOdDoCV3v20?t=68", "annotation_id": "8109677", "url": "https://genius.com/8109677", "state": "accepted", "votes": 36, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Bria’s Interlude", "status": "done", "targets": 1, "clicked": 1, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Drake-brias-interlude-lyrics", "genius_title": "Bria’s Interlude"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Cannonball (Snippet)", "line": "Olimpic loser money, I just glad I learned to swim CAnnonball, bitch, I hope dive untill it’s 30 And I hope when dinners cold, my niggas do not dessert me", "vault_lines": ["Olimpic loser money, I just glad I learned to swim", "CAnnonball, bitch, I hope dive untill it's 30", "And I hope when dinners cold, my niggas do not dessert me"], "meaning": "Drake would later interpolatre these lines on his 2016 song with J.U.S.T.I.C.E League and Rick Ross, ‘'Empire’‘, which was originally recorded in 2011.\n\n‘'Olympic pools of money, I’m just glad I learned to swim\nCannonball, bitch, I hope your diving board’s sturdy\nAnd I hope when dinner’s cold, my niggas do not desert me’'", "annotation_id": "38734775", "url": "https://genius.com/38734775", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
