{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Share", "line": "Fortunately, I am at an elevated level", "vault_lines": ["Fortunately, I am at an elevated level"], "meaning": "He’s high above everybody else and more talented than the rest of his competition. This could also mean he is high as in on drugs as he is famous enough to generate money to buy such things.\n\nThis line could also be a continuation of the car line and referencing the trips he takes on a plane on tour.", "annotation_id": "1879509", "url": "https://genius.com/1879509", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
