{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Cece’s Interlude", "line": "That’s when you start to laugh (Up all, up all) Saying I just want what I can’t have (Up all, up all) Won’t even give me a chance (Up all, up all) Claiming I’m just not as serious as you Shorty, if you only knew This is serious", "vault_lines": ["That's when you start to laugh (Up all, up all)", "Saying I just want what I can't have (Up all, up all)", "Won't even give me a chance (Up all, up all)", "Claiming I'm just not as serious as you", "Shorty, if you only knew"], "meaning": "", "annotation_id": "36177897", "url": "https://genius.com/36177897", "state": "pending", "votes": -10, "second_sense": false, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Cece’s Interlude", "line": "Outro", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "The outro is a reference to Drake’s earlier track with Nicki Minaj, Up All Night", "annotation_id": "27491677", "url": "https://genius.com/27491677", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Cece’s Interlude", "line": "Saying I just want what I can’t have", "vault_lines": ["Saying I just want what I can't have (Up all, up all)"], "meaning": "Since Drake is rich and famous, this girl thinks that Drake only wants everything (the “good things” in life to “rappers”) like the money, the cars, and the women. Drake also discussed this in another song 7 years later titled “Can’t Have Everything” from More Life saying how he wants everything but knows he can’t no matter how rich and famous he gets in life", "annotation_id": "24035538", "url": "https://genius.com/24035538", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Cece’s Interlude", "line": "Uh, I wish I wasn’t famous I wish I was still in school", "vault_lines": ["Uh, I wish I wasn't famous", "I wish I was still in school"], "meaning": "Drake wishes to be still in his Degrassi (2001-2008) era when he was still trying to work his way through life, school, his Mom, and TV so that the girl he likes will allow him to his heart essentially like when he was “that kid in the basement”. This theme is expressed in more of his songs, most notably “From Time” feat. Jhené Aiko. Also Drake was a high school dropout at this point until he graduated by 2012", "annotation_id": "24035496", "url": "https://genius.com/24035496", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Cece’s Interlude", "line": "Claiming I’m just not as serious as you Shorty, if you only knew This is serious", "vault_lines": ["Claiming I'm just not as serious as you", "Shorty, if you only knew"], "meaning": "The girl Drake is talking to (Cece) thinks that because of how rich and famous he is, he is just going to mess with her instead of loving her for real. However, Drake assures that he really does have feelings towards her and hopes that the relationship can work out between them", "annotation_id": "24035471", "url": "https://genius.com/24035471", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
