{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Sex Tonight", "line": "I’m double cupped right now", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Drake and other members of Young Money- most notably Lil Wayne- are fond of “purple drank” aka “sizzurp” aka “lean.” The cough syrup concoction is often drunk out of two cups because it takes two cups to mix the drink properly.", "annotation_id": "613932", "url": "https://genius.com/613932", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Sex Tonight", "line": "Su-woop to the bangers Su-woop to the bangers, (yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Su-woop to the bangers", "Su-woop to the (whoa oh oh ohh)"], "meaning": "Gang bangers that are part of the Bloods shout out “su woop” as a greeting call/ warning.\n\nDrake is probably saying su woop to the bangers for Lil Wayne, who calims to be affiliated with the Bloods.", "annotation_id": "613929", "url": "https://genius.com/613929", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Sex Tonight", "status": "done", "targets": 2, "clicked": 2, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Drake-sex-tonight-lyrics", "genius_title": "Sex Tonight"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Tell Me", "line": "Oh oh oh What is? What is? What is? What is different about me? Oh Tell me. What is? What is? Can’t keep you off of me", "vault_lines": ["Tell me. What is? What is?", "Can't keep you off of me", "What is? What is? What is different about me? Oh"], "meaning": "Like PND said on his and Drake’s previous collaboration, “Come And See Me:”\n\nThings change, people change, feelings change too\n\nEvidently, this woman is expressing an usually high amount of affection towards Party / Drake; a stark contrast to other scenarios where PND has pleaded with his woman to give him some of her love.\n\nNaturally, the two Toronto artists are curious to this change; is this woman simply insecure, and wants to make sure her man will stay faithful? Or is she trying to capitalise on their growing success by playing mind games to get in their wallets. Ultimately, the reasoning behind this woman’s sudden infatuation isn’t concrete, and as Drizzy explained on “Jungle,” sometimes we can’t pinpoint the actions that won someone’s love:\n\nThese days, I’m letting God handle all things above me\nThe things I can’t change are the reasons you love me", "annotation_id": "8923683", "url": "https://genius.com/8923683", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
