{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Out Loud*", "line": "They had to latch onto each other just to try to drag me down Who really runs the game? I guess you can’t say that out loud", "vault_lines": ["They had to latch onto each other just to try to drag me down", "Who really runs the game? I guess you can't say that out loud", "The real numbers and views, I guess you can't say that out loud"], "meaning": "This is a reference and to the beef and a shot at A$AP Rocky, Future, Playboi Carti, Rick Ross, Metro Boomin, Kendrick Lamar and The Weeknd for ganging up on Drake and dissing him during the beef", "annotation_id": "38827669", "url": "https://genius.com/38827669", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Out Loud*", "line": "Fuck them haters, double agents", "vault_lines": ["Fuck them haters, double agents"], "meaning": "This could be a Sneak diss to all the people who took Kendrick’s side during the beef. Could be targeting towards the molds in his camp. The molds that told Kendrick about his alleged Daughter and alleged sex offenders on his payroll. While the exact mole hasn’t been revealed, theories include Boi-1da or 21 Savage.", "annotation_id": "38815628", "url": "https://genius.com/38815628", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Out Loud*", "line": "Akhi", "vault_lines": ["I thank God for this voice, akhi"], "meaning": "“Akhi” (أخي) is an Arabic term meaning “my brother,” commonly used as a term of endearment, friendship, or camaraderie among men.", "annotation_id": "38813821", "url": "https://genius.com/38813821", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "weak"}
