{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "MSG Freestyle (Hot 97)", "line": "My first night in the Garden, I’m feelin’ like D. Rose", "vault_lines": ["My first night in the Garden, I'm feelin' like D. Rose"], "meaning": "After spending the first seven years of his career with the Chicago Bulls, former MVP Derrick Rose was traded to the New York Knicks prior to the 2016-17 season. Injuries have plagued D-Rose’s career, but Knicks fans are undoubtedly excited to see him suit up in blue and orange at Madison Square Garden. Drake feels that same excitement when he performs there.", "annotation_id": "10201762", "url": "https://genius.com/10201762", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": true, "click_status": "open", "strength": "accepted"}
