{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Grind", "line": "You know me if you had a job at 16 and under yup", "vault_lines": ["You know me if you had a job at 16 and under yup"], "meaning": "The lyrics here could also be heard as “You know me if you had a child at 16 and under yup” which alludes to the fact that newcomers or parents may recognise Drake from the Canadian TV Show “Degrassi: The Next Generation”, as the target demographic for that program was mainly teens in middle and high school.", "annotation_id": "41341746", "url": "https://genius.com/41341746", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
