{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Grind", "line": "No bathing ape but I’m clean Like I’m made of soap", "vault_lines": ["No bathing ape but I'm clean Like I'm made of soap"], "meaning": "A Bathing Ape is a Japanese clothing brand founded by Nigo in 1993\n\n\n\nAnd Drake once again states that he’s clean, as if his body was made of soap (which is used to help people keep their bodies clean)", "annotation_id": "4487499", "url": "https://genius.com/4487499", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "The Grind", "line": "It’s Drake and Saint Nick", "vault_lines": ["It's Drake and Saint Nick"], "meaning": "“Saint Nick” is the featuring artist’s nickname. These two are definite homies being that this isn’t their only collaboration. They have 2 others: “Number 15” & “A Scorpio’s Mind”", "annotation_id": "4487392", "url": "https://genius.com/4487392", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
