{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Pop That", "line": "Feed them bitches carrots (Huh)", "vault_lines": ["Feed them bitches carrots (Huh)"], "meaning": "Reference to oral sex, as carrots are also quite phallic; since the next line reveals this couplet to be about sex, “feeding” women “carrots” can be read as the conventional oral foreplay foreshadowing the next line’s intercourse.\n\nAlso a play on the word carrot/carat. Meaning the diamonds that he gives to his women and the rabbit reference in the next line\n\nThis is also a reference to the fact that rabbits mainly eat carrots, as rabbits are mentioned in the following line.", "annotation_id": "843920", "url": "https://genius.com/843920", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
