{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Girls Go Bad", "status": "done", "targets": 21, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/The-game-good-girls-go-bad-lyrics", "genius_title": "Good Girls Go Bad", "genius_id": 54090, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Girls Go Bad", "line": "I’m sitting here watching Basketball Wives Like, “uhh, them is basketball wives?” Only cute one, Gloria, that’s my nigga Matt Barnes’ chick", "vault_lines": ["Drizzy, I'm sitting here watching Basketball Wives", "Like, \"uhh, them is basketball wives?\"", "Only cute one, Gloria, that's my nigga Matt Barnes' chick"], "meaning": "The Game is watching VH1’s reality show Basketball Wives, but isn’t impressed by any of their looks, except Gloria Govan.\n\nShe was married to Matt Barnes, former NBA player who is from LA and played on the Los Angeles Lakers and Los Angeles Clippers between 2010 – 2015. The Game is a big basketball fan and the two are friends.\n\n\n\nMatt Barnes and Gloria Govan", "annotation_id": "24057302", "url": "https://genius.com/24057302", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Girls Go Bad", "line": "I love your ass like Milhouse loved Lisa I love your ass like the Ninja Turtles love pizza", "vault_lines": ["I love your ass like Milhouse loved Lisa", "I love your ass like the Ninja Turtles love pizza"], "meaning": "Drake showing love to some classic cartoons here with similes about love.\n\nMillhouse is a character on The Simpsons who has a crush on Lisa Simpson, although she constantly rejects him.\n\n\n\nThe Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles are a group of crime fighting turtles who are always portrayed as pizza fanatics.", "annotation_id": "24057289", "url": "https://genius.com/24057289", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Girls Go Bad", "line": "Good evening, I’m in Chicago at the Elysian", "vault_lines": ["Good evening, I'm in Chicago at the Elysian"], "meaning": "The Elysian was a luxury hotel in Chicago, which was bought and converted into a Waldorf Astoria in November 2011, 3 months after this albums release.", "annotation_id": "24057275", "url": "https://genius.com/24057275", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Girls Go Bad", "line": "This song is dedicated to Natalee Holloway I feel for her daddy so I wrote this on father’s day", "vault_lines": ["I feel for her daddy so I wrote this on father's day", "This song is dedicated to Natalee Holloway"], "meaning": "Natalee Holloway was an 18 year old girl from Alabama who went missing in Aruba over Spring Break in 2005. This was a huge national news story, and in 2010 (a year before this albums release) her suspected murderer tried to extort her family, so the story would have still been all over the news. This is also probably why Game was thinking about her father.\n\nhttps://www.fbi.gov/wanted/seeking-info/natalee-ann-holloway", "annotation_id": "24057227", "url": "https://genius.com/24057227", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Girls Go Bad", "line": "Can’t swim in that poon fool, that’s a crucial conflict", "vault_lines": ["Can't swim in that poon fool, that's a crucial conflict"], "meaning": "When Matt and Gloria were estranged it’s rumoured that she slept with The Game,\nGame denies the rumour that he has slept with Gloria Stephan which is a bleed into the next line, that him and matt are friends sleeping with his wife would lead to a conflict.\nhttp://necolebitchie.com/2012/02/twitter-beef-matt-barnes-vs-the-games-crew-over-gloria-govan/", "annotation_id": "4977339", "url": "https://genius.com/4977339", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Girls Go Bad", "line": "Yeah I’m married to the game", "vault_lines": ["Yeah I’m married to the game"], "meaning": "Game has 5 kids from 2 different wifes but he isn’t still married.There was even a show about game’s life.\n\n\n\nHe also made a song of this name in his 2014 compilation album Year Of The Wolf", "annotation_id": "4591628", "url": "https://genius.com/4591628", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Girls Go Bad", "line": "Don’t make the good girls go bad, no Don’t make the good girls go bad, no (I won’t, hahaha) If you don’t, you gon’ really love us (I said I won’t, yeah) Please don’t use us, no", "vault_lines": ["Don't make the good girls go bad, no", "If you don't, you gon’ really love us (I said I won't, yeah)", "Please don’t use us, no"], "meaning": "Sampling Della Humphrey’s Don’t Make the Good Girls Go Bad. She was 12 years old recording this tune.", "annotation_id": "3299435", "url": "https://genius.com/3299435", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
