{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Solid", "line": "I get big deposits, all my whips exotic", "vault_lines": ["I get big deposits, all my whips exotic"], "meaning": "Gunna is explaining how the checks he deposits in the bank are of large sums.\n\nHim referencing that all of his whips (cars) are exotic means the cars he owns are not of American origin and likely cost hundreds of thousands of dollars. Some car company examples for this would be Rolls Royce, Lamborghini, Ferrari, Porsche, Bentley, Mercedes-Benz, etc.", "annotation_id": "28550401", "url": "https://genius.com/28550401", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Solid", "line": "I need some head and some moral support from you right away", "vault_lines": ["I need some head and some moral support from you right away"], "meaning": "Subtle wordplay from Drake here\n\nHe says he needs some head and “some oral support” as in oral sex", "annotation_id": "28426791", "url": "https://genius.com/28426791", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
