{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Champion", "line": "Bitches don’t know the half like they flunked at math", "vault_lines": ["Bitches don't know the half like they flunked at math"], "meaning": "Minaj is referring to the math equation half (½). So she’s saying that people don’t know the half of what she’s been doing to reach where she is at now. This is also a double entendre as it relates to not knowing the math equation half (½), which is quite simple, hence why they flunked math.\n\nThis line has already been used by nicki in his debut mixtape “playtime is over” in the song “Click Clack\"", "annotation_id": "37261707", "url": "https://genius.com/37261707", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Champion", "line": "This is for the hood, this is for the kids This is for the single mothers, niggas doing bids", "vault_lines": ["This is for the hood, this is for the kids", "This is for the single mothers, niggas doing bids"], "meaning": "By bids she is speaking for the woman who’s men are doing jail time for a crime they didn’t commit this is not the first time Nicki has referenced this subject in her called song called “N.I.G.G.A.S”\nShe says\n\nthis for my dudes who did bids\nFor some shit that they ain’t did”", "annotation_id": "28176422", "url": "https://genius.com/28176422", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
