{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Mo Milly", "status": "done", "targets": 3, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Birdman-mo-milly-lyrics", "genius_title": "Mo Milly", "genius_id": 624, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Mo Milly", "line": "Because a million copies really isn’t far-fetched", "vault_lines": ["Because a million copies really isn't far-fetched"], "meaning": "Thank Me Later only did about half that (447K copies in it’s first week, still insane numbers for a debut). Drake would eventually sell a million in a week like his mentor Lil Wayne did on Tha Carter III with Views", "annotation_id": "32985265", "url": "https://genius.com/32985265", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Mo Milly", "line": "You’re now fucking with the most requested The young nigga that everybody is so obsessed with", "vault_lines": ["You're now fucking with the most requested", "The young nigga that everybody is so obsessed with"], "meaning": "After releasing his extremely popular mixtape, So Far Gone, Motown, Altlantic Records, WMG and Young Money fought a fierce bidding war to sign him (which the latter eventually won). Since then Drake has gone on to sell over one million records, put out eight top 20 singles, appear as a featured artist on quite a few (34!) songs, do an advertisement for Sprite and has toured twice.\n\nDRAKE: we get it, you’re hot shit. You don’t have to keep pointing it out.", "annotation_id": "24699", "url": "https://genius.com/24699", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Mo Milly", "line": "Cigar full of Kush you need prescriptions to access", "vault_lines": ["Cigar full of Kush you need prescriptions to access"], "meaning": "Bun B is bragging about his “prescription-grade” kush marijuana\n\nPersonally, I am always disappointed by prescription-weed quality..", "annotation_id": "24543", "url": "https://genius.com/24543", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
