{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "4 My Town (Play Ball)", "line": "I know the game: analyst", "vault_lines": ["I know the game: analyst"], "meaning": "Wayne is saying he knows the game so well, he’s an analyst.\n\nVideo game analysts or Game analysts examine games to ensure they are free of “bugs” and glitches. Playing a game through each stage, testing different moves and techniques to discover any problems or inconsistencies with the program.", "annotation_id": "23002683", "url": "https://genius.com/23002683", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "4 My Town (Play Ball)", "line": "Sticking to the script: movie star money", "vault_lines": ["Sticking to the script: movie star money"], "meaning": "Word play on Script and Movie. Wayne is saying he has movie star money, cause he’s sticking to the script.\n\n A script is the written text of a stage play, screenplay, or broadcast specifically : the one used in production or performance.", "annotation_id": "23002617", "url": "https://genius.com/23002617", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "4 My Town (Play Ball)", "line": "It’s Young Money like Ben Frank’s baby pictures", "vault_lines": ["It's Young Money like Ben Frank's baby pictures", "It's Young Money Cash Money playboy"], "meaning": "Word Play on “Young Money” and “Baby Pictures” since money typically has a picture of a face on it.\n\nYoung Money or Young Money Entertainment is also the name of American record label founded by rapper Lil Wayne.", "annotation_id": "23002530", "url": "https://genius.com/23002530", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
