{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Gonorrhea", "line": "Hotter than the Devil?", "vault_lines": ["Hotter than the Devil?"], "meaning": "Hell is often depicted as a very hot place and this is where the Devil resides. Wayne says he’s hotter, which means to look cool or fresh, than Satan himself, who is very very hot.", "annotation_id": "36018826", "url": "https://genius.com/36018826", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
