{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Lie", "line": "And all I get is cheese (Cheese) Like I’m takin’ pictures (Uh, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["And all I get is cheese (Cheese)", "Like I’m takin' pictures (Uh, yeah)"], "meaning": "In this context, cheese means money.\n\nPhotographers tell their subject to say cheese to reveal their teeth in a smile.", "annotation_id": "41043604", "url": "https://genius.com/41043604", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
