{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "No Lie", "line": "YSL belt buckle, y’all niggas sure is lookin’", "vault_lines": ["YSL belt buckle, y’all niggas sure is lookin'"], "meaning": "YSL is a signature design from Yves St Laurent, a designer fashion label. However, 2 Chainz uses YSL as an acronym for “Yall Sure Lookin”, used in the same line and “Yall Sure Lucky” on the following line.", "annotation_id": "23955991", "url": "https://genius.com/23955991", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
