{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I’m On One", "line": "I’m a made nigga, I should dust somethin’", "vault_lines": ["I'm a made nigga, I should dust somethin'"], "meaning": "Weezy uses the made/maid homophone where a maid cleans and dusts surfaces, while a made man in the mob is someone who has put in work, usually including “dusting” the competition out of existence.", "annotation_id": "28246254", "url": "https://genius.com/28246254", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
