{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Life", "line": "They need to get their French up to par", "vault_lines": ["They need to get their French up to par"], "meaning": "You need to know a little bit of French to understand the last line.\nFrench is a language of love, so he’s saying you guys need to start loving.", "annotation_id": "251316", "url": "https://genius.com/251316", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Life", "line": "Army greens sneaks, homie GI Jordan", "vault_lines": ["Army greens sneaks, homie GI Jordan"], "meaning": "“GI Jordan” is a combination of G.I. Joe and Air Jordan, which means Rebstar is rocking the green military edition Jordans.", "annotation_id": "249445", "url": "https://genius.com/249445", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Life", "line": "So call me up late, I know you with it girl I get a rush from it, knowing you commited girl", "vault_lines": ["So call me up late, I know you with it girl", "I get a rush from it, knowing you commited girl"], "meaning": "Call me later on, I know you want to, im so exited that you actually like me.\n\nCould also mean it excites him that she’s sexing him even though she’s committed to someone else.", "annotation_id": "249406", "url": "https://genius.com/249406", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
