{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Don’t know how he got it in jail", "vault_lines": ["Don't know how he got it in jail"], "meaning": "Drake global stardom has immense reach. in fact his peers who may be doing time in jail can still enjoy special privileges, due to drake mob / mafia like aura.\n\n(important to distinguish jail from prison)", "annotation_id": "39372439", "url": "https://genius.com/39372439", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
