{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "I was out my mind (Yeah) Put in on the timeline (Yeah), put in on the Instagram", "vault_lines": ["I was out my mind (Yeah)", "Put in on the timeline (Yeah), put in on the Instagram"], "meaning": "In the previous bar, Yeat was alluding to a homicide, and now double downs on it by confessing he actually posted the crime on social medial. This is definitely an “out of mind” impulsive  action because he might be incriminating himself. Not good, won’t recommend.", "annotation_id": "39305722", "url": "https://genius.com/39305722", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
