{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Losses I took but like “Fuck it, oh well”", "vault_lines": ["Losses I took but like \"Fuck it, oh well\""], "meaning": "Continuing with the common idea of the song, Drake talks about the “Losses” he took in his journey to reach the position where he is now. He knows he took those Ls but still they dont effect Drake nomore.", "annotation_id": "30928975", "url": "https://genius.com/30928975", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "You boys are jokin’, it’s actually embarrassin’ (Woo), me and Lil Twizzy is just slappin’ in Maryland (Ah)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Here Drake is poking his opps as he consider them just a “joke” and the way it’s really “embarassing” how his opps perform before him.\n\nFurther, he talks about how he and Lil' Twizzy (other name for Yeat) ball and ride in the “Maryland”, Maryland is a state where Drake was seen performing back in 2012.\n\n\n\nMaryland, The State.\n\n.jpeg)\n\nDrake was seen performing with Meek Mills in Maryland back in 2012.", "annotation_id": "30928929", "url": "https://genius.com/30928929", "state": "pending", "votes": -3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
