{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Yeah, take you to the edge, and push you off the Earth", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, take you to the edge, and push you off the Earth"], "meaning": "Yeat believes that the Earth is flat, and he possibly wants to prove it by pushing YOU off the very edge.\n\nLuckily for you, scientists agree that the Earth is round, so that couldn’t possibly happen.\n\nStaying alert is highly recommended, as Yeat sounded very determined while saying this.\n\nThis is a photo of said planet we reside upon", "annotation_id": "30917389", "url": "https://genius.com/30917389", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Really can’t even spell ball with no L’s", "vault_lines": ["Really can't even spell ball with no L's"], "meaning": "Building on a common theme of Yeat’s “2093”, Drake implies that one cannot get to “ball” status without taking some losses. Drake and Yeat have spoken many times on the journey to their success and the challenges faced along the way.", "annotation_id": "30917301", "url": "https://genius.com/30917301", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "We been overseas, Palermo by the beach", "vault_lines": ["We been overseas, Palermo by the beach"], "meaning": "Palermo is the capital city of the Italian island of Sicily. It is located on the northwest coast of the island, overlooking the Tyrrhenian Sea. Palermo is the largest city in Sicily and one of the largest cities in Italy.", "annotation_id": "30915823", "url": "https://genius.com/30915823", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
