{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "We know your girl, she get tossed in the circle like Captain America, what? (What?)", "vault_lines": ["We know your girl, she get tossed in the circle like Captain America, what? (What?)"], "meaning": "Drake is referring to Captain America’s elevator fight scene in ‘Captain America: The Winter Soldier.’\n\nIn this scene, Cap finds himself going up an elevator, and Shield Agents keep coming in as the elevator makes stops. The Shield Agents where looking to capture Cap, which eventually leads to a fight scene where Cap beats up 10 men single-handedly.\n\n\n\nDrake uses this as an analogy to describe how a girl in a relationship will still seek for men’s attention for self-validation. In this context, the girl will cheat with several men, and this will make her look like a whore.", "annotation_id": "30914266", "url": "https://genius.com/30914266", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Thought he was big ’til I got on the scale", "vault_lines": ["Thought he was big 'til I got on the scale"], "meaning": "This is a response to the viral video of Drake’s penis. He criticises other rappers for flexing their penis size as he knows his will always be bigger than theirs since there’s now proof.", "annotation_id": "30913387", "url": "https://genius.com/30913387", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Just made ten mill’ as we speak (Woo-ah) Like snow to The 6ix, like sand to the beach (Woo-ah)", "vault_lines": ["Just made ten mill' as we speak (Woo-ah)", "Like snow to The 6ix, like sand to the beach (Woo-ah)"], "meaning": "Drizzy Drake is comparing making ten million dollars to sand at the beach or snow in Toronto, Canada which is where rapper Drake originates from,  it is known to be a very snowy place.", "annotation_id": "30913043", "url": "https://genius.com/30913043", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "As We Speak", "line": "Shout’ to Big Boat, I’m so concrete", "vault_lines": ["Shout' to Big Boat, I'm so concrete"], "meaning": "Drake shoutouts Lil Yachty here, who goes by the nickname “Boat”. Concrete Boys is the name of both the music label and group, brought to life by Lil Yachty with members: Camo!, Karrahboo, Draft Day and DC2Trill.", "annotation_id": "30912997", "url": "https://genius.com/30912997", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
