{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Mine", "line": "You’re mine, you’re mine (Yeah) I just wanna say, you’re mine, you’re mine Fuck what you heard, you’re mine, you’re mine Long as you know who you belong to", "vault_lines": ["I just wanna say, you're mine, you're mine", "Fuck what you heard, you're mine, you're mine", "You're mine, you're mine (Yeah)", "Long as you know who you belong to"], "meaning": "At the end of the day, she just want him to be hers. “You’re mine”. Fuck everything else. Fuck the doubting, fuck the thoughts, fuck the many, many rumors on Beyoncé and Jay, you’re mine.", "annotation_id": "31529941", "url": "https://genius.com/31529941", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
