{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "CN TOWER", "line": "Put it on my son, I put it on the Lord What else can I swear on, girl? There’s nothing more", "vault_lines": ["Put it on my son, I put it on the Lord", "What else can I swear on, girl? There's nothing more"], "meaning": "In Drake’s message he carefully wrote to the woman (previous line), he swore on his son’s life and swore to God to indicate he was being honest with her. Having swore on both of them, Drake has nothing left he cares about so significantly that he can swear on to assure he is being truthful.", "annotation_id": "36977072", "url": "https://genius.com/36977072", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
