{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Marvin’s Room", "line": "Just throw up while I hold your hair back", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Hey Geniuses! This lyric is about Drake’s willingness to hold back this lucky woman (or man)’s hair as they regurgitate in a toilet. Drake has always been known for his virtues of kindness and compassion when taking care of his fellow partymates.", "annotation_id": "40118220", "url": "https://genius.com/40118220", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Marvin’s Room", "line": "I’ve been talkin’ crazy, girl, I’m lucky that you picked up", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Drake is acknowledging that he has been talking crazy, likely due to intoxication, and is in his feelings about this girl answering his drunk call.", "annotation_id": "39161896", "url": "https://genius.com/39161896", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Marvin’s Room", "line": "All my people been here I see all of her friends here", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Despite Drizzy admitting that all his people (friends and acquaintances) are there, yet his ex lover’s friends stand out to him. This showcases that he is not over her, and even surrounding himself with large groups of people- cannot make him forget his past relationship.", "annotation_id": "31350403", "url": "https://genius.com/31350403", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
