{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "WASTING TIME", "line": "All I’m drinkin’ is champagne Oh, you wanted the same thing", "vault_lines": ["All I'm drinkin' is champagne", "Oh, you wanted the same thing"], "meaning": "Champagne here is referring to Drake’s moniker and instagram handle: @champagnepapi\n\nBrent’s only drinking champagne, but you wanted champagne too? His verse is up next!", "annotation_id": "39920491", "url": "https://genius.com/39920491", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
