{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Invented Sex", "line": "Girl, you gon’ think, girl, you gon’ think You gon’ think I invented sex", "vault_lines": ["Girl, you gon' think, girl, you gon' think", "You gon' think I invented sex"], "meaning": "This Line basically means that when he this girl get in bed, he will do her so good that she will think sex was his idea", "annotation_id": "31460358", "url": "https://genius.com/31460358", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
