{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Invented Sex", "line": "Bottles of the Ace got me with a lil buzz", "vault_lines": ["Bottles of the Ace got me with a lil buzz"], "meaning": "Throughout Ready, Trey indicates his wealth through his expensive tastes in alcohol.\n\n\n\n“Ace” is the slang term for Armand de Brignac Ace of Spades Champagne, a wine selling for about $300 a bottle from the Montagne de Reims region of northeastern France.", "annotation_id": "20840872", "url": "https://genius.com/20840872", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Invented Sex", "line": "Then I said, “Baby, wassup?” Reach for that hand shake, got a hug", "vault_lines": ["Then I said, \"Baby, wassup?\"", "Reach for that hand shake, got a hug"], "meaning": "Trey approached this woman with a sense of casual professionalism, using “wassup” while attempting to shake her hand.\n\n\n\n\n\nInstead of reciprocating his formal gesture, the woman hugs him. Things are getting intimate quickly.", "annotation_id": "20840866", "url": "https://genius.com/20840866", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
