{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "GLORIOUS", "line": "I know that your man is a waste But you won’t look him in the face and say that you’re wastin’ my twenties away", "vault_lines": ["I know that your man is a waste", "But you won't look him in the face and say that you're wastin' my twenties away"], "meaning": "Drake is saying that this woman’s significant other is not that special and wasting her time, and that the woman is scared to break it off with him.", "annotation_id": "36860196", "url": "https://genius.com/36860196", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "GLORIOUS", "line": "Look at me, I know you see a cape ’cause you’re one of them ones that’s tryna get saved, I’m here", "vault_lines": ["Look at me, I know you see a cape 'cause you're one of them ones that's tryna get saved, I'm here"], "meaning": "“Saved” here is a term for bankrolling a woman’s lifestyle (paying her rent, providing her with spending money, etc.)\n\nThis woman is looking to Drake to pay her rent.", "annotation_id": "36860189", "url": "https://genius.com/36860189", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "GLORIOUS", "line": "Yeah, no drummer, you know I got bands", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, no drummer, you know I got bands"], "meaning": "Drummer? Bands? Like a music band? Band is another way to say money? Haha get it! Corny Drake line, I can’t accept this.", "annotation_id": "36860179", "url": "https://genius.com/36860179", "state": "pending", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "GLORIOUS", "line": "Now she lookin’ back at me ’cause these days all the pretty tings wonder", "vault_lines": ["Now she lookin' back at me 'cause these days all the pretty tings wonder"], "meaning": "The aforementioned woman is now “thinking back” about Drake now that he is famous and successful.\n\nIt is also a double entendre in the sense that if Drake was behind this woman, she would be looking back.", "annotation_id": "36860176", "url": "https://genius.com/36860176", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
