{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Un-thinkable (I’m Ready) [Remix]", "line": "You give me a feelin’ that I never felt before And I deserve it, I think I deserve it, let it go It’s becomin’ somethin’ that’s impossible to ignore And I can’t take it", "vault_lines": ["You give me a feelin' that I never felt before", "And I deserve it, I think I deserve it, let it go", "It's becomin' somethin' that's impossible to ignore", "And I can't take it", "And I deserve it, I know I deserve it, let it go"], "meaning": "These lyrics emphasize how strong her new romantic connection is with this new person, and how she’s never felt love this strong before.", "annotation_id": "35607425", "url": "https://genius.com/35607425", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
