{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Un-thinkable (I’m Ready) [Remix]", "line": "Moment of honesty Someone’s gotta take the lead tonight Who’s it gonna be?", "vault_lines": ["Someone's gotta take the lead tonight", "Who's it gonna be?"], "meaning": "This could mean lots of things. someone gotta take the first move whether its breaking up or simply getting together", "annotation_id": "32219791", "url": "https://genius.com/32219791", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Un-thinkable (I’m Ready) [Remix]", "line": "Why give up before we try? Feel the lows before the highs", "vault_lines": ["Why give up before we try?", "Feel the lows before the highs"], "meaning": "Many relationships doesn’t continue because of the lack of initiative taken by the both sides. To try and see what’s next for the journey may scare individuals but in fact all of these are experiences as no one can understand the true value of the highs without feeling the lows.", "annotation_id": "31525178", "url": "https://genius.com/31525178", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Un-thinkable (I’m Ready) [Remix]", "line": "‘Stead of searchin’ for substance at every single party", "vault_lines": ["'Stead of searchin' for substance at every single party"], "meaning": "Instead of being caught in the middle of being righteous or sorry, he resorts to drugs that he gets at every party he attends.", "annotation_id": "28021475", "url": "https://genius.com/28021475", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Un-thinkable (I’m Ready) [Remix]", "line": "Good women are rare, to none of them I came close", "vault_lines": ["Good women are rare, to none of them I came close"], "meaning": "Drake consoles himself or mourns the fact that it is difficult to find a good woman to settle because they are scarce. He notices that he never had the chance to stumble on any despite maybe his stardom and success.", "annotation_id": "28021398", "url": "https://genius.com/28021398", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Un-thinkable (I’m Ready) [Remix]", "line": "And I’m scared too, ’cause I’m in the same boat", "vault_lines": ["And I'm scared too, 'cause I'm in the same boat", "I'm suspended in the air"], "meaning": "Being from the same generation, Drake shares Tez’s worries about ending up lonely.", "annotation_id": "28021394", "url": "https://genius.com/28021394", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Un-thinkable (I’m Ready) [Remix]", "line": "Tez keeps tellin’ me he just turned thirty", "vault_lines": ["Tez keeps tellin' me he just turned thirty"], "meaning": "Tez just ponders over his life after reaching a quarter of a century plus 5 years. At this age, a lot of adults have already planned their life and settled and got married. Unfortunately Tez has the money but hasn’t settled with anybody.", "annotation_id": "28021383", "url": "https://genius.com/28021383", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Un-thinkable (I’m Ready) [Remix]", "line": "Havin’ dreams of bein’ single forever, he’s gettin’ worried", "vault_lines": ["Havin' dreams of bein' single forever, he's gettin' worried"], "meaning": "Cortez “Tez” Bryant is the co-founder of Aspire Music Group, LLC which is a record label. Their roster currently only includes multi-platinum Canadian rapper Drake.\n\nTez addressed Drake to let him know his worries about ending up all alone, without a woman or a wife to share the rest of his life with.", "annotation_id": "11217659", "url": "https://genius.com/11217659", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Un-thinkable (I’m Ready) [Remix]", "line": "I’ve got more than a thing for you, tattoo with the ink for you", "vault_lines": ["I've got more than a thing for you, tattoo with the ink for you"], "meaning": "Drake has “more than a thing” for the woman. What this basically means is that; he is past the infatuation phase, and that he is willing to make the huge step towards actual commitment.\n\nA “tattoo” is permanent. It cannot, in any way, be removed unless a surgical procedure would be done. In the song, the tattoo is an allegory of the permanence of the woman in Drake’s heart. She will stay there, and she will not be easily forgotten.", "annotation_id": "109410", "url": "https://genius.com/109410", "state": "accepted", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
