{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "We In This Bitch 1.5", "line": "Red-bottom limpin around this bitch, what the fuck you trippin on?", "vault_lines": ["Red-bottom limpin around this bitch, what the fuck you trippin on?", "Red-bottom limping around this bitch, what the fuck you tripping on?"], "meaning": "Referring to the popular red-bottomed high heels by designer Christian Louboutin.\n\nFuture notices a women in said heels “limpin' round [the club]” and assumes that the young lady must be on some sort of drug as she is “trippin'”.", "annotation_id": "4217032", "url": "https://genius.com/4217032", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "We In This Bitch 1.5", "line": "The money, bitches and cars come with the life that I live", "vault_lines": ["The money, bitches and cars come with the life that I live"], "meaning": "Futures song Fo Real, which also features Drake, explains Futures lifestyle, which he calls the “Rockstar Lifestyle”, the best.\n\nYou know the money bring the cars, the cars bring the hoes\nRockstar life, that’s how it goes\nFo real, fo real", "annotation_id": "2772331", "url": "https://genius.com/2772331", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
