{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SLIDE IN", "line": "I’m still a canine at heart, I’m a dog", "vault_lines": ["I'm still a canine at heart, I'm a dog, roof-roof-roof"], "meaning": "Drake interpolates his own song Company, which features Travis Scott. In that song, you can hear dogs barking right after the original bar.", "annotation_id": "38748228", "url": "https://genius.com/38748228", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
