{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "I took to you from the beginnin’", "vault_lines": ["I took to you from the beginnin'"], "meaning": "This line goes hand in hand with the last two lines that Drake says, saying that he took interest in this girl right from the beginning, when they met, which is why he could go on and on and talk about what he likes about her.", "annotation_id": "38653083", "url": "https://genius.com/38653083", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "Every time that I write a love song I just get closer to the truth", "vault_lines": ["Every time that I write a love song", "I just get closer to the truth"], "meaning": "Rappers are essentially poets. The purpose of poems are to express deep emotions, tell stories, capture fleeting moments, and offer unique perspectives on life, connecting readers to the poet’s inner world and their own. aka the “truth”", "annotation_id": "37974572", "url": "https://genius.com/37974572", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "I might waterproof the seats for some pussy play (Hah)", "vault_lines": ["I might waterproof the seats for some pussy play (Hah)"], "meaning": "Party has stated in many interviews that he drives a Range Rover SUV, an expensive luxury vehicle. Party is considering adding waterproof seat covers in the Range so he can have sex with the woman in his car without damaging the interior.", "annotation_id": "36977382", "url": "https://genius.com/36977382", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "You’re closin’ tonight, when you finished?", "vault_lines": ["You're closin' tonight, when you finished?"], "meaning": "In retail and food service, the “closing” shift is the last work shift of the day, where team members are responsible for finishing service, cleaning, and closing and locking the premises. The woman is “closing” and Drake is asking her when she will be done with work so they can see each other.", "annotation_id": "36977360", "url": "https://genius.com/36977360", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "I just hoped that some day, someone would love me", "vault_lines": ["I just hoped that some day, someone would love me"], "meaning": "This voice clip is the same as the one in the interlude in the previous song, MOTH BALLS.\n\n[Interlude]\nI just hoped that someday, someone would love me\n\nVocals by Jessica Domingo", "annotation_id": "36934701", "url": "https://genius.com/36934701", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
