{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "I bulletproofed that Escalade (Yeah, yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I bulletproofed that Escalade (Yeah, yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "PARTY is talking about the vehicle Cadillac Escalade, which is known to be a luxurious 7 seater SUV.\n\nIt’s important to note that Drake himself has an Escalade.", "annotation_id": "35314092", "url": "https://genius.com/35314092", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "Fuck your coworker, she a hatin’-ass ho Met you for lunch just to let that bitch know You got somebody that love you back home", "vault_lines": ["Fuck your coworker, she a hatin'-ass ho", "Met you for lunch just to let that bitch know", "You got somebody that love you back home"], "meaning": "Drake called this woman’s coworker a ho implying she doesn’t have anyone that truly loves her, he then says he shows up to prove to the coworker that this woman actually has someone who truly loves her.", "annotation_id": "35212097", "url": "https://genius.com/35212097", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "You askin’ me what I like about you, girl How long you wan’ sit in this kitchen?", "vault_lines": ["You askin' me what I like about you, girl", "How long you wan' sit in this kitchen?"], "meaning": "Drake is asking the girl if she has the patience to sit with him in the kitchen for a long time, because there are so many things he likes about her that he could go on talking for hours", "annotation_id": "35137049", "url": "https://genius.com/35137049", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "OMO, OVO shit, man, PARTY, man, PX fiesta", "vault_lines": ["OMO, OVO shit, man, PARTY, man, PX fiesta"], "meaning": "Drake acknowledges both his and Party’s collectives, OVO and OMO. Drake signed PartyNextDoor to his record label, OVO Sound, in 2013.\n\nOMO stands for “On My Own”, with Party using the term as early as 2013 like in this May 2013 tweet. Both his website and Soundcloud use “partyomo” as the username and url link, as well as his YouTube Channel.", "annotation_id": "34589322", "url": "https://genius.com/34589322", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "Don’t care where that pussy play, shit NFL, NHL, NBA", "vault_lines": ["Don't care where that pussy play, shit"], "meaning": "Since no one is saying anything about this, like anywhere, this is just a quick slight towards Kendrick’s Super Bowl performance.", "annotation_id": "34580791", "url": "https://genius.com/34580791", "state": "pending", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "I ain’t ’bout to make you sign no NDA", "vault_lines": ["I ain't 'bout to make you sign no NDA"], "meaning": "Non Disclosure Agreement (NDA) are often used to control information and ensure secrecy. PND is rejecting the need for one, as he believes he can trust the girl\n\nPROPOSED SUGGESTION: It’s a subliminal diss towards LeBron since it’s rumored that he does this due to him being the face of the NBA and a married man. Also, him and Drake are beefing.\n\n“Don’t care where that pussy play, shit\nNFL, NHL, NBA\nI ain’t ‘bout to make you sign no NDA\n'Cause I know you can keep a secret, can’t you, bae?”", "annotation_id": "34564462", "url": "https://genius.com/34564462", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "SOMETHING ABOUT YOU", "line": "Sauga City trip, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Sauga City trip, yeah"], "meaning": "Drake nods to Sauga City, short for Mississauga, Ontario, PARTYNEXTDOOR’s hometown. The album cover art for $ome $exy $ongs for U also pays tribute to the city, featuring the iconic Marilyn Monroe towers.\n\nDrake rapped a similar line on their February 2015 collaboration, “Preach”,\n\nSauga-city trip, the payday\nGlo’d up off a Gateway, man, you can’t afford me", "annotation_id": "34563877", "url": "https://genius.com/34563877", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
