{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "status": "done", "targets": 10, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Romeo-santos-odio-lyrics", "genius_title": "Odio", "genius_id": 348711, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "line": "Y por ti Vivo aniquilado en el despecho Reprimido, ardiendo por los celos Lo odio aunque él te haga feliz A mí Nada me intimida, pero entiendo Que él ganó la guerra hace tiempo Y se me olvida que ya te perdí", "vault_lines": ["Vivo aniquilado en el despecho", "Reprimido, ardiendo por los celos", "Lo odio aunque él te haga feliz", "Nada me intimida, pero entiendo", "Que él ganó la guerra hace tiempo", "Y se me olvida que ya te perdí"], "meaning": "Lyrics translated from Spanish to English:\n\nAnd for you I live annihilated in spite\nRepressed, burning by jealousy\nI hate him even though he makes you happy\nNothing intimidates me\nBut I understand that he won the war a long time ago\nAnd I forget that I already lost you", "annotation_id": "16243648", "url": "https://genius.com/16243648", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "line": "Tal parece que mi amor crece y crece Pero tú desvaneces Y me ofreces tu amistad sin otra excepción Sé que hay otro hombre Que ha logrado lo que yo jamás a ti te di Un hogar, una familia, un buen porvenir Perdón por hacerte daño", "vault_lines": ["Y se me olvida que ya te perdí", "Tal parece que mi amor crece y crece", "Y me ofreces tu amistad sin otra excepción", "Sé que hay otro hombre", "Que ha logrado lo que yo jamás a ti te di", "Un hogar, una familia, un buen porvenir", "Perdón por hacerte daño"], "meaning": "Lyrics translated from Spanish to English:\n\nIt seems that my love grows and grows, but you fade away\nAnd you offer me your friendship without another exception\nI know there is another man who has achieved what I never gave you\nA home, a family, a good future; sorry for hurting you\n\n\n\n\nIn these lines, Romeo reflects how much he loves an old flame, but she has since moved on. Ultimately, he regrets letting her go.", "annotation_id": "16124561", "url": "https://genius.com/16124561", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "line": "[Verso 3: Drake]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Drake mentioned Aventura back in “The Motto”. Looks like he’s making good on his namedrop here.\n\nThem Spanish girls love me like I’m Aventura", "annotation_id": "2984710", "url": "https://genius.com/2984710", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "line": "Envy is a sign of admiration Hate is the epitome of destruction", "vault_lines": ["Envy is a sign of admiration", "Hate is the epitome of destruction"], "meaning": "When you envy someone, its mainly because you wish you had their lifestyle. One of Drakes famous quotes is “Jealousy is just love and hate at the same time” because you hate that that is not you, but you love to admire their lifestyle.\n\nHate is the strongest form of wanting something ruined/destroyed. When you hate, you wish it to cease. This song represents what Romeo and Drake have for this girl who fell in love with another guy and want it to end, not because they’re jealous but because they want the same thing. They admire they have something they used to have, and now don’t.", "annotation_id": "2722702", "url": "https://genius.com/2722702", "state": "accepted", "votes": 43, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "line": "If you saw them, you’d get it Look, don’t worry ’bout it,", "vault_lines": ["If you saw them, you'd get it", "Look, don't worry 'bout it,"], "meaning": "Like he said, if you saw them and put them together it would blow the top of the “10 point scale”.\n\n\n\n\n\nDrake is feeding her a compliment but he realizes she could take it the wrong way by him comparing other girls “he knows”.\n\nDon’t worry what he just said, don’t worry about these other girls, he’s focused on her.", "annotation_id": "2722388", "url": "https://genius.com/2722388", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "line": "No, you, you look like Bernice and Yaris But both put together Those are some girls that I know from back home", "vault_lines": ["No, you, you look like Bernice and Yaris", "But both put together", "Those are some girls that I know from back home"], "meaning": "Drake’s “friends” which he dated and/or hooked up with…\n\nBernice Burgos, Puerto Rican model who has appeared in his videos\n\n\n\nand urban model Yaris Sanchez, who has been romantically linked to Drizzy in the press", "annotation_id": "2722373", "url": "https://genius.com/2722373", "state": "accepted", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "line": "Keep speakin’ Spanish I’ll get it translated, you know you my baby", "vault_lines": ["I'll get it translated, you know you my baby"], "meaning": "Drake doesn’t speak Spanish but he tells her to not worry about it. He got Romeo to translate it. You know how much he likes his Spanish women. And how much Spanish women love him.\nhttps://twitter.com/Drake/status/254359100136226816\nDRAKE: Rap Genius be translating all your shit into every language don’t even trip (we gotchu…)", "annotation_id": "2722150", "url": "https://genius.com/2722150", "state": "accepted", "votes": 37, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "line": "Celo sus besos Sobre tu cuerpo La envidia se apodera así de mí", "vault_lines": ["La envidia se apodera así de mí"], "meaning": "“I envy his kisses against your body. The envy takes over me”\n\n\n\nHe doesn’t like seeing his ex kissing her current boyfriend. He misses they’re kisses they had together. This makes him envious and makes him want to do things that aren’t right.\n\n\n\nRomeo Santos On Drake’s Spanish in “Odio”:\n\n“At first, I didn’t have any parts in Spanish for him. But, when we decided to do a bachata — because at first I was thinking of something different with Drake and then he decided he wanted to do a bachata, which was cool ‘cause that’s my thing and that’s my element — [we] changed things up a bit. Then he was like, ‘Yo, you think you can write some Spanish stuff for me?’ And I was like, ‘Yeah!’”", "annotation_id": "2721991", "url": "https://genius.com/2721991", "state": "accepted", "votes": 22, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "line": "Perdí tu amor, soy un pobre diablo", "vault_lines": ["Perdí tu amor, soy un pobre diablo"], "meaning": "“I lost your love, I’m a poor man. Without your love I’m nothing”\n\n\n\nThey lost her love and effection. Now that they don’t have her, they feel like they have nothing.\n\n“Diablo” is devil in English, but  it’s not meant to be taken literally, it’s just an expression for jerk, bastard, lowlife, rascal, etc.\n\nThis is also a reference to a song by Romeo Santo’s old group, Aventura called Soy Un Pobre Diablo.\nhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qlebd-qBCJI\nDrake has also referenced Aventura before.", "annotation_id": "2721654", "url": "https://genius.com/2721654", "state": "accepted", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Odio", "line": "Sometimes, I question if this is all real Then I grab on that ass and I firmly believe it", "vault_lines": ["Sometimes, I question if this is all real", "Then I grab on that ass and I firmly believe it"], "meaning": "In addition to talking about the relationship’s veracity, Drake is playfully questioning if the chick’s big butt is real and not synthetic, but after some testing, he “firmly” believes that it’s the real deal", "annotation_id": "2720924", "url": "https://genius.com/2720924", "state": "accepted", "votes": 28, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
