{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Drama", "status": "done", "targets": 6, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Roy-woods-drama-lyrics", "genius_title": "Drama", "genius_id": 2173937, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Drama", "line": "Take your last relationship Look how good you treated him You could birth like four of him Girl, you never needed him", "vault_lines": ["Take your last relationship", "Look how good you treated him", "You could birth like four of him", "Girl, you never needed him"], "meaning": "‘All boys are the same.’ is what he is saying. Her ex was probably just highly basic and like all the others (boys) but she treated him great.\n\nWhen in reality it was most likely just a waste of time.", "annotation_id": "41788732", "url": "https://genius.com/41788732", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Drama", "line": "Give and take, you give it to ’em, they take that shit for granted, yeah Different than it was before People ’round you want it more BFF, oh yeah, for sure Wonder what they in it for", "vault_lines": ["Take that L, you lose", "Give and take, you give it to 'em, they take that shit for granted, yeah", "Different than it was before", "People 'round you want it more", "BFF, oh yeah, for sure", "Wonder what they in it for"], "meaning": "this part of the song is basically the hint of the meaning of the song. The song talks about a girl having “drama” whit her friends\nand some boy, they all basically just take her for granted so she’s lost and don’t know what to do because she loves her friends and loves the boy too. she’s probably over 26.", "annotation_id": "37714863", "url": "https://genius.com/37714863", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Drama", "line": "Arguments all day with your ’rents Just to go out, gotta fight for this shit (Fight for this shit) Gotta realize you’re a high school girl (High school girl)", "vault_lines": ["Just to go out, gotta fight for this shit (Fight for this shit)", "Gotta realize you're a high school girl (High school girl)", "Arguments all day with your 'rents"], "meaning": "the girl that roy is talking about argues with her parents just to go out to parties, etc. and she needs to realize that shes just in high school.", "annotation_id": "33062672", "url": "https://genius.com/33062672", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Drama", "line": "You don’t smoke, but it’s cool ’round your friends (Cool ’round your friends)", "vault_lines": ["You don't smoke, but it's cool 'round your friends (Cool 'round your friends)"], "meaning": "Apparently, the girl smokes around her friends to get the impression that shes cool, but in reality, she doesnt smoke", "annotation_id": "33062665", "url": "https://genius.com/33062665", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Drama", "line": "Tumblr dreamin’ ridin’ in a Benz", "vault_lines": ["Tumblr dreamin' ridin' in a Benz"], "meaning": "Many high school aged girls have Tumblrs where they blog about their future aspirations, ranging from relationship to material goals.", "annotation_id": "7470041", "url": "https://genius.com/7470041", "state": "accepted", "votes": 38, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Drama", "line": "Silvercity with your girls on the weekend", "vault_lines": ["Silvercity with your girls on the weekend"], "meaning": "Silvercity is part of Cineplex’s chain of movie theatres in Canada.\n\nIt also sounds like Roy is saying “Sauga City”. Mississauga is part of the GTA (Greater Toronto area), but Roy’s from Brampton.", "annotation_id": "7267202", "url": "https://genius.com/7267202", "state": "accepted", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
