{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "ALL I NEED", "line": "I can’t even make new friends", "vault_lines": ["I can't even make new friends"], "meaning": "Drake references his chorus on DJ Khaled’s 2013 hit song “No New Friends”. Drake is only worried about the friends he had before he became a star, as he raps about on “Started from the Bottom”.\n\nNo new niggas, nigga, we don’t feel that", "annotation_id": "20526393", "url": "https://genius.com/20526393", "state": "pending", "votes": -6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
