{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Tryna Fuck", "line": "I just wanna fall in Onyx with a fine Georgia peach Got that rocket in my pocket, that’s that beauty and the beast", "vault_lines": ["I just wanna fall in Onyx with a fine Georgia peach", "Got that rocket in my pocket, that's that beauty and the beast"], "meaning": "Onyx is a premier strip club in Atlanta, GA. The slogan, “where all celebs come to play,” speaks for itself. Juicy wants to meet a hot southern peach (the state fruit) and make some love at one of the most widely known entertainment joints in the South.\n\nRocket in the pocket refers to molly – it’ll turn any “beauty” into a “beast.”", "annotation_id": "6548651", "url": "https://genius.com/6548651", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
