{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Enjoy Yourself", "line": "Jealousy’s something I haven’t felt for years There’s nobody around for me to be jealous of I bet you do a show in my city and no one cheers Even if you make the music that ladies and fellas love but", "vault_lines": ["My brothers and, and, my ladies", "Jealousy’s something I haven’t felt for years", "Even if you make the music that ladies and fellas love but"], "meaning": "Drake uses these first 4 bars 2 years earlier on his mini-hit song “The Last Hope” featuring Kardinal Offishall and Andreena Mill – This verse was likely recorded around the same time in 2007", "annotation_id": "40485492", "url": "https://genius.com/40485492", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
