{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Blind Faith", "status": "done", "targets": 1, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Billie-eilish-and-drake-blind-faith-lyrics", "genius_title": "Blind Faith", "genius_id": 6198225, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Blind Faith", "line": "Thinking of a heaven that you know you never got", "vault_lines": ["Thinking of a heaven that you know you never got"], "meaning": "The song is apparently about a boy  who travels to another world and then returns, only to find that it was all a dream. This echoes Billie Eilish’s personnal life at that time, as she was very caught up and dreams and trying to escape reality “When We All Fall Asleep, Where Do We Go?” and this line shows exactly how Eilish was feeling, as these dreams she and the boy had are not true and could never be real, but they still yearn for it.", "annotation_id": "35089386", "url": "https://genius.com/35089386", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
