{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Till Things Get Right", "line": "But you will only trip if I went and brought R-Patz along Kristen Stewart was holy fit, then those photos got snapped upon", "vault_lines": ["But you will only trip if I went and brought R-Patz along", "Kristen Stewart was holy fit, then those photos got snapped upon"], "meaning": "The sort of girls Starstruk tries to get are the sort who watch the Twilight movies, and therefore lust after its star Robert Pattinson. He was for some time in a relationship with its other star, Kristen Stewart. This was until photos were “snapped upon” of Stewart having sex with the director of her latest movie. Starstruk apparently used to think Kristen Stewart was attractive, but she became less hot after she was caught cheating.", "annotation_id": "963836", "url": "https://genius.com/963836", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
