{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Girl Let Me", "status": "done", "targets": 2, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Belly-girl-let-me-lyrics", "genius_title": "Girl Let Me", "genius_id": 252281, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Girl Let Me", "line": "Me without no money, that don’t sound right (sound right)", "vault_lines": ["Me without no money, that don't sound right (sound right)"], "meaning": "As we all know by now, Drake is one dude you will never see broke. In fact it always seems like he has ‘money to blow’.http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HHTTKRFx6Rg\n\nHe is one to get it in, letting bills fall all over his skin!\nHere is a picture of Drizzy early in his career when he ‘started from the bottom’:", "annotation_id": "2382038", "url": "https://genius.com/2382038", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Girl Let Me", "line": "She can make it go..", "vault_lines": ["Bring it high, bring it down, take it low..then make it go..", "She make it stop, pop like the drum do", "She can make it go; start off going fast but then she take it slow, take it slow", "She make it & it sound like (sound like)", "She make it then it sound like (sound like)", "She can tell me anything; I'll buy it if she sells it"], "meaning": "The Original name for this song was ‘Make it go’ however Belly revamped the name, the hook as well as his original verses for the song after hearing Drizzy Drakes verse.\n\nHere is the alternate original versionhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sqZQ302_1Y4", "annotation_id": "2381986", "url": "https://genius.com/2381986", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
