{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "FOR ALL THE BARBZ", "line": "I’m who they call to sell tickets, make no mistake", "vault_lines": ["I'm who they call to sell tickets, make no mistake"], "meaning": "When Nicki Minaj is apart of your set for a live performance, the ticket sales will always be great. This was seen last year with Wireless Festival, Essence Festival & Rolling Loud.\n\nMost recently, Minaj was announced as the headliner for 2 Jingle Ball shows this season, one of which has been sold out, with the second one fastly approaching.\n\nhttps://x.com/OnikaPoppin/status/1714030354254758052?s=20\n\nWhile opposed to her counterparts, who have been struggling to sell the tickets to their shows.\n\nhttps://x.com/poebase/status/1665576048992432130?s=46\n\nThis goes to show that anything with the Nicki Minaj name, will sell, no mistake.", "annotation_id": "29853569", "url": "https://genius.com/29853569", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
