{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Fuckin’ Problems (Original)", "line": "She eyeing me like a nigga don’t exist", "vault_lines": ["She eyeing me like a nigga don't exist"], "meaning": "Before expressing his knowledge of how this female “wants ts (this) dih”, Kendih Lamar tells us about how she acts like he isn’t even there. We feel you, K.Dih. 😔😔", "annotation_id": "36153850", "url": "https://genius.com/36153850", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
