{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Kush And Alcohol (Remix)", "line": "And I love this life, and I won’t trade it for the world", "vault_lines": ["And I love this life, and I won’t trade it for the world"], "meaning": "Future loves his life so much, you could offer him the whole world, he wouldn’t trade it for it.\n\nFuture has a net worth of $2,5 Million, a baby with his beautiful fiance and a lot of good friends in the game. So you might understand that he won’t give up all this, not even for the whole world. But if he’s going on making that much money, he might be able someday to buy the world.", "annotation_id": "3376919", "url": "https://genius.com/3376919", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Good Kush And Alcohol (Remix)", "line": "Future Hendrix", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Future is known to call himself “Future Hendrix”. Of course he’s reffering himself with that name to the rock legend Jimmy Hendrix. He also wanted to call his second album, “Future Hendrix”, but changed the name later into “Honest”. Now he’s planning to call his next album “Future Hendrix”.", "annotation_id": "3372291", "url": "https://genius.com/3372291", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
