{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Praise The Lord & Khalil (Interlude)", "line": "If you got a twenty for all of your tries Twenty for all of the times, the times you got back up, woah You’d be a billionaire in a year That’s what you gotta think ’till you’re there, on the regular If you got a diamond for all of your passion, diamond for your dedication You could be icy like cake and icy for every occasion, gotta go hard, yeah Still don’t condone it, love is a component You’re the only opponent, gotta seize the moment", "vault_lines": ["You're the only opponent, gotta seize the moment", "Don't do nothin' 'less you're all in it, all in it, all in it", "If you got a twenty for all of your tries", "Twenty for all of the times, the times you got back up, woah", "You'd be a billionaire in a year", "That's what you gotta think 'till you're there, on the regular", "If you got a diamond for all of your passion, diamond for your dedication", "You could be icy like cake and icy for every occasion, gotta go hard, yeah", "Still don't condone it, love is a component"], "meaning": "These lyrics are a sample from one of Justin Bieber’s songs called: All In It.", "annotation_id": "24009751", "url": "https://genius.com/24009751", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Praise The Lord & Khalil (Interlude)", "line": "Don’t do nothin’ ’less you’re all in it, all in it, all in it", "vault_lines": ["Don't do nothin' 'less your heart's in it, heart's in it, heart's in it", "Don't do nothin' 'less you're all in it, all in it, all in it"], "meaning": "With the oppression of other individuals and what they think is the best, it can be difficult to follow your heart and do what you’re really passionate about.", "annotation_id": "24009740", "url": "https://genius.com/24009740", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Praise The Lord & Khalil (Interlude)", "line": "Don’t do nothin’ ’less your heart’s in it, heart’s in it, heart’s in it", "vault_lines": ["Don't do nothin' 'less your heart's in it, heart's in it, heart's in it", "Don't do nothin' 'less you're all in it, all in it, all in it"], "meaning": "Think before you act.", "annotation_id": "24009730", "url": "https://genius.com/24009730", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
