{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Sideways", "status": "done", "targets": 1, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Gordo-and-drake-sideways-lyrics", "genius_title": "Sideways", "genius_id": 10642346, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "Sideways", "line": "But you were never my girl It was just my turn Then it turned sideways It was just my turn", "vault_lines": ["But you were never my girl", "It was just my turn", "Then it turned sideways"], "meaning": "Drake may be interpolating these lines from Skepta’s 2019 track “Bullet from a Gun”:\n\nLike a bullet from a gun, it burns\nWhen you realise she was never your girl\nIt was just your turn\n\nSkeppy and Drake have a strong relationship, and have collaborated on multiple occasions. Drizzy previously interpolated some of Skepta’s bars on 2015’s “Used To”, underscoring the likelihood that Skepta was the inspiration for these lines.\n\nDrake and Skepta", "annotation_id": "32492640", "url": "https://genius.com/32492640", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Do This", "status": "done", "targets": 1, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Belly-i-do-this-lyrics", "genius_title": "I Do This", "genius_id": 1804313, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "I Do This", "line": "Drug dealers live vicariously through me", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Living vicariously means that someone is looking at the experiences of another person and treating them as their own, as if they are living through them. The word “vicarious” is rooted in the Latin “vicarius,” meaning “substitute.”\n\nLiving vicariously is often done when someone’s live is relatively dull in comparison to someone else’s. With the danger, constant excitement, and potential wealth that is part of the hustle, drug dealers live a very exciting life, and Drake is demonstrating how interesting his own life is.\n\nThis song was recorded before Drake’s third mixtape, So Far Gone was released. Since, he has become one of the biggest names in the music industry, had romances with some of the most celebrated women in show business like Rihanna and Nicki Minaj, and broken countless industry records. It is safe to say that the excitement in Drake’s life is almost without par.", "annotation_id": "11708700", "url": "https://genius.com/11708700", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
