{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "PIMMIE’S DILEMMA", "line": "They gon’ let you do whatever And blame it on the liquor, oh", "vault_lines": ["They gon' let you do whatever", "And blame it on the liquor, oh"], "meaning": "Alcohol lowers inihibtion and often times can lead to undesirable behaviour. Which is why it can be used as an excuse, therefore it can cause mistrust and suspicion.", "annotation_id": "39501103", "url": "https://genius.com/39501103", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "PIMMIE’S DILEMMA", "line": "Can’t you wait? Don’t love nobody Spending time with people that don’t respect the love we got here", "vault_lines": ["Spending time with people that don't respect the love we got here", "Don't love nobody, oh, don't love nobody, oh-oh, oh", "Can't you wait? Don't love nobody"], "meaning": "Pimmie has an unbeliveble talent of adressing relationship dynamics and problems, here adressing the common problems in today’s society of how partying and clubbing is often a place where people don’t respect the boundries of a relationship. While attedning such events is completly normal it still can come with problems while in a comitted relationship.", "annotation_id": "39501038", "url": "https://genius.com/39501038", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
