{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "R.I.P.", "line": "You say you got baggage, well, I’m packed too", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "While the women confesses to her insecurities (“baggage”), Drake is focused having sex and claims to be well-endowed in that area (“packed”).", "annotation_id": "22643036", "url": "https://genius.com/22643036", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "R.I.P.", "line": "Plus I’m Young Money to the death, I took the Carter route", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Drake, at this time, was signed to Young Money Entertainment, which is led to Dwyane Carter (Lil Wayne).\n\nhttps://s3.amazonaws.com/filepicker-images-rapgenius/nolUEqxbRtyoGecbWlr3_weezy-drizzy", "annotation_id": "22643031", "url": "https://genius.com/22643031", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "R.I.P.", "line": "Can you feel my heart is beating? Can you feel my heart is beating?", "vault_lines": ["Can you feel my heart is beating?"], "meaning": "This line is sampled from Nneka’s song Heartbeat. The song also samples the music from the Chase & Status remix of Heartbeat, as heard below.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/9kBm6c3veSA?t=31", "annotation_id": "5206798", "url": "https://genius.com/5206798", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
