{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "NO SECRET", "line": "Then act like we friends", "vault_lines": ["Then act like we friends"], "meaning": "After taking what they need, these same people flip and act like they’ve always been close to him. Drake’s pointing to the superficial friendships that come with fame.", "annotation_id": "36604304", "url": "https://genius.com/36604304", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "NO SECRET", "line": "They tryna sink they teeth in", "vault_lines": ["They tryna sink they teeth in"], "meaning": "He’s saying people try to bite off him — whether that’s leeching off his success, copying his style, or benefiting from his platform.", "annotation_id": "36604302", "url": "https://genius.com/36604302", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "NO SECRET", "line": "I’m top dog, no secret, oh", "vault_lines": ["I'm top dog, no secret, oh"], "meaning": "This bar could be read on two ways\n\nDrake is simply asserting dominance in the rap game\n(“top dog”= alpha, leader, the best). He’s saying his status is obvious — no need to hide it.\n\nFans have connected “top dog” with Top Dawg Entertainment (TDE), Kendrick Lamar’s longtime label. In that reading, Drake could be slyly positioning himself as the real “top dog,” overshadowing Kendrick and his crew. Since Drake and Kendrick have a history of sneak disses going back to “Control” (2013) and “The Heart Part 4” (2017), the choice of words here feels intentional.\n\n“No secret” adds fuel — as if Drake is saying the industry already knows who’s on top, and it’s not Kendrick/TDE.\n\nComing from Drake, a master of subliminals, fans hear it as a carefully crafted shot rather than just coincidence.", "annotation_id": "36604242", "url": "https://genius.com/36604242", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "Drake", "song": "NO SECRET", "line": "I walked out the precinct", "vault_lines": ["I walked out the precinct"], "meaning": "Drake Shares Letter From Swedish Police After Team Denies He Was Arrested", "annotation_id": "26582276", "url": "https://genius.com/26582276", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
